<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">- Tsishingini (tsw)</book>
  <para style="h">Mekece</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mkc</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mekece</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mekece</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mekece</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mekece</para>
  <para style="is">Ucuɗuwu wa Aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="im">Aatagada e Mekece a casu alabari a aza a Isra'ila zuzu na̱ mantsa ma a'wan amunga diga mantsa ma na a lyawa Masasan ma Sinai hali a rawa upasu wu utyo wa asana wi iɗa i na A̱sula̱ a yuwain nzuwulai u ta ca le. Aala a aatagada'a u ta sapishi a̱ tyo e ili i gbain ya alabari'i, za na a̱yi ɗa mekece ma aza a Isra'ila ma na Musa yuwain a Masasan ma Sinai kafu a̱ 'yon uba̱ta̱'a̱, a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Mowa waru, asana o Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu, zuzu na̱ limatan ve elime ɗe elime wa'a. A̱tsuma̱ e memere me mekere n re'e, aza a Isra'ila a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ Kadesh Baniya upasu wu uyagi wu utyo wa Ka'ana, agba a gura uwa e iɗa i na a yuwaan nle nzuwulai na̱ nɗe shi. Ana a yuwain a'wan na̱ a̱bunda̱ upasu'u, reve a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo upasu wa asana wu Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu, uba̱ta̱ u na akapi a ama a̱ da̱nuyi reve akapi waru o foɓoi adama a pasa Urudu a uwa a̱tsuma̱ a Ka'ana.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aatagada e Mekece alabari a ama a ɗa aza a na okolo e le a tsu kuɗusa kuci na a uwwai wovon a mantsa ma̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱, aza a na waru a yuwayin A̱sula̱ aciyogbamu na̱ Musa za na A̱sula̱ a ɗangwai u rono le aɗanga. Alabari a̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱ A̱sula̱ a ɗa, na̱ cine wa̱a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ ama a̱ yi kuci, suru nu ulambu wu ucira nu ulambu u tsutoni tsa̱ le, na̱ mishin mu ucira ma Musa, na̱ mantsa mo ro na u tsu kuɗa̱ a yuwan ankuri, nu ucawu wa aci a̱ tyo e ekere nu uba̱ta̱ wa ama a̱ yi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ili i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="io1">Aza a Isra'ila o foɓo ta̱ adama a̱ 'yon a Masasan ma Sinai 1:1-9:23</para>
  <para style="io2">Mekece mo ufaru 1:1-4:49</para>
  <para style="io2">Wila̱ icu'un icu'un ni ili i na a̱a̱ kuru 5:1-8:26</para>
  <para style="io2">Mapasa me ire 9:1-23</para>
  <para style="io1">Diga a Masasan ma Sinai a̱ tyo Mowa 10:1-21:35</para>
  <para style="io1">Ili i na a yuwain a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Mowa 22:1-32:42</para>
  <para style="io1">Ukoɗu wu mmalu diga Masar a̱ tyo Mowa 33:1-49</para>
  <para style="io1">Mmalu ma aza a Isra'ila diga Masar a̱ tyo Mowa 33:1-49</para>
  <para style="io1">Wila̱ kafu a pasa Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu 33:50-36:13.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1" />
  <para style="s">Mekece</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ Musa a̱ A̱tsumona a Sinai o Oogodo o Uga'asusan, o urana wu ufaru u woto we ire, a aa'wan e ire ana aza a Isra'ila o uta̱i e iɗa ya Masar, u damma, <verse eid="NUM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu na̱ Haruna i kece oɓolo a ama a Isra'ila suru, gundo gundo nu umatsun umatsun, i ɗana ala a ali suru. <verse eid="NUM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3" />I te gere le ukasu ukasu diga a'wan ushin a gawan aza a na rawai a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon. <verse eid="NUM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4" />Vu zuwa vuma ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e elentsu suru za na a̱yi ɗa zagbain a̱tsuma̱ o umatsun u kamba ɗu. <verse eid="NUM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5" />Apa nda ala a ama a na aa kamba ɗu: uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Roben, Elizu ulobo wa Shedeya. <verse eid="NUM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6" />Diga o ugundo wa Saminu, Shelumiye ulobo wa Zurishadai. <verse eid="NUM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7" />Diga o ugundo wa Yahuza, Nashon ulobo wa Aminada. <verse eid="NUM 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8" />Diga o ugundo wa Isaka, Nataniya ulobo wa̱ Zowa. <verse eid="NUM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9" />Diga o ugundo wa Zebulun, Eliyabu ulobo wa Helon. <verse eid="NUM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10" />Diga o olobo a̱ Isuhu ya Ifiramu, Elishama ulobo wa Amihu. O ugundo wa Manase, Gamaliya ulobo wa Fedazu. <verse eid="NUM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11" />Diga o ugundo wa Banyami, Abidan ulobo wa Gidiyoni. <verse eid="NUM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12" />Diga o ugundo wa Dan, Ahiyeza ulobo wa Amishadai. <verse eid="NUM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13" />Diga o ugundo wa Asha, Fagiye ulobo wa Okiran. <verse eid="NUM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14" />Diga o ugundo wa Gadu, Eliyasa ulobo wa Deyuwe. <verse eid="NUM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15" />Diga o ugundo wa Nafutali, Ahira ulobo wa Enan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16" />Ele nda ele ɗa ama a na a ɗangwai a̱tsuma̱ o oɓolo a ama'a, azagbain e elentsu a nkaya n le, azagbain a 'wa va aza a Isra'ila.<verse eid="NUM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17" />Reve Musa na̱ Haruna tara ama a nda a na a cayi ala e le'e, <verse eid="NUM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:18" />reve o ɓoloto ama suru uba̱ta̱ u ta̱ o urana wu ufaru u woto we ire. Reve a ɗana le diga a nkaya n le na̱ matsun le. A ɗana le ta̱ diga aza a a'wan ushin a gawan aci aci, <verse eid="NUM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19" />cine A̱sulazuva a zuwai Musa yuwan. Ne ɗa u kece nle a̱ A̱tsumona a Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20" />Diga o ugundo wa̱ Roben, mawun mo ufaru ma Isra'ila:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:20">Ali suru a na a̱ ri a'wan ushin ko a pasai aza a na a rawai a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon e gere le ta̱ na ala e le aci aci diga a nkaya n le na̱ gundo le nu umatsun u le. <verse eid="NUM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 1:21" />A̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei o ugundo wa̱ Roben ele ɗa ali ukpakukupa amunga nu ukpakukupa uta̱li nu ukpakuton. (46,500).<verse eid="NUM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 1:22" />Diga o ugundo wa Saminu:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:22">Ali a na a̱ ri a'wan ushin nu upasu aza a na a rawai a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon suru a ɗana le ta̱ na ala e le aci aci diga a nkaya n le na̱ gundo le nu umatsun u le. <verse eid="NUM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 1:23" />A̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei o ugundo wa Saminu ele ɗa ali ukpakukupa kupoton nu ukpakukupa kucci nu ukpakuta'atsu (59,300).<verse eid="NUM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 1:24" />Diga o ugundo wa Gadu:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:24">Ali a na a̱ ri a'wan ushin ko a pasai aza a na a rawai a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon suru a ɗana le ta̱ na ala e le diga a nkaya n le na̱ gundo le nu umatsun u le. <verse eid="NUM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 1:25" />A̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei o ugundo wa Gadu ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa amunga nu ukpakukupa uton nu ukpakuta̱li na̱ kupoton (45,650).<verse eid="NUM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 1:26" />Diga o ugundo wa Yahuza:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:26">Ali a na a̱ ri a'wan ushin ko a pasai aza a na a rawai a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon suru a ɗana le ta̱ na ala e le diga a nkaya n le na̱ gundo le nu umatsun u le. <verse eid="NUM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 1:27" />A̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei o ugundo wa Yahuza ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa kupocindere nu ukpakukupa una̱shi nu ukpakuta̱li (74,600).<verse eid="NUM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 1:28" />Diga o ugundo wa Isaka:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:28">Ali a na a̱ ri a'wan ushin ko a pasai aza a na a rawai a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon suru a ɗana le ta̱ na ala e le diga a nkaya n le na̱ gundo le nu umatsun u le. <verse eid="NUM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 1:29" />A̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei o ugundo wa Isaka ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa kupoton nu ukpakukupa una̱shi nu ukpakuna̱shi (54,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 1:30" />Diga o ugundo wa Zebulun:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:30">Ali a na a̱ ri a'wan ushin ko a pasai aza a na a rawai a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon suru a ɗana le ta̱ na ala e le diga a nkaya n le na̱ gundo le nu umatsun u le. <verse eid="NUM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 1:31" />A̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei diga o ugundo wa Zebulun ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa kupoton nu ukpakukupa ucindere nu ukpakuna̱shi (57,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 1:32" />Diga o ugundo wa̱ Isuhu ya Ifiramu:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:32">Ali a na a̱ ri a'wan ushin ko a pasai aza a na a rawai a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon suru a ɗana le ta̱ na ala e le diga a nkaya n le na̱ gundo le nu umatsun u le. <verse eid="NUM 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 1:33" />A̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei o ugundo wa Ifiramu ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa amunga nu ukpakuton (40,500).<verse eid="NUM 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 1:34" />Diga o ugundo wa Manase:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:34">Ali a na a̱ ri a'wan ushin ko a pasai aza a na a rawai a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon suru a ɗana le ta̱ na ala e le diga a nkaya n le na̱ gundo le nu umatsun u le. <verse eid="NUM 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 1:35" />A̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei o ugundo wa Manase ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa mata'atsu nu ukpakukupa ure nu ukpakure (32,200).<verse eid="NUM 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 1:36" />Diga o ugundo wa Banyami:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:36">Ali a na a̱ ri a'wan ushin ko a pasai aza a na a rawai a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon suru a ɗana le ta̱ na ala e le diga a nkaya n le na̱ gundo le nu umatsun u le. <verse eid="NUM 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 1:37" />A̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei o ugundo wa Banyami ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa mata'atsu nu ukpakukupa uton nu ukpakuna̱shi (35,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 1:38" />Diga o ugundo wa Dan:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:38">Ali a na a̱ ri a'wan ushin ko a pasai aza a na a rawai a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon suru a ɗana le ta̱ na ala e le diga a nkaya n le na̱ gundo le nu umatsun u le. <verse eid="NUM 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 1:39" />A̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei o ugundo wa Dan ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa kupota̱li nu ukpakukupa ure nu ukpakucindere (62,700).<verse eid="NUM 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 1:40" />Diga o ugundo wa Asha: Ali a na a̱ ri a'wan ushin ko a pasai aza a na a rawai a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon suru a ɗana le ta̱ na ala e le diga a nkaya n le na̱ gundo le nu umatsun u le. <verse eid="NUM 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 1:41" />A̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei diga o ugundo wa Asha ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa amunga nu ukpakukupa nu ukpakuton (41,500).<verse eid="NUM 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 1:42" />Diga o ugundo wa Nafutali:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:42">Ali a na a̱ ri a'wan ushin ko a pasai aza a na a rawai a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon suru a ɗana le ta̱ na ala e le diga a nkaya n le na̱ gundo le nu umatsun u le. <verse eid="NUM 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 1:43" />A̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei o ugundo wa Nafutali ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa kupoton nu ukpakukupa uta'atsu nu ukpakuna̱shi (53,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 1:44" />Ele nda ele ɗa aza a na Musa na̱ Haruna e kecei oɓolo ni ikambi ya azagbain kupa ne ejere ya aza a Isra'ila, vuma ta̱ suru o una̱ wu umatsun wu u'wa u le. <verse eid="NUM 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 1:45" />Ne ɗa e kecei aza a Isra'ila aza a na a̱ ri na a'wan ushin a gawan aza a na a rawai a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon o una̱ wu 'wa vu matsun le. <verse eid="NUM 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:46" />A̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei suru suru ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa ukpaku uta̱li nu ukpakukupa uta'atsu nu ukpakuton na̱ kupoton (603,550).<verse eid="NUM 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47" />Agba e kece ugundo wa̱ Levi o una̱ wu 'wa vu nkaya n le oɓolo na akapi shi. <verse eid="NUM 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱ ɗe Musa, a na, <verse eid="NUM 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49" />&lt;&lt;Ugundo wa̱ Levi u ɗa goon vee kece shi. She vu kece le oɓolo na aza a Isra'ila wan. <verse eid="NUM 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50" />Amma vu zuwa le a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ Oogodo o Uga'asusan, ni itana yu ulinga ya̱ yi ni ili i na i ri pe suru. Ele ɗa aa tanu oogodoꞌo ni itana ya̱ yi suru, reve o goloɓuso yi. Reve a̱ va̱la̱ uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="NUM 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:51" />A mantsa ma na oogodoꞌo a̱a̱ 'yon, nan Levi ɗa a̱ mula̱ yi. A mantsa ma na waru a̱a̱ shuwisa̱ yi ele ɗa a̱a̱ shuwa̱ yi. Na̱ vuma ro ko'o rawa zuzu na̱ a̱yi, a̱ to una yi. <verse eid="NUM 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52" />Aza a Isra'ila a̱ ta̱ shuwa̱ oogodo e le gundo gundo za suru o uva̱la̱ta̱ wa̱ yi, waru za suru uba̱ta̱ wa atuta a̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53" />Agba nan Levi a̱ ta̱ va̱la̱ a̱ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ Oogodo o Uga'asusan adama upan u riya̱a̱ oɓolo a aza a Isra'ila wan. Nan Levi a ɗa a̱ ri n goloɓuso Oogodo o Uga'asusa'an.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54" />Ne ɗa aza a Isra'ila a yuwain cine A̱sulazuva a zuwai Musa.<verse eid="NUM 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2" />
  <para style="s">Ugeru wu uva̱la̱ta̱ gundo gundo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ Musa na̱ Haruna u damma, <verse eid="NUM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2" />&lt;&lt;Aza a Isra'ila a̱ ta̱ va̱la̱ utakatsuwu a̱ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ Oogodo o Uga'asusan, u'wa suru uba̱ta̱ wa atuta wu ugundo u le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3" />Aza a na a̱a̱ va̱la̱ upasu wa asana, upasu u na urana u tsu uta̱ ele ɗa ugundo wa Yahuza uba̱ta̱ wa atuta e le o una̱ wo oɓolo e le. Zagbain va ama a Yahuza a̱yi ɗa Nashon ulobo wa Aminada. <verse eid="NUM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4" />A̱bunda̱ o oɓolo a̱ yi a ɗa ama ukpakukupa kupocindere nu ukpakukupa una̱shi nu ukpakuta̱li (74,600).<verse eid="NUM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5" />Ugundo wa Isaka u ɗa wa̱a̱ va̱la̱ zuzu ne ele. Zagbain vu ugundo wa Isaka a̱yi ɗa Nataniya ulobo wa̱ Zowa. <verse eid="NUM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6" />A̱bunda̱ o oɓolo a̱ yi a ɗa ama ukpakukupa kupoton nu ukpakukupa una̱shi nu ukpakuna̱shi (54,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7" />Reve ugundo wa̱ Zebulun u kuru. Zagbain vu u'wa wa Zebulun a̱yi ɗa Eliyabu ulobo wa Helon. <verse eid="NUM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8" />A̱bunda̱ o oɓolo a̱ yi a ɗa ama ukpakukupa kupoton nu ukpakukupa ucindere nu ukpakuna̱shi (57,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9" />A̱bunda̱ o oɓolo a na a̱ ri upasu wa Yahuza suru suru a rawa ta̱ ama ukpakukupa ukpaku nu ukpakukupa kupakunla̱ nu ukpakukupa uta̱li nu ukpakuna̱shi (186,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10" />Aza a na a̱a̱ va̱la̱ upasu wu uyagi ele ɗa ugundo wa̱ Roben uba̱ta̱ wa atuta e le. Zagbain vu ugundo wa̱ Roben a̱yi ɗa Elizu ulobo wa Shedeya. <verse eid="NUM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11" />A̱bunda̱ o oɓolo a̱ yi ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa amunga nu ukpakukupa uta̱li nu ukpakuton (46,500).<verse eid="NUM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12" />Aza a na a̱a̱ va̱la̱ zuzu ne ele ɗa ugundo wa Saminu. Zagbain vu ugundo wa Saminu a̱yi ɗa Shelumiye ulobo wa Zurishadai. <verse eid="NUM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13" />A̱bunda̱ o oɓolo a̱ yi a rawa ta̱ ama ukpakukupa kupoton nu ukpakukupa kucci nu ukpakuta'atsu (59,300).<verse eid="NUM 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14" />Reve ugundo wa Gadu u kuru. Zagbain vu ugundo wa Gadu a̱yi ɗa Eliyasa ulobo wa Reyuwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Reyuwe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">&lt;&lt;Reyuwe&gt;&gt; na̱ &lt;&lt;Reyuwe&gt;&gt; aala a̱ ta̱ a ɗa, adama o ndolo ozo o ro a zuwa yi ta̱.</char></note>. <verse eid="NUM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15" />A̱bunda̱ o oɓolo a̱ yi a rawa ta̱ ama ukpakukupa amunga nu ukpakukupa uton nu ukpakuta̱li na̱ kupoton (45,650).<verse eid="NUM 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16" />Suru suru a̱bunda̱ o oɓolo a na a̱ ri e eɓele o ugundo wa̱ Roben o uva̱la̱ta̱'a̱ ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa ukpaku nu ukpakukupa kupoton nu ukpakukupa nu ukpakuna̱shi na̱ kupoton (151,450). Ele ɗa a̱ kuru ire a mantsa mo u'yosun.<verse eid="NUM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17" />Reve nan Levi a̱ kuru e memere mo oɓolo me re'e utanuwu no Oogodo o Uga'asusan. A̱ ta̱ 'yon ugeru cine a̱ va̱la̱i, za suru uba̱ta̱ wa atuta o ugundo wa̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18" />Upasu wa̱ a̱livu u to o'wo uva̱la̱ta̱ wo oɓolo a Ifiramu uba̱ta̱ wa atuta e le. Zagbain vu ugundo wa Ifiramu a̱yi ɗa Elishama ulobo wa Amihu. <verse eid="NUM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19" />A̱bunda̱ o oɓolo a̱ yi ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa amunga nu ukpakuton (40,500).<verse eid="NUM 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20" />Reve ugundo wa Manase u kuru le. Zagbain vu ugundo wa Manase a̱yi ɗa Gamaliya ulobo wa Fedazu. <verse eid="NUM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21" />A̱bunda̱ o oɓolo a̱ yi ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa mata'atsu nu ukpakukupa ure nu ukpakure (32,200).<verse eid="NUM 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22" />Reve ugundo wa Banyami u kuru. Zagbain vu ugundo wa Banyami a̱yi ɗa Abidan ulobo wa Gidiyoni. <verse eid="NUM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23" />A̱bunda̱ o oɓolo a̱ yi ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa mata'atsu nu ukpakukupa uton nu ukpakuna̱shi (35,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24" />Suru suru a̱bunda̱ o oɓolo e eɓele a Ifiramu ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa ukpaku nu ukpakukupa kunla̱ nu ukpaku (108,100). Ele ɗa a̱a̱ kuru ta'atsu o u'yosun.<verse eid="NUM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25" />Upasu wu ugana u to o'wo oɓolo a Dan uba̱ta̱ wa atuta e le. Zagbain vu ugundo wa Dan a̱yi ɗa Ahiyeza ulobo wa Amishadai. <verse eid="NUM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26" />A̱bunda̱ o oɓolo a̱ yi ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa kupota̱li nu ukpakukupa ure nu ukpakucindere (62,700).<verse eid="NUM 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27" />Aza a na a̱a̱ va̱la̱ zuzu ne ele, ele ɗa ugundo wa Asha. Zagbain vu ugundo wa Asha a̱yi ɗa Fagiye ulobo wo Okiran. <verse eid="NUM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28" />A̱bunda̱ o oɓolo a̱ yi ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa amunga nu ukpakukupa nu ukpakuton (41,500).<verse eid="NUM 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29" />Aza a na a̱a̱ va̱la̱ zuzu ne ele, ele ɗa ugundo wa Nafutali. Zagbain vu ugundo va Nafutali a̱yi ɗa Ahira ulobo wa Enan. <verse eid="NUM 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30" />A̱bunda̱ o oɓolo a̱ yi ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa kupoton nu ukpakukupa uta'atsu nu ukpakuna̱shi (53,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31" />Suru suru a̱bunda̱ o oɓolo e eɓele a Dan ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa ukpaku nu ukpakukupa kupoton nu ukpakukupa ucindere nu ukpakuta̱li (157,600). Ele ɗa oo koso 'yon oɓolo na atuta e le.<verse eid="NUM 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32" />Apa nda a̱bunda̱ a aza a Isra'ila a na e kecei o ugeru wu 'wa vu nkaya n le. Suru aza a na a̱ shi uva̱lu oɓolo oɓolo ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa ukpakuta̱li nu ukpakukupa uta'atsu nu ukpakuton na̱ kupoton (603,550). <verse eid="NUM 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33" />Amma e kece nan Levi oɓolo na akapi a aza a Isra'ila shi, cine A̱sulazuva a dammai Musa.<verse eid="NUM 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34" />Ne ɗa aza a Isra'ila a yuwain ili biti cine A̱sulazuva a dammai Musa. Ne ɗa a̱ va̱la̱i ba̱ta̱ va atuta e le, ne ɗa waru a̱ 'yoyin za suru nu ugundo wa̱ yi nu u'wa u tsukaya tsa̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 2:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3" />
  <para style="s">Olobo a Haruna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1" />Ele nda ele ɗa ugundo wa Haruna na̱ Musa a mantsa ma na A̱sulazuva a yuwain adanshi na̱ Musa a Masasan ma Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2" />Apa nda ala o olobo a Haruna: Nadab mawun mo ufaru na̱ Abihu na̱ Eliyaza na̱ Itama. <verse eid="NUM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3" />Ele nda ele ɗa ala o olobo a Haruna, nan ganu na a̱ tsuwa̱yin mani'in na a tawai adama a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ a tsuganu. <verse eid="NUM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4" />Amma Nadab na̱ Abihu a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva adama a na a cayi A̱sulazuva kucci va akina a na a ntsayi shi A̱tsumona a Sinai, agba a lyawa olobo shi. Adama o ndolo Eliyaza na̱ Itama ɗa yuwain ulinga u tsuganu a mantsa ma wuma wa Haruna dada le.<verse eid="NUM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulinga u nan Levi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Musa u damma, <verse eid="NUM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6" />&lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱ na ama o ugundo wa̱ Levi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma Haruna ganu, adama a kamba yi. <verse eid="NUM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7" />A ta yuwaan yi ulinga na ama a Isra'ila suru a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n mo Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8" />O to goloɓo itana yo Oogodo o Uga'asusan. Reve a yuwan ulinga adama a ama a Isra'ila o ure wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ o oogodo'o. <verse eid="NUM 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9" />Ili i na nan Levi aa yuwan a̱yi ɗa a yuwaan Haruna no olobo a̱ yi ulinga. <verse eid="NUM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10" />Vu zuwa Haruna no olobo a̱ yi a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ a tsuganu. Agba nna̱ vuma ro ko'o rawa zuzu na̱ a̱a̱'isa̱'a̱ a̱ to una yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Musa u damma, <verse eid="NUM 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12" />&lt;&lt;N tara ta̱ nan Levi a̱tsuma̱ a aza a Isra'ila o una̱ wu ulobo wu ufaru suru ma na ma fara kpa̱tu'wa̱i umatsutsun wa aza a Isra'ila. Nan Levi o to o'wo a̱za̱ a̱ va̱, <verse eid="NUM 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:13" />adama a na mawun mo ufaru suru za va̱ ɗa. Urana u na mu unai muwun mu ufaru suru e iɗa ya Masar, n tawaa ta̱ aciya̱va̱ mawun mo ufaru ma Isra'ila suru, ko vaɗilima̱ ko vi iliyamunga. O to o'wo a̱za̱ a̱ va̱. A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Musa a̱ A̱tsumona a Sinai u damma, <verse eid="NUM 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15" />&lt;&lt;Vu kece ugundo wa̱ Levi o una̱ wu umatsun na̱ tsukaya tse le. Vu kece ulobo suru za na ri woto u ta̱ nu umatsun a gawan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16" />Ɗaɗa Musa kece nle cine A̱sulazuva a damma niyi.<verse eid="NUM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17" />Apa nda ala o olobo a̱ Levi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 3:17">Gashon na̱ Koha na̱ Merari.<verse eid="NUM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18" />Apa nda ala o olobo a Gashon o umatsun u le:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 3:18">Libini na̱ Shimeyi.<verse eid="NUM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19" />Apa nda ala o olobo a̱ Koha o umatsun u le:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 3:19">Amuram na̱ Iza na̱ Heburon na̱ Uziye.<verse eid="NUM 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20" />Olobo a Merari waru o umatsun u le ele ɗa:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 3:20">Mali na̱ Mushi. Ele ɗa mmaci ma̱ Levi o umatsun u le.<verse eid="NUM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21" />O ugundo wa Gashon u ɗa umatsun wa Libini na̱ Shimeyi o uta̱i. Ele ɗa aza a Gashon. <verse eid="NUM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22" />A̱bunda̱ e le suru a ali aza a na a̱ ri woto u ta̱ nu umatsun a gawan aza a na e kecei ele ɗa ukpakukupa ucindere nu ukpakuton (7,500). <verse eid="NUM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23" />Umatsun wa Gashon u ɗa wa̱a̱ va̱la̱ a̱livu a̱ca̱pa̱ o Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24" />Eliyasa ulobo wa Laye a̱yi ɗa zagbain vu u'wa wa Gashon. <verse eid="NUM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25" />Ulinga wu umatsun wa Gashon o Oogodo o Uga'asusan a̱yi ɗa ugoloɓuso wo oogodo'o na aapalutsu a̱ yi, nu umuna wu una̱ntsu wa̱ yi, <verse eid="NUM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26" />nu umuna wu ukowo nu umuna wu una̱ntsu wa agalaci a na a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱i Oogodo o Uga'asusan na̱ masa'a na amunga ni ili i na suru a tsu yuwaan ulinga ne ele.<verse eid="NUM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27" />O ugundo wa̱ Koha u ɗa umatsun wa Amuram na̱ Izaha na̱ Heburon na̱ Uziye o uta̱i. Ele nda ele ɗa ugundo wa̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Koha. <verse eid="NUM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28" />A̱bunda̱ e le suru a ali aza a na a̱ ri woto u ta̱ nu umatsun a gawan ele ɗa ukpakukupa kunla̱ nu ukpakuta̱li (8,600). Ele ɗa a̱za̱ o ugoloɓuso wa̱ a̱a̱'isa̱. <verse eid="NUM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29" />Umatsun wu ugundo wa̱ Koha u ɗa a̱a̱ va̱la̱ upasu wu uyagi wo Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30" />Elizafan ulobo wa̱ Uziye u ɗa zagbain vu umatsun wa̱ Koha. <verse eid="NUM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31" />Ulinga u le a̱yi ɗa o goloɓo Akpati a Nzuwulai na apada na̱ wisawatan wi ifitila na̱ musa'a ni itana yu ulinga ya̱ a̱a̱'isa̱ i na a tsu yuwaan a̱ga̱nda̱, nu umuna ni ili i na a tsu yuwaan ulinga ne ele suru. <verse eid="NUM 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32" />Eliyaza ulobo wa Haruna ganu a̱yi ɗa zagbain va azagbain vu ugundo wa̱ Levi. A̱yi ɗa a ɗangwai aci a aza a na o goloɓuso Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33" />O ugundo wa Merari u ɗa umatsun wa Mali na̱ Mushi o uta̱i. Ele ɗa ugundo wa Merari. <verse eid="NUM 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34" />A̱bunda̱ e le suru a ali aza a na a̱ ri woto u ta̱ nu umatsun a gawan ele ɗa ukpakukupa uta̱li nu ukpakure (6,200). <verse eid="NUM 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35" />Zagbain vu umatsun wa Merari a̱yi ɗa Zuriye ulobo wa Abihayi. Ele ɗa a̱a̱ va̱la̱ upasu wu ugana wo Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36" />Ulinga u na a ɗangwa nle a yuwan a̱yi ɗa ugoloɓuso wa akpata a̱ nge'en mo oogodoꞌo na aɗanga a̱ yi ni ikyun ya̱ yi ni itana i le suru, ni itana i na aa yuwusan ulinga ne ele suru. <verse eid="NUM 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37" />Ele ɗa waru oo goloɓo atsura a na a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱i oogodoꞌo na̱ nkyun n le ni irumu i ma̱shuwa̱ ma̱ le na amunga e le.<verse eid="NUM 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38" />Musa na̱ Haruna no olobo a̱ yi ele ɗa a̱a̱ va̱la̱ elime o oogodoꞌo na asana upasu u na urana u tsu uta̱. Ele ɗa a̱a̱ da̱na̱ o goloɓuso a̱a̱'isa̱'a̱ o una̱ wa aza a Isra'ila. Na̱ vuma ro ko'o rawa zuzu no oogodoꞌo a̱ to una yi. <verse eid="NUM 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39" />A̱bunda̱ a nan Levi a na A̱sulazuva a zuwai Musa na̱ Haruna e kece diga a matsun le ali woto u ta̱ nu umatsun a gawan ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa ushin nu ukpakukupa ure (22,000).<verse eid="NUM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Musa, &lt;&lt;Kece muwun mu ufaru mo olobo ma aza a Isra'ila suru diga woto u ta̱ nu umatsun a gawan, reve vu gere ala e le. <verse eid="NUM 3:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41" />Reve vu taraa mu nan Levi suru o una̱ u muwun mu ufaru ma aza a Isra'ila, ni iliyamunga i nan Levi o una̱ wu umatsun wu ufaru wi iliyamunga ya aza a Isra'ila. A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 3:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42" />Ɗaɗa Musa kecei muwun mu ufaru ma ali ma aza a Isra'ila suru cine A̱sulazuva a zuwa niyi u yuwan. <verse eid="NUM 3:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43" />A̱bunda̱ a̱ muwun mu ufaru ma ali suru aza o woto u ta̱ nu umatsun a gawan a na a ɗanai na ala e le ele ɗa ukpakukupa ushin nu ukpakukupa ure nu ukpakure na̱ kupocindere na aza a ta'atsu (22,273).<verse eid="NUM 3:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Musa u damma, <verse eid="NUM 3:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45" />&lt;&lt;Tara nan Levi o una̱ u muwun mu ufaru ma ali ma aza a Isra'ila suru, ni iliyamunga i nan Levi o una̱ wi iliyamunga ya aza a Isra'ila. Nan Levi o to o'wo a̱za̱ a̱ va̱. A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="NUM 3:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46" />Muwun mu ufaru ma aza a Isra'ila n la'a ta̱ nan Levi na ama ukpakure na̱ kupocindere na aza a ta'atsu (273) adama o ndolo a tsupaa akapi a na a la'ayi'i. <verse eid="NUM 3:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47" />Vu ushi azurufa ton adama a vuma ta̱ biti u makundatsu ma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱. Za na ri nu ume u gera ushin. <verse eid="NUM 3:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48" />Reve vu ca Haruna no olobo a̱ yi ikebe ya atsupu'u.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 3:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49" />Ɗaɗa Musa ushiyi ikebe ya atsupu i muwun mu ufaru ma aza a Isra'ila aza a na a pasai a̱bunda̱ a ama a na nan Levi a tsupayi'i. <verse eid="NUM 3:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50" />U ushi ta̱ ikebe ukpakukupa nu ukpakuta'atsu na̱ kupota̱li no ozo o ton (1,365) u makundatsu ma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱ e ekere e le. <verse eid="NUM 3:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51" />Reve Musa ca Haruna no olobo a̱ yi ikebe ya atsupu'u, cine A̱sulazuva a damma niyi u yuwan.<verse eid="NUM 3:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4" />
  <para style="s">Ulinga wu ugundo wa̱ Koha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Musa na̱ Haruna u damma, <verse eid="NUM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2" />&lt;&lt;Kecei ali o ugundo wa̱ Koha ko'o a̱tsuma̱ o umatsun u nan Levi o una̱ wu gundo le na̱ matsun vu nkaya n le. <verse eid="NUM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3" />I kece ali aza a na a̱ ri na a'wan mata'atsu a̱ tyo kupoton aza a na a rawai a yuwan ulinga o Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4" />Apa nda ulinga u limatan va̱ Koha o Oogodo o Uga'asusan: ugoloɓuso wi ili i na i la'ai akiza. <verse eid="NUM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5" />A mantsa ma na ya̱a̱ 'yon diga o uva̱la̱ta̱, Haruna no olobo a̱ yi a ta uwa pe o oogodo'o, reve a̱ ba̱ɗa̱ umuna u na wee gesheshe Upasu u na u La'ai Akiza, reve a pala Akpati a Nzuwulai na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="NUM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6" />Reve a pala yi na̱ kwan va̱ a̱giri'i a na a̱ sukuta̱i a̱vu waru a pala zuva va̱ yi nu umuna u mini ma̱ bulu. Reve o oto yi aɗanga o utanusu wa̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu o polo umuna u mini ma̱ bulu zuva va apada o opopofu a na a tawai a̱ nge'en. Reve a zuwa ntaɗa na̱ mpara na asa'atsu na̱ ndele adama a̱ kucci vi ili yo oso. Opopofu a na a̱ tsu da̱na̱ lo uzuwu a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ ɗe uzuwu. <verse eid="NUM 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8" />Reve a pala ili i nda nu umuna u shili, reve a pala le na̱ kwan va̱ a̱giri'i a na a̱ sukuta̱i. Reve o oto yi aɗanga o utanusu wa̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9" />A̱vu a tara umuna u mini ma̱ bulu a pala wisawatan u fitila, oɓolo ni ifitila ya̱ yi na̱ makkana mo ukimususa̱n wa akina na̱ mutaɗa ma̱ yi na̱ muden m mani'in ma na a̱ tsu tsuwa̱a̱n yi. <verse eid="NUM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10" />Reve a katala wisawatan u fitila'a oɓolo ni itana ya̱ yi wupalu na̱ kwan va̱ a̱giri'i a na a̱ sukuta̱i, a̱vu a zuwa yi a akpata a na a tsu tanu yi.<verse eid="NUM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11" />&lt;&lt;A ta pala masa'a ma zinariya'a nu umuna u mini ma̱ bulu, reve a pala yi na̱ kwan va̱ a̱giri'i a na a̱ sukuta̱i. A̱vu o oto yi aɗanga o utanusu wa̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12" />&lt;&lt;A ta tara itana i na a yuwusan ulinga ne ele a̱ a̱a̱'isa̱, reve a katala le nu umuna u mini ma̱ bulu. A̱vu a pala le na̱ kwan va̱ a̱giri'i a na a̱ sukuta̱i, a̱vu a zuwa le a akpata a na a tsu tanu le.<verse eid="NUM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13" />&lt;&lt;A̱ ta̱ pura̱ okomo a masa'a'a reve a pala masa'a'a nu umuna wu shili u ma̱ɗiya̱. <verse eid="NUM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14" />Reve a zuwa ɗe itana i na a yuwusaan ulinga a masa'a'a suru, ele nda, ataɗa a akina ni ikune ya akatsu ni isheburu na akwanu a gbagbain, itana yu ulinga a masa'a'a suru. Reve a pala yi na̱ kwan va̱ a̱giri'i a na a̱ sukuta̱i. Reve o oto yi aɗanga o utanusu wa̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15" />Na̱ Haruna no olobo a̱ yi o koto wupalu wu uba̱ta̱ wa akiza'a ni itana yu uba̱ta̱'a̱ suru mantsa ma na oɓolo a cigai a̱ 'yon, reve ugundo wa̱ Koha a̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱ tanu le. Agba she a̱ ju'wa̱n ili ya akiza wan adama a̱ kuwa̱ wan. Ele nda ele ɗa itana yo Oogodo o Uga'asusan i na ugundo wa̱ Koha waa tanu.<verse eid="NUM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16" />&lt;&lt;Eliyaza ulobo wa Haruna ganu ɗa a̱a̱ da̱na̱ a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ mani'in me ifitila ni ili i ma̱guru na̱ kucci vi ishina na a tsu casu kuci na̱ mani'in mo utsusun. A̱yi ɗa wa̱a̱ da̱na̱ a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ oogodoꞌo ma̱ɓula̱ ma̱ yi ni ili i ri pe suru, oɓolo nu uba̱ta̱ wa akiza ni itana yu ulinga ya̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Musa na̱ Haruna u damma, <verse eid="NUM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18" />&lt;&lt;She i lyawa ugundo wa̱ Koha u koto a̱tsuma̱ a nan Levi wan. <verse eid="NUM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 4:19" />Apa nda cine yaa yuwan ne ele adama a̱ kuwa̱ wan na a rawa zuzu ni itana i na i la'ai akiza wan: Haruna no olobo a̱ yi a ɗa a uwa pe reve a ca za suru ulinga u na waa yuwan ni ili i na waa tanu. <verse eid="NUM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:20" />Amma she a̱za̱ a̱ Koha a uwa adama e ene itana ya akiza wan ta̱wa̱ a̱ kuwa̱ wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulinga wu ugundo wa Gashon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Musa, u damma, <verse eid="NUM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22" />&lt;&lt;Kece ali o ugundo wa Gashon o una̱ wu gundo le na̱ matsun vu nkaya n le. <verse eid="NUM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23" />Diga aza a na a̱ ri na a'wan mata'atsu a̱ tyo kupoton nu umatsun, vu ɗana le aza a na suru a rawai a yuwan ulinga o Oogodo o Uga'asusan.<verse eid="NUM 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24" />&lt;&lt;Apa nda ulinga wu umatsun wa Gashon, a̱tsuma̱ a mayan ma̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ nu utanusu wi itana: <verse eid="NUM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25" />Ele ɗa aa tanu Oogodo o Uga'asusan na apalutsu a̱ yi, za va̱ a̱tsuma̱ na̱ za va alanga na apalutsu a kwan va̱ a̱giri'i a na a̱ sukuta̱i a na a̱ ri zuva va̱ yi nu umuna wu una̱ntsu wo Oogodo o Uga'asusa'an. <verse eid="NUM 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26" />Ele ɗa waru aa tanu umuna wa agalaci na̱ za vu u'uwata wu una̱ntsu wa agalaci u na u ka̱nda̱ruwa̱i Oogodo o Uga'asusan na̱ masa'a na amunga e le ni itana yu ulinga i le suru. Reve olobo a Gashon a yuwan ne ele ili i na wu ntsayi a yuwan ne ele. <verse eid="NUM 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27" />Ulinga wu ugundo wa Gashon suru u to o'wo e ili i na Haruna no olobo a̱ yi a dammai, ili i na aa tanu ni ili i na aa yuwan suru. I ca le ulinga u na aa yuwan suru. <verse eid="NUM 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28" />A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa ulinga wu umatsun wu ugundo wa Gashon o Oogodo o Uga'asusan. Ulinga u na aa yuwan suru Itama ulobo wa Haruna ganu ɗa oo roco le ili i na aa yuwan.<verse eid="NUM 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulinga wu ugundo wa Merari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29" />&lt;&lt;Vu kece ali o ugundo wa Merari o una̱ wu gundo le na̱ matsun vu nkaya n le. <verse eid="NUM 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30" />Vu kece le diga aza a a'wan mata'atsu a̱ tyo a'wan kupoton, aza a na a rawai a yuwan ulinga o Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31" />Apa nda ili i na a zuwa nle aa tanusu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ o Oogodo o Uga'asusan: akpata o Oogodo o Uga'asusan na aɗanga a̱ yi na atsura a̱ yi na̱ nkyun ma̱ yi, <verse eid="NUM 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32" />oɓolo na atsura a na a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱i agalaci na̱ nkyun n le, na akatsu e le na amunga e le oɓolo ni itana yu ulinga i le suru ni ili i na i ri oɓolo ne ele suru. Vuma suru vu zuwaa yi ili i na waa tanu. <verse eid="NUM 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33" />A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa ulinga wu umatsun wu ugundo wa Merari na a̱a̱ da̱na̱ a yuwusan a̱tsuma̱ o Oogodo o Uga'asusan. Itama ulobo wa Haruna ganu ɗa o roco le cine aa yuwan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mekece mo ugundo wa̱ Levi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34" />Reve Musa na̱ Haruna na azagbain a ama e kece umatsun wa̱ Koha o una̱ wu matsun le na̱ matsun vu nkaya n le. <verse eid="NUM 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35" />E kece le ta̱ diga aza a na a̱ ri a'wan mata'atsu nu umatsun a̱ tyo kupoton, aza a na a rawai a yuwan ulinga o Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:36" />A̱bunda̱ e le a rawa ta̱ ama ukpakukupa ure nu ukpakucindere na̱ kupoton (2,750). <verse eid="NUM 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37" />A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa ukecu wu matsun va̱ Koha, aza a na a rawai a yuwan ulinga o Oogodo o Uga'asusan, aza a na Musa na̱ Haruna kecei cine A̱sulazuva a zuwai Musa yuwan.<verse eid="NUM 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38" />Reve e kece umatsun wa Gashon o una̱ wu matsun le na̱ matsun vu nkaya n le, <verse eid="NUM 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39" />diga za va a'wan mata'atsu nu umatsun a̱ tyo kupoton, aza a a rawai a yuwan ulinga o Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:40" />E kece le ta̱ o una̱ wu matsun le na̱ matsun vu nkaya n le ama ukpakukupa ure nu ukpakuta̱li na̱ mata'atsu (2,630). <verse eid="NUM 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41" />A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa a̱bunda̱ a matsun va Gashon, aza a na a rawai a yuwan ulinga o Oogodo o Uga'asusan, aza a na Musa na̱ Haruna e kecei cine A̱sulazuva a zuwai Musa yuwan.<verse eid="NUM 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42" />Reve e kece umatsun wa Merari o una̱ wu matsun le na̱ matsun vu nkaya n le, <verse eid="NUM 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43" />diga aza a na a̱ ri na a'wan mata'atsu nu umatsun a̱ tyo kupoton, aza a na a rawai a yuwan ulinga o Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:44" />A̱bunda̱ a matsun le ɗa ama ukpakukupa uta'atsu nu ukpakure (3,200). <verse eid="NUM 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45" />A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa mekece mo matsun va Merari, aza a na Musa na̱ Haruna kecei cine A̱sulazuva a zuwai Musa yuwan.<verse eid="NUM 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46" />Ne ɗa Musa na̱ Haruna na azagbain a Isra'ila e kecei nan Levi suru, o una̱ wu matsun le na̱ matsun vu nkaya n le, <verse eid="NUM 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47" />diga za na ri na a'wan mata'atsu a̱ tyo kupoton nu umatsun, aza a na a rawai a yuwan ulinga o Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48" />A̱bunda̱ e le a ɗa ama ukpakukupa kunla̱ nu ukpakuton na̱ kupakunla̱ (8,580). <verse eid="NUM 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49" />Cine A̱sulazuva a zuwai Musa yuwan, a ca ta̱ vuma suru ulinga u na waa yuwan ni ili i na waa tanu. Ne ɗa e kece nle cine A̱sulazuva a zuwai Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5" />
  <para style="s">Cece vu uva̱la̱ta̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Musa, u damma, <verse eid="NUM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2" />&lt;&lt;Vu zuwa aza a Isra'ila o uta̱a̱ vuma na suru ri na̱ mɓa̱la̱ mu ukwan ko za na ri a̱ ma̱ɗa̱wa̱ ko za na o'woi idaba adama a na u ju'wa̱in a̱kwa̱kwa̱ diga o uva̱la̱ta̱. <verse eid="NUM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3" />Yu uta̱a̱ vali ko ka a̱ tyo a alanga o uba̱ta̱ wu uva̱la̱ta̱, adama o o'woto uva̱la̱ta̱ u le uba̱ta̱ u na n ri nden e memere me le idaba wan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4" />Reve aza a Isra'ila a yuwan ne, a̱vu o uta̱a̱ a̱za̱ e idaba o uva̱la̱ta̱'a̱ cine A̱sulazuva a dammai Musa, ne ɗa aza a Isra'ila a yuwain.<verse eid="NUM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Atsupu adama o unusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Musa, u damma, <verse eid="NUM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6" />&lt;&lt;Damma aza a Isra'ila, na̱ vali ko ka yuwaan nanza unusu, u yuwan ta̱ ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, vuma ndolo ta̱ nu unusu. <verse eid="NUM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7" />Vuma'a u ta damma unusu u na u yuwain. Waru u ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ ili i na u lungusa̱i'i suru, reve u da̱shi za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e ili i ton yi ili'i, u ca za na u nusayi'in. <verse eid="NUM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8" />Amma na̱ vuma na a yuwayin unusu'u u kuwa̱ agba u ri na̱ za na ri zuzu na̱ a̱yi na a̱a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ ili'i shi, ili i na a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱i'i wo o'wo ta̱ za va̱ A̱sulazuva aa ta ca ganu oɓolo na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a na aa yuwaan kucci matara mo ume mo unusu wa̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9" />Ili ya akiza i na aza a Isra'ila a̱ ta̱wa̱yi ya ganu suru o to o'wo za va ganu. <verse eid="NUM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10" />Uneꞌe wa akiza u na vuma cayi suru, u to o'wo za va ganu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma̱lyungwa̱ ma ka na ri na̱ a̱ɓula̱ shi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Musa u damma,<verse eid="NUM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12" />&lt;&lt;Damma aza a Isra'ila, na̱ ka vuma puwa̱n a̱vu u yuwaan yi ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱, <verse eid="NUM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 5:13" />a damma nanza von ta̱ na̱ a̱yi, agba vali va̱ yi reve shi, agba e reve ni idaba ya̱ yi shi waru ili yi lo a na oo roco a aci a̱ yi shi, waru e reme yi a̱tsuma̱ a mayan shi, <verse eid="NUM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:14" />no okolo a vali va̱ yi e reme tsushu'un, reve u reme itamaha yi ka va̱ yi o o'wo ta̱ idaba, ko nu u yuwan tsushu'un reve u yuwan itamaha ya̱ yi ko nu u shi wo o'woto aciya̱yi idaba shi, <verse eid="NUM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15" />vali'i u ta tara ka'a a̱ tyo ya ganu. Reve u ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ kucci na vu ntsayi vu za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa a yira i yitabo o una̱ wa̱ yi. She u tsun yira'a mani'in wan ko u tsun yi ili i ma̱guru wan, adama a na kucci vi ishina tsushu'un tsa ɗa, kucci vu ucuwusan ɗa adama u rono ugbozu u vuma tsura̱ mejege mo uta̱ alanga eteshe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16" />&lt;&lt;Ganu ta̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ ka'a reve u zuwa yi wi isawan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="NUM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17" />Reve u kene mini ma akiza ma na ma̱ ri o upondo u ci'in, reve u kene ma̱buta̱ me iɗa mo oogodoꞌo u tsun pe a̱ mini'i. <verse eid="NUM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18" />Reve ganu ta̱wa̱ na̱ ka'a u zuwa yi wi isawan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. Reve u ba̱ɗa̱ a̱nji a aaci a̱ yi. A̱vu u zuwa akapi a̱ kucci vu ucuwusan e ekere a̱ yi kucci vi ishina ɗa adama a̱ tsushu'un. Reve ganu na aciya̱yi u guza̱ mini mo okono ma na ma̱ tsu zuwa una̱ u reme. <verse eid="NUM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19" />Reve ganu zuwa ka'a u yuwan akucunu, u damma yi, &lt;Nna̱ vali ro von na̱ a̱vu shi waru vo o'woto aciya̱wu idaba adama o ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ e ekere a vali va̱ wu shi, lyawa vo o'wo fa̱a̱n e ekere a̱ mini mo okono ma nda ma na ma tsu zuwa una̱ u reme. <verse eid="NUM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 5:20" />Amma na̱ vu von ta̱ na̱ vali ro za na ri vali va̱ wu shi, reve vo o'woto aciya̱wu idaba,&gt; <verse eid="NUM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 5:21" />reve ganu zuwa ka'a u yuwan akucunu a na una̱ u tsu reme, u damma ka'a, &lt;Lyawa A̱sulazuva a zuwa ama a̱ wu aa yuwaan wu una̱ waru a wasan wu, nu u zuwa umatsutsun wa̱ wu u ɓa̱ru waru a̱a̱tsuma̱ a̱ wu a tsutsa. <verse eid="NUM 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:22" />Lyawa mini ma nda ma na ma̱ tsu ta̱wa̱ nu una̱ ma uwa a̱ lipu va̱ wu, u zuwa a̱a̱tsuma̱ a̱ wu a tsutsa, reve waru u ɓa̱ru umatsutsun wa̱ wu.&gt; Reve ka'a u damma, &lt;Ami, lyawa wo o'wo ne.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23" />&lt;&lt;Ganu'u u ta ɗana una̱ u nda a aatagada o ukutsulusu a̱vu wu za̱'wa̱ le na̱ mini mo okono'o. <verse eid="NUM 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24" />Reve u zuwa ka'a u sowo mini mo okono ma na ma tsu zuwa una̱ u reme, adama mini'i u uwa a̱ lipu va̱ yi u ta̱wa̱a̱ yi na̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a wuya. <verse eid="NUM 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 5:25" />Reve ganu ushi kucci vi ishina tsushu'un diga e ekere a ka'a reve u 'ya̱sa̱n yi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva reve u ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱yi a masa'a. <verse eid="NUM 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:26" />Reve ganu kene kucci vi ishina ukere tapu a̱vu u kula̱to le a masa'a'a kucci vu ucuwusan. No o koto reve u zuwa ka'a u sowo mini'i. <verse eid="NUM 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27" />Nnu u zuwa yi u sowo mini'i, nu wo o'woto ta̱ aciya̱yi idaba o ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ e ekere a vali va̱ yi, mini ma na ma tsu zuwa una̱ u reme'e ma ta uwa a̱ lipu va̱ yi reve u zuwa yi u sowo a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a wuya. A̱a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi a ta tsusa reve umatsutsun wa̱ yi u ɓa̱ru. Ka'a u to o'wo za na una̱ woo tono a̱tsuma̱ a ama a̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28" />Amma na̱ ka'a wo o'woto aciya̱yi idaba shi u von na̱ vali ro shi, u to o'wo fa̱a̱n reve u tsura̱ limatan.<verse eid="NUM 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29" />&lt;&lt;A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa wila̱ adama a̱ tsushu'un, na̱ ka yuwan ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ wo o'woto aciya̱yi idaba a̱yi o lolo. <verse eid="NUM 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:30" />Ko na̱ majiyan ma̱ tsushu'un me reme vali reve u yuwan itamaha yi ka va̱ yi. Ganu ta zuwa ka'a wi isawan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, reve ganu'u u yuwan na̱ a̱yi cine wila̱ u nda u dammai suru. <verse eid="NUM 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31" />Vali'i u ta̱ fa̱tsa̱ o unusu'u amma ka'a u ta tara ume wu unusu wa̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6" />
  <para style="s">Za na a tawai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ Musa u damma, <verse eid="NUM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2" />Yuwan adanshi na aza a Isra'ila vu damma le, &lt;&lt;Na̱ vali ko ka tara akucunu a̱ la̱nga̱, akucunu a na waa tawa aciya̱yi adama u ca aciya̱yi e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, <verse eid="NUM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3" />she u sowo masayan ma̱ ina̱bi wan ni ili yo oso i na i tsu tsura̱to wan. She u sowo masayan ma̱ ina̱bi ma alamu ko ili yo oso i na a yuwain na̱ limatan ina̱bi wan. She u lyuwa limatan ina̱bi vu uta̱nu ko a̱za̱ o u'yewu wan. <verse eid="NUM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4" />Mantsa ma na u tawai aciya̱yi suru, waa lyuwa ko ili i na a yuwain wa ataci a̱ ina̱bi shi, ko vi icu'un ko wa aputsu.<verse eid="NUM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5" />&lt;&lt;Suru mantsa ma akucunu ma na u tawai aciya̱yi, ko utanu wa̱a̱ ju'wa̱n aaci a̱ yi shi. U ta̱ da̱na̱ na akiza hali she na̱ mantsa ma matawa ma̱ yi a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva mo koto. A mantsa'a u ta lyawa a̱nji a̱ yi a yuwan uga'an. <verse eid="NUM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6" />Suru mantsa ma matawa ma̱ yi a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, waa rawa zuzu na̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱ shi. <verse eid="NUM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7" />Woo o'woto aciya̱yi idaba adama a aza a na a̱ kuwa̱i shi ko na̱ shi dada va̱ yi ɗa ko mma va̱ yi ɗa kuwa̱i ko mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ yi mo ulobo ko vu usheli, adama a na u ta̱ nu urotsu u na a tawa niyi a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva a aaci a̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8" />A mantsa ma matawa ma̱ yi suru u ta̱ da̱na̱ na akiza uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva.<verse eid="NUM 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ za ro kuwa̱ uragazu zuzu na̱ a̱yi, to, a̱nji a aaci a̱ yi a na a tawai o o'wo ta̱ idaba, u ta puna a̱nji a̱ yi o urana we cindere urana wu usumbu wa̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10" />Reve o urana wa̱ kunla̱ u ta̱wa̱ na̱ muwun m muɗa n re ko nrukuku n re ya ganu o una̱ntsu wo Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11" />Reve ganu ca za ta̱ kucci vu unusu za ve ire waru kucci vu ukula̱tosu, u yuwan kucci matara mo ume mo unusu adama a̱ yi, adama a na u yuwan ta̱ unusu a na u ri zuzu na̱ a̱a̱kwa̱kwa̱. O urana u ndolo gan u ta tawisa aciya̱yi. <verse eid="NUM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12" />U ta tawisa aciya̱yi a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva una̱ta̱ na̱ mantsa ma na u shi u tawai aciya̱yi. Reve u ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ ma̱giri'i ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci makuɗa ma̱ wila̱. Ee kece mantsa ma na ma̱ ka̱ra̱i shi, adama a na wo o'wo ta̱ idaba a̱tsuma̱ a mantsa ma matawa ma̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13" />&lt;&lt;Apa nda wila̱ adama a Za na a Tawai na̱ mantsa ma matawa ma̱ yi mo koto. A̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱yi o una̱ntsu wo Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14" />Ɗe ɗa waa ca A̱sulazuva kucci va̱ yi, ma̱giri'i ma̱ ta̱ ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ nu umatsun za na ri usa̱du shi adama a̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu na̱ mokyokyon ma̱ ta̱ ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ nu umatsun za na ri usa̱du shi adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱ za na ri usa̱du shi adama a̱ kucci muwwulai, <verse eid="NUM 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15" />oɓolo na aasaka a̱ ta̱ o opopofu a na a̱ ri na̱ wolilo shi, na akala a yira i lashi i na a̱ ja̱mba̱ra̱i na̱ mani'in ne emeshen a na a putalai mani'in, oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ishina le na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso le.<verse eid="NUM 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16" />&lt;&lt;Ganu ta̱ ta̱wa̱ ne ele uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva reve u ca kucci vu unusu na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu. <verse eid="NUM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17" />Reve waru u ca kucci muwwulai va̱ a̱a̱giri'i oɓolo na aasaka o opopofu a na a̱ ri na̱ wolilo shi. Waru u ta ca kucci vi ishina na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso.<verse eid="NUM 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18" />&lt;&lt;Reve za na a tawai'i u puna a̱nji a aaci a̱ yi o una̱ntsu wo Oogodo o Uga'asusan. Reve u tara a̱nji a aaci a na u tawai'i u tsun le a akina a na a̱ ri za̱la̱ kucci muwwulai.<verse eid="NUM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19" />&lt;&lt;Reve ganu tara anana e elime a̱ a̱a̱giri'i a na a su'wain no oopopofu a̱ ta̱ a na a̱ ri na̱ wolilo shi ne emeshen a̱ ta̱ a na a̱ ri na̱ wolilo shi. A̱vu u zuwa le e ekere a za a na a tawai, cina u puna a̱nji a matawa ma̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20" />Reve ganu 'ya̱sa̱n le a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva kucci vu u'ya̱susa̱n. Akunda a akiza a ɗa waru akunda a ganu a ɗa, oɓolo na̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma na a̱ 'ya̱sa̱in na aagutsu a na a̱ ta̱wa̱yi. No o koto, reve za na a tawai'i u ta gura sowo masayan ma̱ inabi.<verse eid="NUM 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21" />&lt;&lt;A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa wila̱ wu za na tawai aciya̱yi za na yuwain akucunu na waa tawa aciya̱yi a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, nu uda̱shiyi wi ili i na waa gura ca. U to shiton akucunu a na u yuwain a̱ wila̱ wu za na a tawai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aba'un a na ganu aa zuwaa ama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ Musa u damma, <verse eid="NUM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23" />&lt;&lt;Damma Haruna no olobo a̱ yi, apa nda cine yaa zuwaa aza a Isra'ila aba'un. I damma le,<verse eid="NUM 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24" />&lt;&lt;Lyawa A̱sulazuva aa zuwaa ɗu aba'un,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:24">waru u yuwaan ɗu mapari.<verse eid="NUM 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25" />Lyawa A̱sulazuva a zuwa urewesu wa̱ yi wi ikana ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:25">waru u roco ɗu isa'ani.<verse eid="NUM 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26" />Lyawa A̱sulazuva a vadala urewesu wa̱ yi ya̱'a̱ ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:26">waru u ca ɗu asuvu nden.<verse eid="NUM 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ Haruna no olobo a̱ yi a zuwaa aza a Isra'ila aba'un na ala a̱ va̱, a̱mu gba n ta zuwaa le aba'un.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7" />
  <para style="s">Kucci adama o ucasu wo Oogodo o Uga'asusan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1" />O urana u na Musa kotoi ma̱shuwa̱ mo Oogodo o Uga'asusan, a̱vu u tsun yi mani'in u tawa yi na akiza ni itana ya̱ yi suru. Reve waru u tsun masa'a mani'in u tawa yi na akiza ni itana yu ulinga ya̱ yi suru. <verse eid="NUM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2" />Reve azagbain a Isra'ila, azagbain e elentsu a nkaya n le, azagbain a 'wa va aza a Isra'ila aza a na a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱i ulinga u mekece a ca kucci. <verse eid="NUM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3" />A̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ta̱ na̱ kucci le uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, ikeke yi inan i ta̱li i na i ri no ogodo ni inan kupa ne ejere, vuma ta̱ suru nan ta̱ azagbain e re suru a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ na̱ keke ta̱. Reve a̱ ta̱wa̱ ne ele elime o oogodoꞌo. <verse eid="NUM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Musa, <verse eid="NUM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5" />&lt;&lt;Ushi ili i nda e ekere e le, adama a yuwan ulinga ne ele o Oogodo o Uga'asusan. Vu ca nan Levi ele, za suru o una̱ wu cu'un vu ulinga va̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6" />Ɗaɗa Musa tarai ikeke yi inan ni ina'an reve u ca nan Levi. <verse eid="NUM 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7" />U ca ta̱ olobo a Gashon ikeke yi inan i re ni inan i na̱shi o una̱ wu cu'un vu ulinga u le. <verse eid="NUM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8" />Reve u ca olobo a Merari ikeke i na̱shi ni inan kunla̱ o una̱ wu cu'un vu ulinga u le. Itama ulobo wa Haruna ganu u ɗa waa dansa le cine aa yuwan. <verse eid="NUM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9" />Amma Musa ca olobo a Koha ili shi, adama a na ele ɗa a cayi ulinga wu uka̱lyuwusa̱ wi itana ya akiza i na a tsu tanu a̱ nlyungu n le.<verse eid="NUM 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10" />Reve azagbain a ca kucci adama a matawa ma masa'a o urana u na a̱ tsun niyi mani'in ma matawa. Reve a̱ ta̱wa̱ ne ele a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma masa'a'a. <verse eid="NUM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11" />A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱ Musa, &lt;&lt;Usana suru hali rana kupa ne ejere, zagbain ta̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ kucci va̱ yi adama a matawa ma masa'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12" />Za na cayi kucci va̱ yi o urana wu ufaru a̱yi ɗa Nashon ulobo wa Aminada, o ugundo wa Yahuza.<verse eid="NUM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13" />Kucci na u cayi ele ɗa mataɗa ma azurufa ma̱ ta̱ mo ume shekel ukpaku na̱ mata'atsu (130), na̱ mapara ma gbain ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel kupocindere u makundatsu ma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱, suru nle tapu na̱ yira i lashi i na a̱ ja̱mba̱ra̱i na̱ mani'in adama a̱ kucci vi ishina. <verse eid="NUM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14" />Na̱ mataɗa ma zinariya mo ume shekel kupa, tapu ni ili i ma̱guru, <verse eid="NUM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15" />na̱ moggono ma nan ma̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱ na̱ ma̱giri'i ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ nu umatsun, adama a̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu, <verse eid="NUM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16" />na̱ ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, <verse eid="NUM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17" />na̱ a̱ba̱jini e inan e re na̱ a̱giri'i o ton na̱ nga̱ji n ton na̱ mugiri'i ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ n ton nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci muwwulai. Ele nda ele ɗa kucci vu ulobo wa Aminada.<verse eid="NUM 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18" />O urana we ire reve Nataniya ulobo wa̱ Zowa, zagbain vu ugundo wa Isaka, u ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ kucci va̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19" />Kucci na u ta̱wa̱yi ele ɗa mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume ukpaku na̱ mata'atsu (130), na̱ mapara ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume ukpakukunla̱ (800) u makundatsu ma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱, suru nle ushitowun na̱ yira i lashi i na a̱ ja̱mba̱ra̱i na̱ mani'in adama a̱ kucci vi ishina, <verse eid="NUM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20" />na̱ mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma zinariya mo ume shekel kupa, tapu ni itana i ma̱guru, <verse eid="NUM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21" />na̱ moggono ma nan ma̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱ na̱ ma̱giri'i ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu, <verse eid="NUM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22" />na̱ ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, <verse eid="NUM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23" />no ogono e inan e re, na̱ a̱giri'i o ton na̱ nga̱ji n ton na̱ mugiri'i n ton ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci muwwulai. Ele ɗa kucci va Nataniya ulobo wa̱ Zowa.<verse eid="NUM 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24" />Urana wa ta'atsu, reve Eliyabu ulobo wa Helon zagbain vu ugundo wa Zebulun, u ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ kucci va̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25" />Kucci na u cayi ele ɗa mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel ukpaku na̱ mata'atsu (130), na̱ mapara ma azurufa ma gbain ma̱ ta̱ mo ume shekel kupocindere, suru nle o una̱ u makundatsu ma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱ tapu na̱ yira i lashi uja̱mba̱ru na̱ mani'in adama a̱ kucci vi ishina, <verse eid="NUM 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26" />na̱ mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma zinariya mo ume shekel kupa tapu ni itana i ma̱guru, <verse eid="NUM 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27" />na̱ moggono ma nan ma̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱ na̱ ma̱giri'i ma̱ ta̱ ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu, <verse eid="NUM 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28" />na̱ ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, <verse eid="NUM 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29" />no ogono e inan e re na̱ a̱giri'i o ton na̱ nga̱ji n ton na̱ mugiri'i n ton ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci muwwulai. Ele ɗa kucci va Eliyabu ulobo wa Helon.<verse eid="NUM 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30" />O urana wa̱ na̱shi reve Elizu ulobo wa Shedeya, zagbain vu ugundo wa̱ Roben, u ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ kucci va̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31" />Kucci va̱ yi ele ɗa mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel ukpaku na̱ mata'atsu (130), mapara ma gbain ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel kupocindere u makundatsu ma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱, tapu na̱ yira i lashi uja̱mba̱ru na̱ mani'in adama a̱ kucci vi ishina, <verse eid="NUM 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32" />na̱ mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma zinariya mo ume shekel kupa, tapu ni itana i ma̱guru, <verse eid="NUM 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33" />na̱ moggono ma nan ma̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱ na̱ ma̱giri'i ma̱ ta̱ ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu, <verse eid="NUM 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34" />na̱ ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, <verse eid="NUM 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35" />no ogono e inan e re, na̱ a̱giri'i o ton na̱ nga̱ji n ton na̱ mugiri'i n ton ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci muwwulai. Ele ɗa kucci va Elizu ulobo wa Shedeya.<verse eid="NUM 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36" />O urana wa tawun reve Shelumiye ulobo wa Zurishadai, zagbain vu ugundo wa Saminu, u ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ kucci va̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37" />Kucci va̱ yi ɗa mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel ukpaku na̱ mata'atsu (130), na̱ mapara ma gbain ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel kupocindere, u makundatsu ma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱, suru nle tapu na̱ yira i lashi uja̱mba̱ru na̱ mani'in adama a̱ kucci vi ishina, <verse eid="NUM 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38" />na̱ mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma zinariya mo ume shekel kupa, tapu ni itana i ma̱guru, <verse eid="NUM 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39" />na̱ moggono ma nan ma̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱ na̱ ma̱giri'i ma̱ ta̱ ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ nu umatsun, adama a̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu, <verse eid="NUM 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40" />na̱ ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, <verse eid="NUM 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41" />no ogono e inan e re na̱ a̱giri'i o ton na̱ nga̱ji n ton na̱ mugiri'i n ton ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci muwwulai. Ele ɗa kucci va Shelumiye ulobo wa Zurishadai.<verse eid="NUM 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42" />O urana wa̱ ta̱li, reve Eliyasa ulobo wa Deyuwe zagbain vu ugundo wa Gadu, u ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ kucci va̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43" />Kucci va̱ yi ɗa mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel ukpaku na̱ mata'atsu (130), na̱ mapara ma gbain ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel kupocindere, u makundatsu ma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱, suru nle tapu na̱ yira i lashi uja̱mba̱ru na̱ mani'in adama a̱ kucci vi ishina, <verse eid="NUM 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44" />na̱ mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma zinariya mo ume shekel kupa, tapu ni itana i ma̱guru, <verse eid="NUM 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45" />na̱ moggono ma nan ma̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱ na̱ ma̱giri'i ma̱ ta̱ ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ nu umatsun, adama a̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu, <verse eid="NUM 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46" />na̱ ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, <verse eid="NUM 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47" />no ogono e inan e re na̱ a̱giri'i o ton na̱ nga̱ji n ton na̱ mugiri'i n ton ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci muwwulai. Ele ɗa kucci va Eliyasa ulobo wa Deyuwe.<verse eid="NUM 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48" />O urana we cindere, reve Elishama ulobo wa Amihu, zagbain vu ugundo wa Ifiramu, u ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ kucci va̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49" />Kucci va̱ yi ɗa mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel ukpaku na̱ mata'atsu (130), na̱ mapara ma gbain ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel kupocindere, u makundatsu ma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱, suru nle tapu na̱ yira i lashi uja̱mba̱ru na̱ mani'in adama a̱ kucci vi ishina, <verse eid="NUM 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50" />na̱ mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma zinariya mo ume shekel kupa, tapu ni itana i ma̱guru, <verse eid="NUM 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51" />na̱ moggono ma nan ma̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱ na̱ ma̱giri'i ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ nu umatsun, adama a̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu, <verse eid="NUM 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52" />na̱ ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, <verse eid="NUM 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53" />no ogono e inan e re na̱ a̱giri'i o ton na̱ nga̱ji n ton na̱ mugiri'i n ton ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci muwwulai. Ele ɗa kucci va Elishama ulobo wa Amihu.<verse eid="NUM 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54" />O urana wa̱ kunla̱, reve Gamaliya ulobo wa Fedazu, zagbain vu ugundo wa Manase, u ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ kucci va̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 7:54" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55" />Kucci va̱ yi ɗa mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel ukpaku na̱ mata'atsu (130), na̱ mapara ma gbain ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel kupocindere, u makundatsu ma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱, suru nle tapu na̱ yira i lashi uja̱mba̱ru na̱ mani'in adama a̱ kucci vi ishina, <verse eid="NUM 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56" />na̱ mapara ma gbain ma̱ ta̱ ma zinariya mo ume shekel kupa, tapu ni itana i ma̱guru, <verse eid="NUM 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57" />na̱ moggono ma nan ma̱ ta̱, na̱ a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱ na̱ ma̱giri'i ma̱ ta̱ ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ nu umatsun, adama a̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu, <verse eid="NUM 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58" />na̱ ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, <verse eid="NUM 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59" />no ogono e inan e re na̱ a̱giri'i o ton na̱ nga̱ji n ton na̱ mugiri'i n ton ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci muwwulai. Ele ɗa kucci va Gamaliya ulobo wa Fedazu.<verse eid="NUM 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60" />O urana wa̱ kucci reve Abidan ulobo wa Gidiyoni, zagbain vu ugundo wa Banyami, u ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ kucci va̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 7:60" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61" />Kucci va̱ yi ɗa mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel ukpaku na̱ mata'atsu (130), na̱ mapara ma gbain ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel kupocindere, u makundatsu ma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱, suru nle tapu na̱ yira i lashi uja̱mba̱ru na̱ mani'in adama a̱ kucci vi ishina, <verse eid="NUM 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62" />na̱ mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma zinariya mo ume shekel kupa, tapu ni itana i ma̱guru, <verse eid="NUM 7:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63" />na̱ moggono ma nan ma̱ ta̱, na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱ na̱ ma̱giri'i ma̱ ta̱ ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu, <verse eid="NUM 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64" />na̱ ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, <verse eid="NUM 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65" />no ogono e inan e re na̱ a̱giri'i o ton na̱ nga̱ji n ton na̱ mugiri'i n ton ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci muwwulai. Ele ɗa kucci va Abidan ulobo wa Gidiyoni.<verse eid="NUM 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66" />O urana wa kupa, reve Ahiyeza ulobo wa Amishadai, zagbain vu ugundo wa Dan, u ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ kucci va̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 7:66" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67" />Kuci va̱ yi ɗa mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel ukpaku na̱ mata'atsu (130), na̱ mapara ma gbain ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel kupocindere, u makundatsu ma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱, suru nle tapu na̱ yira i lashi uja̱mba̱ru na̱ mani'in adama a̱ kucci vi ishina, <verse eid="NUM 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68" />na̱ mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma zinariya mo ume shekel kupa, tapu ni itana i ma̱guru, <verse eid="NUM 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69" />na̱ moggono ma nan ma̱ ta̱, na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱ na̱ ma̱giri'i ma̱ ta̱ ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci vi ukula̱tosu, <verse eid="NUM 7:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70" />na̱ ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, <verse eid="NUM 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71" />no ogono e inan e re na̱ a̱giri'i o ton na̱ nga̱ji n ton na̱ mugiri'i n ton ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci muwwulai. Ele ɗa kucci va Ahiyeza ulobo wa Amishadai.<verse eid="NUM 7:71" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72" />O urana wa kupa na̱ za ta̱, reve Fagiye ulobo wa Okiran, zagbain vu ugundo wa Asha, u ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ kucci va̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 7:72" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73" />Kucci va̱ yi ɗa mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel ukpaku na̱ mata'atsu (130), na̱ mapara ma gbain ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel kupocindere, u makundatsu ma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱, suru nle tapu na̱ yira i lashi uja̱mba̱ru na̱ mani'in adama a̱ kucci vi ishina, <verse eid="NUM 7:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74" />na̱ mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma zinariya mo ume shekel kupa, tapu ni itana i ma̱guru, <verse eid="NUM 7:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75" />na̱ moggono ma nan ma̱ ta̱, na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱ na̱ ma̱giri'i ma̱ ta̱ ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu, <verse eid="NUM 7:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76" />na̱ ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, <verse eid="NUM 7:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77" />no ogono e nan e re na̱ a̱a̱giri'i o ton na̱ nga̱ji n ton na̱ mugiri'i n ton ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci muwwulai. Ele ɗa kucci va Fagiye ulobo wa Okiran.<verse eid="NUM 7:77" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78" />O urana wa kupa ne ejere, reve Ahira ulobo wa Enan, zagbain vu ugundo wa Nafutali, u ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ kucci va̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 7:78" /></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79" />Kuci va̱ yi ɗa mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel ukpaku na̱ mata'atsu (130), na̱ mapara ma gbain ma̱ ta̱ ma azurufa mo ume shekel kupocindere, u makundatsu ma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱, suru nle tapu na̱ yira i lashi uja̱mba̱ru na̱ mani'in adama a̱ kucci vi ishina, <verse eid="NUM 7:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80" />na̱ mataɗa ma̱ ta̱ ma zinariya mo ume shekel kupa, tapu ni itana i ma̱guru, <verse eid="NUM 7:80" /><verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81" />na̱ moggono ma nan ma̱ ta̱, na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱ na̱ ma̱giri'i ma̱ ta̱ ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu, <verse eid="NUM 7:81" /><verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82" />na̱ ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, <verse eid="NUM 7:82" /><verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83" />no ogono e nan e re na̱ a̱a̱giri'i o ton na̱ nga̱ji n ton na̱ mugiri'i n ton ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci muwwulai. Ele ɗa kucci va Ahira ulobo wa Enan.<verse eid="NUM 7:83" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84" />Ele nda ele ɗa kucci na azagbain a aza a Isra'ila a cayi adama o ucasu u masa'a a mantsa ma na a̱ tsun niyi mani'in: ntaɗa n azurufa kupa ne ejere na̱ mpara m gbagbain n azurufa kupa ne ejere na̱ ntaɗa n zinariya kupa ne ejere. <verse eid="NUM 7:84" /><verse number="85" style="v" sid="NUM 7:85" />Mataɗa ma azurufa suru ume u shekel ukpaku na̱ mata'atsu (130), mapara ma gbain suru ume u shekel kupocindere. Suru suru, ntaɗa n azurufa'a ume u le shekel ukpakukupa ure nu ukpakuna̱shi (2,400) u makundatsu ma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱. <verse eid="NUM 7:85" /><verse number="86" style="v" sid="NUM 7:86" />Ntaɗa n zinariya kupa ne ejere n na n ri tapu ni itana i ma̱guru ume wu za ta̱ suru shekel kupa, u makundatsu ma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱. Suru suru, ntaɗa n zinariya'a ume u le ukpaku nu ushin (120). <verse eid="NUM 7:86" /><verse number="87" style="v" sid="NUM 7:87" />A̱bunda̱ e iliyamunga i na a cayi adama a̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu ele ɗa muggono mi inan kupa ne ejere, na̱ a̱giri'i kupa ne ejere na̱ mugiri'i kupa ne ejere ma a'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ nu umatsun, oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ishina le, oɓolo na̱ nga̱ji kupa ne ejere adama a̱ kucci vu unusu. <verse eid="NUM 7:87" /><verse number="88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:88" />A̱bunda̱ e iliyamunga i na cayi adama a̱ kucci muwwulai ele ɗa ogono e inan ushin na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi, na̱ a̱giri'i kupota̱li na̱ nga̱ji kupota̱li na̱ mugiri'i kupota̱li ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ nu umatsun. Ele ɗa kucci adama o ucasu u masa'a ana o kotoi a̱ tsusa̱n yi mani'in.<verse eid="NUM 7:88" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89" />Mantsa ma na Musa uwai a̱tsuma̱ o Oogodo o Uga'asusan adama u yuwan adanshi na̱ A̱sulazuva biti, reve wu uwwa uɗyo a yuwusan adanshi na̱ a̱yi e memere ma nan kerobobi e re zuva vi ikpa̱ta̱tsu ya Akpati a Nzuwulai.<verse eid="NUM 7:89" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8" />
  <para style="s">Mazuwa me ifitila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ Musa u damma, <verse eid="NUM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2" />&lt;&lt;Yuwan adanshi na̱ Haruna vu damma yi, a mantsa ma na vaa zuwa ifitila i cindere'e, vu zuwa le cine aa ca ekan elime o uba̱ta̱ u wisawatan u fitila'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3" />Reve Haruna yuwan ne, u zuwa ifitila'a cine aa ca ekan elime a wisawatan wi ifitila'a, cine A̱sulazuva a dammai Musa. <verse eid="NUM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4" />Apa nda cine a rumai wisawatan wi ifitila'a: a ruma yi ta̱ na̱ zinariya, diga e ikyun ya̱ yi a̱ tyo o mukkoto mo oroci a̱ yipa̱lu ya̱ yi. A yuwan yi ta̱ cine A̱sulazuva o rocoi Musa.<verse eid="NUM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matawa ma nan Levi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Musa u damma: <verse eid="NUM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6" />&lt;&lt;Vu tara nan Levi a̱tsuma̱ a ama a Isra'ila, reve vu ka̱mba̱to le cece. <verse eid="NUM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7" />Apa nda cine va̱a̱ ka̱mba̱to le cece: Vu kyo'onu le mini mo uka̱mba̱tosu cece. Reve vu zuwa le a puna lipu le suru nu utanu, reve waru a̱ za̱'wa̱ a̱tugu e le. Ne ɗa a̱a̱ ka̱mba̱to aciyele cece. <verse eid="NUM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8" />Reve a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ moggono ma nan ma̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ishina va̱ yi vu yira i lashi uja̱mba̱ru na̱ mani'in, reve waru a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ moggono me ire adama a̱ kucci vu unusu. <verse eid="NUM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9" />Reve vu ta̱wa̱ na̱ nan Levi e isawan elime o Oogodo o Uga'asusan. A̱vu vu ɓoloto ama a Isra'ila suru. <verse eid="NUM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10" />Na̱ vu ta̱wa̱ ne ele a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, reve ama a Isra'ila'a suru a̱ kuruwa̱ le ekere. <verse eid="NUM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11" />Reve Haruna ta̱wa̱ na̱ nan Levi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva tsa̱ kucci vu u'ya̱susa̱n na aza a Isra'ila a cayi, adama a̱ da̱na̱ ufoɓu u na a yuwaan A̱sulazuva a̱ga̱nda̱.<verse eid="NUM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12" />&lt;&lt;Reve nan Levi a̱ kuru ekere e le a aci e ina'an. A̱vu vu yuwan kucci vu unusu na̱ za ta̱, za ve ire waru gba kucci vu ukula̱tosu a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, adama a̱ kucci matara mo ume mo unusu u nan Levi. <verse eid="NUM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13" />Reve vu zuwa nan Levi e isawan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma Haruna no olobo a̱ yi, reve vu ca A̱sulazuva ele tsa̱ kucci vu u'ya̱susa̱n. <verse eid="NUM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14" />Ne ɗa vaa tawa nan Levi ko'o diga a akapi a ama a Isra'ila, reve nan Levi'i o o'wo a̱za̱ a̱ va̱.<verse eid="NUM 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na vo o'wotoi nan Levi cece, reve vu ta̱wa̱ ne ele tsa̱ kucci vu u'ya̱susa̱n, reve a uwa pe a yuwan ulinga o Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16" />Adama a na a ca mu ta̱ ele suru suru diga a̱tsuma̱ a ama a Isra'ila. N tara le ta̱ o o'wo a̱za̱ a̱ va̱ o una̱ wu umatsun wu ufaru, mawun mo ufaru mo ulobo ma ka va Isra'ila suru. <verse eid="NUM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17" />Adama a na umatsun wu ufaru wa aza a Isra'ila suru za va̱ ɗa, ko vuma ko iliyamunga. A mantsa ma na mu unai umatsun wu ufaru wi iɗa ya Masar suru, n tawa le ta̱ adama a̱ va̱. <verse eid="NUM 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18" />N tara ta̱ nan Levi o una̱ wu umatsun wu ufaru wu ulobo wa Isra'ila suru. <verse eid="NUM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19" />Waru n ca ta̱ Haruna no olobo a̱ yi nan Levi une'e adama a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ o Oogodo o Uga'asusan o una̱ wa aza a Isra'ila. Waru a yuwan kucci matara mo ume mo unusu adama e le tsa̱ra̱ mɓa̱la̱ n reme le wan, nna a rawa zuzu na̱ a̱a̱'isa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20" />Ne ɗa Musa na̱ Haruna na ama a Isra'ila suru a yuwain na̱ nan Levi cine A̱sulazuva a dammai Musa. <verse eid="NUM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21" />Reve nan Levi o o'woto aciyele cece, a̱vu a̱ za̱'wa̱ a̱tugu e le. Reve Haruna ta̱wa̱ ne ele tsa̱ kucci vu u'ya̱susa̱n a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu u ca kucci matara mo ume mo unusu adama e le adama wo o'woto le cece. <verse eid="NUM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22" />Ana o kotoi, reve nan Levi a uwa o Oogodo Uga'asusan tsa̱ra̱ a yuwan ulinga u le za̱la̱ va Haruna no olobo a̱ yi, cine A̱sulazuva a dammai Musa adama a nan Levi, ne ɗa a yuwain.<verse eid="NUM 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ Musa, u damma, <verse eid="NUM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24" />&lt;&lt;A̱yi nda u ta̱ a aci a nan Levi, vali na ri na a'wan ushin no ozo o ton ko u pasai, u ta̱ ta̱wa̱ u yuwan ulinga o Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25" />Amma na a rawa a'wan kupoton, e te ivuwan o ulinga u le, a buwa a yuwan ulinga shi. <verse eid="NUM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26" />A ta gura kamba a̱za̱ e le ulinga a̱tsuma̱ o Oogodo o Uga'asusan, amma ele na aciyele oo o'wo aci o ulingaꞌa shi. Ne tsunda tsa ɗa vaa ca nan Levi ulinga u le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 8:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9" />
  <para style="s">A̱buki a Mapasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ Musa A̱tsumona a Sinai, o woto wu ufaru a aa'wan e ire ana o uta̱i e iɗa ya Masar, u damma, <verse eid="NUM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2" />&lt;&lt;Zuwa aza a Isra'ila a yuwan A̱buki a Mapasa a mantsa ma na a zuwa niyi. <verse eid="NUM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3" />O urana wa kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi u woto u nda nu ulivu, i ta yuwan a̱buki'i a mantsa ma na a zuwai. I yuwan yi o ure u na a zuwai na̱ wila̱ wa̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4" />Ɗaɗa Musa dammai aza a Isra'ila a yuwan A̱buki a Mapasa'a. <verse eid="NUM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5" />Reve a yuwan ne a̱ A̱tsumona a Sinai nu ulivu o urana wa kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi o woto wu ufaru. Cine A̱sulazuva a zuwai Musa ne ɗa aza a Isra'ila a yuwain.<verse eid="NUM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6" />Agba ozo o ro e le a yuwan A̱buki a Mapasa o urana u ndolo'o shi adama a na a̱ shi ta̱ idaba na a̱ ju'wa̱in a̱kwa̱kwa̱. Ɗaɗa a̱ ta̱wa̱i ya Musa na̱ Haruna o urana u ndolo'o. <verse eid="NUM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7" />Reve a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Tsu ta̱ idaba adama a na tsu ju'wa̱in a̱a̱kwa̱kwa̱, agba adama a̱ nye a 'yasan tsu a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ kucci va̱ A̱sulazuva oɓolo na akapi a aza a Isra'ila a mantsa ma na a zuwai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8" />Reve Musa usu le, &lt;&lt;Piriyi she na̱ mu uwwa ili i na A̱sulazuva aa damma adama a̱ ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Musa u damma, <verse eid="NUM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10" />&lt;&lt;Damma aza a Isra'ila, no ozo o ro a̱ ɗu ko ozo o ro a̱tsuma̱ o umatsun u ɗu o o'wo idaba adama a na a̱ ju'wa̱in a̱a̱kwa̱kwa̱, ko a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i mmalu, a ta gura yuwan A̱buki a Mapasa a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="NUM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11" />A ta yuwan a̱buki'i o urana wa kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi o woto we ire nu ulivu. A ta tama nama va̱ a̱buki'i oɓolo no opopofu a na a̱ ri na̱ wolilo shi na̱ a̱vu'un o okono. <verse eid="NUM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12" />She a lyawa akapi a asa wan ko a kuɗa eetele a̱ yi wan. Mantsa ma na aa yuwan A̱buki a Mapasa na ciga a 'yuwan a̱ kuru wila̱ꞌa̱ suru. <verse eid="NUM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13" />Amma na̱ vuma na ri cece agba u 'ya̱wa̱ mmalu shi, u kuɗa̱ a yuwan A̱buki a Mapasa, a ta tawa vuma ndolo diga a̱tsuma̱ a ama a̱ yi adama a na u ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ kucci va̱ A̱sulazuva a mantsa ma na wu ntsayi shi. Vuma ndolo ta tara ume wu unusu wa̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14" />&lt;&lt;Mocin na ri na̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu za na cigai u yuwan A̱buki a Mapasa a̱tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, u ta yuwan yi o ure u na a zuwai na̱ wila̱ wa̱ yi. Vu ta ca mocin nu umatsun u lyuci suru wila̱ u ta̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eleshe a palai Oogodo o Uga'asusan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 40:34-38">Mta̱ 40:34-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15" />Urana u na a̱ shuwa̱i Oogodo o Uga'asusan, reve eleshe a pala yi. Diga ulivu hali she usana eleshe a na a palai oogodoꞌo u rotso ta̱ akina. <verse eid="NUM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:16" />Ne ɗa u da̱na̱i kuci, eleshe'e a tsu pala yi ta̱ nu urana, reve na ayin u rotso akina. <verse eid="NUM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17" />A mantsa ma na suru eleshe'e a̱ 'yoyin diga o oogodoꞌo, reve aza a Isra'ila fo a̱ 'yon. Reve uba̱ta̱ u na eleshe'e a̱ va̱la̱i suru, lo ɗa aza a Isra'ila a̱a̱ va̱la̱. <verse eid="NUM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18" />Nu udammu wa̱ A̱sulazuva, reve aza a Isra'ila a̱ 'yon, waru nu udammu wa̱ yi reve a̱ va̱la̱. Nne eleshe'e a̱ ri zuva vo oogodoꞌo a̱ tsu da̱na̱ ta̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱'a̱. <verse eid="NUM 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19" />Ko na̱ shi eleshe'e a jima zuva vo oogodoꞌo, aza a Isra'ila a tsu yuwan ta̱ tsutoni na adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱ tsu 'yon shi. <verse eid="NUM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20" />Mantsa mo ro eleshe'e a̱ tsu da̱na̱ ta̱ zuva vo oogodoꞌo rana meketeci, reve o udammu wa̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ da̱na̱ pe uva̱lu. Reve waru o udammu wa̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ 'yon. <verse eid="NUM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21" />Mantsa mo ro eleshe'e e te isawan ta̱ zuva vo oogodoꞌo diga ulivu a̱ tyo usana, reve nu u 'yon nu usana, a̱vu ele fo a̱ 'yon. Ko nu urana u ɗa ko na ayin, a mantsa ma na eleshe'e a̱ 'yoyin biti reve ele fo a̱ 'yon. <verse eid="NUM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22" />Ko ne eleshe'e e isawan ta̱ zuva vo oogodoꞌo ayin e re ko woto ko aa'wan, aza a Isra'ila a̱ tsu da̱na̱ ta̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱ a̱a̱ 'yon shi. Amma nu u 'yon reve a̱ 'yon. <verse eid="NUM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23" />Nu udammu wa̱ A̱sulazuva u ɗa a̱ tsu va̱la̱, reve waru a̱ 'yon nu udammu wa̱ yi. A̱ kuru ta̱ ili i na A̱sulazuva a zuwai e ili i na u dammai e ekere a Musa.<verse eid="NUM 9:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10" />
  <para style="s">Avana a azurufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ Musa, u damma, <verse eid="NUM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2" />&lt;&lt;Vu ruma avana e re a azurufa. Reve a yuwan ulinga ne ele adama e ɗe ama o ɓoloto, waru na a adama o u'yosun o uva̱la̱ta̱. <verse eid="NUM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3" />A mantsa ma na e ivula̱i avana'a ra, reve ama suru o ɓoloto a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ wu o una̱ntsu wo Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4" />Amma nna̱ za ta̱ ɗa e ivula̱i, azagbain a na a̱ ri aci o gundo va Isra'ila, ele ɗa oo ɓoloto a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ wu. <verse eid="NUM 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5" />Ne e ivula̱ wivulu wa'a, gundo na ri uva̱lu asana ele ɗa a̱ 'yon e reme ure. <verse eid="NUM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6" />Ne e ivula̱ wivulu u wa'a we ire, aza a na a̱ ri uva̱lu uyagi ele ɗa a̱ 'yon e reme ure. Mesu'un u to o'wo iroci yu u'yosun. <verse eid="NUM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7" />Amma nne ee ɗe ama o ɓoloto, yi ivulula̱i avana'a.<verse eid="NUM 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8" />&lt;&lt;Olobo a Haruna nan ganu, ele ɗa ee ivula̱ avana'a. A̱yi nda u to o'wo ɗu ili i mayan hali hali a̱ tyo o umatsun we elime. <verse eid="NUM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9" />A mantsa ma na yu uta̱i e iɗa i ɗu na yaa yuwan uvon na̱ n'yuwatan n ɗu aza a na oo ɓongishi ɗu, yi ivula̱ avana, adama A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a cuwan na̱ a̱ɗu, a̱vu u wawa ɗu e ekere a n'yuwatan n ɗu. <verse eid="NUM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10" />Waru a mantsa ma̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ ma̱ ɗu, mantsa ma na i tsu yuwan a̱buki na̱ A̱buki o Woto u Sa'avu, i te ivula̱ avana a mantsa mo ucasu u kucci vu ukula̱tosu na̱ kucci muwwulai ɗu. Waru o to o'wo ili i na A̱sula̱ a̱ ri n cuwusan na̱ a̱ɗu. A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aza a Isra'ila a lyawai Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11" />O urana wu ushin u woto we ire a aa'wan e ire ana o uta̱i Masar, ɗaɗa eleshe a̱ 'yoyin zuva vo Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12" />Reve ama a Isra'ila a̱ 'yon e reme mmalu oɓolo oɓolo diga A̱tsumona a Sinai, hali she na eleshe e isawain A̱tsumona a Faran. <verse eid="NUM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13" />Reve a̱ 'yon o uta̱ u'yowun wu ufaru cine A̱sulazuva a dammai Musa.<verse eid="NUM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14" />Atuta o ugundo wa Yahuza u ɗa u fara 'yoyin, reve akapi o gundo a̱ kuru oɓolo oɓolo. Nashon ulobo wa Aminada u ɗa u da̱na̱i zagbain le. <verse eid="NUM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15" />Nataniya ulobo wa̱ Zowa u ɗa u da̱na̱i zagbain ve eɓele o ugundo wa Isaka. <verse eid="NUM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16" />Eliyabu ulobo wa Helon a̱yi ɗa u da̱na̱i zagbain ve eɓele o ugundo wa Zebulun. <verse eid="NUM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17" />Reve a̱ mula̱ oogodoꞌo, a̱vu aza a Gashon na aza a Merari aza a na a tanu niyi a̱ 'yon o uta̱.<verse eid="NUM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18" />Reve atuta o ugundo wa̱ Roben a̱ kuru le oɓolo oɓolo. Elizu ulobo wa Shedeya u ɗa u da̱na̱i zagbain le. <verse eid="NUM 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19" />Shelumiye ulobo wa Zurishadai a̱yi ɗa zagbain vu ugundo wa Saminu. <verse eid="NUM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20" />Eliyasa ulobo wa Deyuwe a̱yi ɗa zagbain ve eɓele o ugundo wa Gadu. <verse eid="NUM 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21" />Reve aza a Koha a̱ kuru utanuwu ni itana ya akiza. A̱ ta̱ shuwa̱ oogodoꞌo kafu a rawa.<verse eid="NUM 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22" />Reve atuta o ugundo wa Ifiramu a̱ kuru le oɓolo oɓolo. Elishama ulobo wa Amihu u ɗa zagbain le. <verse eid="NUM 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23" />Gamaliya ulobo wa Fedazu a̱yi ɗa zagbain ve eɓele o ugundo wa Manase. <verse eid="NUM 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24" />Abidan ulobo wa Gidiyoni a̱yi ɗa zagbain ve eɓele o ugundo wa Banyami.<verse eid="NUM 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25" />Reve o ukosu, atuta o ugundo wa Dan a̱ kuru le oɓolo oɓolo. Reve o o'wo a̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ pirishi akapi o oɓolo suru. Ahiyeza ulobo wa Amishadai a̱yi ɗa zagbain a aci e le. <verse eid="NUM 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26" />Fagiye ulobo wo Okiran a̱yi ɗa zagbain ve eɓele o ugundo wa Asha. <verse eid="NUM 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27" />Ahira ulobo wa Enan a̱yi ɗa zagbain ve eɓele o ugundo wa Nafutali. <verse eid="NUM 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28" />A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa ugeru wu mmalu wo oɓolo a Isra'ila a mantsa ma na a̱ 'yoyin e remei ure suru.<verse eid="NUM 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29" />Reve Musa damma Hoba ulobo wa Reyuwe va Midiya, a̱sha̱wa̱le a Musa, &lt;&lt;Tsu ta̱ 'yon a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva a dammai, &lt;N ta ca ɗu a̱yi.&gt; Ta̱wa̱ tsu 'ya̱wa̱i oɓolo tsu ta̱ ɓa̱na̱ wu ulobonu, adama a na A̱sulazuva a yuwaan ta̱ Isra'ila nzuwulai mi isa'ani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30" />Reve u usu, &lt;&lt;O'o, ma̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ shi, n ta̱ ka̱mba̱ e iɗa i va̱ uba̱ta̱ wa ama a̱ va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31" />Amma Musa damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Yuwan ankuri she vu lyawa tsu wan, adama a na vu reve ta̱ uba̱ta̱ u na tsa̱a̱ va̱la̱ a̱tsumona, vu to rono tsu aɗanga. <verse eid="NUM 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32" />Waru na̱ vu kuru tsu, tsu ta̱ ne'eshen ili i sa'ani i na A̱sulazuva a ca ntsu biti oɓolo na̱ a̱vu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33" />Ɗaɗa aza a Isra'ila a̱ 'yoyin diga a masasan ma̱ A̱sulazuva, reve a yuwan mmalu mu rana ta'atsu. Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva a ɗa a walaa nle elime a mantsa ma ayin a ta'atsu o ndolo adama u zamiya le uba̱ta̱ u na ee ivuwan. <verse eid="NUM 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34" />Waru eleshe a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ zuva le nu urana a mantsa ma na a̱ 'yoyin diga o uva̱la̱ta̱. <verse eid="NUM 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35" />A mantsa ma na suru akpati'i a̱ 'yoyin, Musa tsu damma ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 10:35">&lt;&lt;Yon A̱sulazuva!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 10:35">Lyawa n'yuwatan ma̱ wu m bete'we,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 10:35">aza a na a 'yuwan nuwu a suma a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36" />Reve a mantsa ma na u cipa̱i biti, a̱vu u damma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 10:36">&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 10:36">ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa ama a Isra'ila ukpakukupa kupa a na a̱ ri n kece shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11" />
  <para style="s">Ama a Isra'ila a yuwain acingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1" />Urana u ro reve aza a Isra'ila a uwa acingi adama a̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ e le, A̱sulazuva gba a uwwusa. Ana wu uwwa nle, a̱vu u yuwan upan. A̱vu akina a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ cipa̱ a̱ kula̱tosu le, hali u kula̱to upasu u na wu uva̱la̱ta̱'a̱. <verse eid="NUM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2" />A̱vu ama'a e showen Musa, a̱vu u pati A̱sulazuva, ɗaɗa akina'a a̱ kima̱i. <verse eid="NUM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3" />Adama o ndolo a ɗa e ɗeyi uba̱ta̱'a̱ Tabera adama a na lo ɗa akina a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ kula̱i a̱tsuma̱ e le.<verse eid="NUM 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4" />Reve oɓolo a ama aza a na a̱ ri aza a Isra'ila a ɗa shi a na a̱ ri oɓolo ne ele e teme izami yi ili na̱ a̱bunda̱, reve aza a Isra'ila fo e teme acingi a̱vu a damma, &lt;&lt;A damma de tsu shi ta̱ a̱ tsura̱ inama i na tsaa tama! <verse eid="NUM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5" />Tsu cuwan ta̱ cine tsu tamusai mugula e iɗa ya Masar uneꞌe, waru tsu cuwan ta̱ na̱ kukumba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kukumba ili yu utamu i ɗa i na a tsu tama i na i rotsoi zunguru</char></note>, no oɗyoro na arumbasa, no oroci a arumbasa a nata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a̱yi ɗa a̱ tsu ɗe &lt;&lt;tafarnuwa&gt;&gt; na̱ tsugana</char></note>. <verse eid="NUM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6" />Amma gogo gba ucira u tsu u koto ta̱, babu ili i ro lo na tsaa lyuwa she mana goon tsee inda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7" />Mana ndolo gba tsi isu'wan i u'ri i ɗa u ri, u rotso ta̱ erepu o uɗanga. <verse eid="NUM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8" />Ama a̱ tsu 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ o ɓoloto le a̱vu e ira le a atali a yira ko a̱ kula̱ le o usun. A tsu ralu yi ta̱ o upondo ko a yuwan le emeshen. A̱vu u yuwan a̱limu tse ili i na a yuwain na̱ mani'in ma̱ zetun. <verse eid="NUM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:9" />Mantsa ma na a'iza a̱ cipa̱i na ayin o uva̱la̱ta̱, mana fo u tsu cipa̱ ta̱ oɓolo ne ele.<verse eid="NUM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10" />Musa uwwa ta̱ ama a 'wa suru a acingi, koyan o una̱ntsu wo oogodo a̱ yi. A̱vu A̱sulazuva a yuwan upan lon, hali Musa o'wo udamu. <verse eid="NUM 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11" />A̱vu Musa damma A̱sulazuva, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa i zuwai vu ta̱wa̱yi aagbashi a̱ wu na addama a nda? Nye n yuwain na n lungusa̱ nuwu okolo, hali na vu zuwai ume wa ama a nda suru a aci a̱ va̱? <verse eid="NUM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12" />A̱mu ɗa n tanuyi a̱tsuma̱ a ama a nda suru? A̱mu ɗa m matsan nle? Nye i zuwai vu zuwa numu n sheɗe le e ekere a̱ va̱, cine ka tsu sheɗe ba̱ba̱, hali a̱ tyo e iɗa i na vu kucinayi nkaya n le, a na vaa ca le? <verse eid="NUM 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13" />Te ɗa ma̱a̱ tsura̱ inama i na maa ca ama a nda suru? Ele ɗa nda a̱ shoshen mu a dansa, &lt;Ca tsu inama tsu tama!&gt; <verse eid="NUM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14" />A̱mu a̱ nde'en maa gura tara ume wa ama a nda suru shi, ume u le u la'a ta̱ ucira u va̱. <verse eid="NUM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15" />Na̱ ne ɗa vaa yuwan na̱ a̱mu, waru na̱ n ta̱ tsura̱ isa'ani ya̱'a̱ wu, n te e ipati vu una mu gogo, she vu lyawa me ene a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a nda wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma Musa,&lt;&lt;Ɓolotowo mu ama kupocindere mbara ma Isra'ila, aza a na vu revei ele ɗa azagbain a ama'a, aza a na waru a casu tsugbain. Vu zuwa le a̱ ta̱wa̱ o Oogodo o Uga'asusan, e isawan lo na̱ a̱vu. <verse eid="NUM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17" />A̱mu n ta̱ cipa̱ n yuwan adanshi na̱ a̱vu uba̱ta̱'a̱. Waru n te kene ruhu na n ca nuwu a̱vu n ca le. A ta kamba wu matara mo ume wa ama'a, adama vu tara ume'e a̱vu a̱ nde'en wan.<verse eid="NUM 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18" />&lt;&lt;Damma ama'a a̱ ka̱mba̱to aciyele na akiza adama a na nfa'an a ta tama inama. Adama a na i yuwan ta̱ acingi a atsuvu a̱ A̱sulazuva, a dansa, &lt;A damma de tsu ta̱ tsura̱ inama i na tsaa tama! U shi ta̱ u la'aa tsu e iɗa ya Masar!&gt; &gt;&gt; Adama o ndolo A̱sulazuva a ta ca ɗu inama, i ta̱ gba aa tama. <verse eid="NUM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19" />Aa tama inama'a uranu u ta̱ shi, ko rana re, ko rana ton shi ko kupa, ko rana ushin goon shi. <verse eid="NUM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20" />Amma a̱ ta̱ a̱ da̱na̱ a tamusa inama'a hali woto u ta̱, hali u makan le, yaa ciga ee ene le shi, adama a na i 'yuwan ta̱ A̱sulazuva za na ri a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu, a̱vu i shon a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi a dansa, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai tsu lyawai iɗa ya Masar?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21" />Amma Musa damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;A̱mu ɗa nda a mmalu a ana oɓolo na ama ukpakukupa ukpakuta̱li (600,000), a̱vu ɗa nda gba vu dammai, &lt;N ta ca le inama i na aa tama i na yaa rawa le woto u ta̱!&gt; <verse eid="NUM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22" />Ko na a paɗa oɓolo e inan ni ikyon na̱ mgbele, u ta rawa le tama? Ko ne reme mugula m mala suru u ta rawa le?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ usu Musa, &lt;&lt;Ucira wu ukere u va̱ u ka̱la̱ma̱ ta̱? Gogo vu te ene ko adanshi a̱ va̱ a ta shiwan ko waa shiwan shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24" />A̱vu Musa uta̱ u damma ama'a ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai. A̱vu waru u ɓoloto mbara kupocindere, a̱vu u zuwa le e isawan uka̱nda̱ruwu no Oogodoꞌo. <verse eid="NUM 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ cipa̱ a̱tsuma̱ e eleshe a̱vu u yuwan adanshi na̱ a̱yi. A̱vu waru u tara a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ruhu na u cayi Musa, a̱vu u ca mbara kupocindere n ndolo. Mantsa ma na ruhu cipa̱i a aci e le, a̱vu a fara adansa ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱, agba diga lo a yuwisan ne waru shi. <verse eid="NUM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26" />Agba mbara n re n shi ta̱ lo aza a na a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ wo oogodo oɓolo na̱ akapi a mbara shi, ala e le a ɗa Elida na̱ Meda. A̱ shi ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a mbara n na e kecei, amma o uta̱ a̱ tyo o oogodo'o shi. A̱vu ele fo a fara adansa ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱'a̱ <verse eid="NUM 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27" />A̱vu molobo mo ro ma suma ni ilaɗi a̱vu u damma Musa, &lt;&lt;Elida na̱ Meda a ta yuwusan adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ a̱tsuma̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28" />Josuwa ulobo wa̱ Nun, kambi va Musa a̱yi o ulobo, u yuwan ta̱ adanshi u damma, &lt;&lt;Musa zagbain va̱, putsa le!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29" />Amma Musa usu yi ta̱ u damma, &lt;&lt;Vu ta yuwusan tsushu'un adama a̱ va̱? N shi ta̱ a ciga ama a̱ A̱sulazuva suru o o'wo ama̱sula̱, reve A̱sulazuva a zuwaa le ruhu va̱ yi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30" />A̱vu Musa na̱ mbara ma aza a Isra'ila a̱ ka̱mba̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱.<verse eid="NUM 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱yi na̱ nroni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a zuwa upepu u ro u ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ nroni diga a mala. A̱vu nroni mo oco pe uba̱ta̱ u na a̱ da̱na̱i uva̱lu, na̱ ba̱ta̱ na da̱na̱i suru uka̱nda̱ruwu nu uva̱la̱ta̱'a̱. Na̱ nge'en mu uva̱la̱ta̱'a̱ suru, ana a ta'atsu a ɗa goon aa gura 'yawan zuva. A̱ nge'en suru a̱bunda̱ e le e reme ta̱ alanga a mmalu mu urana u ta̱. <verse eid="NUM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32" />A̱vu ama'a o uta̱ a uwa mereme mo nroni, nu usana na ayin hali rana re. Ko za kuɗa̱ o ɓoloto nroni n na n rawai kilo ukpaku (100) shi. A̱vu e 'yetsu le uba̱ta̱ biti o uva̱la̱ta̱'a̱. <verse eid="NUM 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33" />Amma ele pe a̱tsuma̱ o utamu, inama ubuwu a̱ na̱ le kafu o soɗu, a̱vu upan wa̱ A̱sulazuva u cipa̱ a aci a ama'a a̱vu u lapa le na̱ mɓa̱la̱ n vama. <verse eid="NUM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34" />Adama o ndolo a ɗa e ɗeyi ala o uba̱ta̱'a̱ Kibirot Hatava, adama a na lo ɗa a̱ ciɗoi ama a na a yuwain utsa̱n.<verse eid="NUM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35" />Diga Kibirot Hatava a̱vu ama'a a yuwan mmalu a̱ tyo Hazero, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ lo.<verse eid="NUM 11:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12" />
  <para style="s">Maryamu na̱ Haruna a yuwan ta̱ tsushu'un na̱ Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1" />Mantsa ma na a̱ da̱na̱i Hazero, Maryamu na̱ Haruna a yuwusaan ta̱ Musa adanshi a avama adama a ka va̱ yi usheli wa̱ Kush na u zuwai. <verse eid="NUM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2" />A̱vu a damma, &lt;&lt;Musa ɗa goon A̱sulazuva a yuwain adanshi na̱ a̱yi? A̱tsu gba, u yuwan adanshi na̱ a̱tsu fo shi?&gt;&gt; A̱vu gba A̱sulazuva a uwwa ili i na aa dansa.<verse eid="NUM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3" />Musa gba za vu uvotowun wu ugbozu u ɗa lon, za na la'ai koyan o urewesu wu uvaɗi u nda uvotowun wu ugbozu.<verse eid="NUM 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4" />Babu usa̱n a̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma Musa na̱ Haruna na̱ Maryamu, &lt;&lt;Uta̱i i 'ya̱wa̱ o Oogodo o Uga'asusan a̱ɗu ama a ta'atsu.&gt;&gt; A̱vu a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ mataꞌatsu me le. <verse eid="NUM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ cipa̱ a̱tsuma̱ o oɓolo e eleshe, wi isawan o una̱ntsu wo oogodoꞌo, a̱vu u ɗe Haruna na̱ Maryamu. A̱vu a rawa zuzu nu una̱ntsu wo oogodoꞌo. Ana ele ra a̱ ta̱wa̱i elime, <verse eid="NUM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6" />a̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma, &lt;&lt;I polo atsuvu na adanshi a̱ va̱, a̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 12:6">&lt;&lt;Na̱ vumava̱sula̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:6">n tsu roco yi ta̱ aciya̱va̱ a̱tsuma̱ a alavu alavu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:6">n tsu yuwaan yi ta̱ adanshi a̱tsuma̱ a alavu.<verse eid="NUM 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7" />Ne ɗa n tsu yuwan adanshi na aagbashi a̱ va̱ Musa shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:7">n te inda yi na̱ a̱ɓula̱ o u'wa u va̱ suru.<verse eid="NUM 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8" />N tsu yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ a̱yi esu esu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">a alanga eteshe, agba a̱tsuma̱ e irumbu shi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">A̱yi u tsee ene ta̱ oroci a̱ va̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 12:8">Nye i zuwai yu uwwai wovon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">u na yaa yuwan adanshi a avama a aci aagbashi a̱ va̱ Musa shi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a yuwan upan ne ele lon, a̱vu u ꞌyon u lyawa le. <verse eid="NUM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10" />Mantsa ma na oɓolo e eleshe'e a̱ 'yoyin zuva vo oogodoꞌo, reve mɓa̱la̱ mu ukutu n remeshi Maryamu, a̱vu ukwan wa̱ yi u u'ura̱na̱ tsa̱ tsikilu. Ana Haruna vadalai u ka̱lyuwa̱ niyi, a̱vu we ene ukutu u reme yi ta̱. <verse eid="NUM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11" />A̱vu Haruna damma Musa, &lt;&lt;Zagbain va̱, n te ipati ya̱ wu she vu ca tsu a̱tsuma̱lima̱ adama o unusu u tsulo tsa na tsu yuwain wan. <verse eid="NUM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12" />She vu lyawa yi wo o'wo tsa̱ mereɓu ma na a matsain nu upasu u lipu va̱ yi ushamu wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13" />A̱vu Musa showen A̱sulazuva u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sula̱, n te ipati ya̱ wu vu ka̱mba̱to yi gbaga!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14" />Amma A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱ Musa, &lt;&lt;Na̱ shi aa damma dada va̱ yi tsuwa̱n yi ta̱ ma̱tsa̱n o urewesu, u shi a yuwan rana cindere a uwwusa wono shi? To vu uta̱a̱ yi diga pe o uva̱la̱ta̱ u yuwan rana cindere a alanga. Na a yuwan ne a ta gura ka̱mbuwa̱ yi pe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15" />A̱vu o uta̱a̱ Maryamu diga pe o uva̱la̱ta̱ hali rana cindere. Agba ama a̱ ꞌyon uba̱ta̱'a̱ shi, she na a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ niyi.<verse eid="NUM 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16" />Ana a yuwain ne a̱vu ama'a a̱ ꞌyon diga Hazero a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ A̱tsumona a Faran.<verse eid="NUM 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13" />
  <para style="s">Matawa mo utyo ma Kaꞌana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:19-33">U.Wl 1:19-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ Musa, u damma, <verse eid="NUM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2" />&lt;&lt;Vu lyungu ama a̱ ꞌya̱wa̱ a tawa utyo wi iɗa ya Kaꞌana, za na maa ca ama a Israꞌila. Diga o ugundo wu nkaya o ugundo wa aza a Israꞌila suru, vu lyungu zagbain ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3" />Reve o udammu wa̱ A̱sulazuva, Musa lyungu le diga A̱tsumona a Faran. Suru nle azagbain a Israꞌila a ɗa. <verse eid="NUM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4" />Nda ala e le,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 13:4" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 13:4">diga o ugundo wa̱ Roben, Shamuwa ulobo wa Zaku,<verse eid="NUM 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5" />diga o ugundo wa Saminu, Shafa ulobo wa̱ Hori,<verse eid="NUM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6" />diga o ugundo wa Yahuza, Keleb ulobo wa̱ Jefune,<verse eid="NUM 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7" />diga o ugundo wa Isaka, Iga ulobo wa̱ Isuhu,<verse eid="NUM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8" />diga o ugundo wa Ifiramu, Hosiya ulobo wa̱ Nun,<verse eid="NUM 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9" />diga o ugundo wa Banyami, Palti ulobo wa Rafu,<verse eid="NUM 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10" />diga o ugundo wa Zebulun, Gadiye ulobo wa̱ Sodi,<verse eid="NUM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11" />diga o ugundo wa Manase, a̱tsuma̱ o ugundo wa̱ Isuhu u ta̱, Gadi ulobo wa Susi,<verse eid="NUM 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12" />diga o ugundo wa Dan, Amiye ulobo wa Gemali,<verse eid="NUM 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13" />diga o ugundo wa Asha, Setu ulobo wa Mika'ilu,<verse eid="NUM 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14" />diga o ugundo wa Nafutali, Nabi ulobo wa̱ Vosi,<verse eid="NUM 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15" />diga o ugundo wa Gado, Geyuwe ulobo wa Maki.<verse eid="NUM 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16" />Ele nda ele ɗa ala a ama a na Musa lyunguyi a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a tawa utyo wi iɗa'a. Musa ca ta̱ Hosiya ulobo wa̱ Nun aala Josuwa.<verse eid="NUM 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17" />Mantsa ma na Musa lyungu nle a tawa utyo wi iɗa ya Ka'ana, reve u damma le, &lt;&lt;Diga lo i kuru upasu wu ugana a̱ tyo Nege, a̱vu i kuru a̱ tyo upasu u masasan e iɗa ya agaɗi. <verse eid="NUM 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18" />I ka̱lyuwa̱ cine iɗa'a u ri, na̱ cine ama'a a̱ ri, ko ama'a a̱ ta̱ a̱bunda̱ ko a̱ ri a̱bunda̱ shi, waru ko a̱ ta̱ nu ucira ko babu ucira. <verse eid="NUM 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19" />I ka̱lyuwa̱ i reve ko iɗa i na a̱ ri nden u tu ulobonu, ko u ri ulobonu shi. A̱vu waru i ka̱lyuwa̱ icu'un yi ilyuci i ne ɗa a̱ ri pe nden, waru i ka̱lyuwa̱ ilyuci'i a̱ ta̱ nu ukari ko a̱ ri na̱ a̱yi shi. <verse eid="NUM 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20" />I ka̱lyuwa̱ cine iɗa'a i ri, ko u tu nu umili ko u ri nu umili shi, waru ko u ta̱ na̱ ɗanga ko babu. I yuwan a̱tyo o ukadu a̱ ɗu i ta̱wa̱a̱ tsu na̱ muwun mu ɗanga mi iɗa i le tse ene.&gt;&gt; A mantsa ma nda gba a̱ tsu tsura̱ ta̱ winu wu ufaru u muwun n inabi.<verse eid="NUM 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21" />Reve a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a tawa utyo wi iɗa'a diga A̱tsumona a̱ Zin hali a̱ tyo a̱ lyuci va Reho, zuzu na̱ Lebo Hamat. <verse eid="NUM 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22" />A̱vu a̱ kuru a̱ tyo upasu wa Nege hali a rawa Heburon. Uba̱ta̱ u ɗaɗa limatan va Anaku ri na̱ nden, ele ɗa Ahiman na̱ Sheshai, na̱ Talmai vu ugundo wa̱ a̱ba̱jini a ama. A suwa ta̱ Heburon a'wan e cindere kafu a suwa Zowa a̱tsuma̱ a Masar. <verse eid="NUM 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23" />Ana a rawai o uka̱ri wa Eshikol, reve o koɗo eten a na a̱ ri no ojuɓo a̱ muwun n ina̱bi za ta̱, ama e re ɗa tanu niyi o uvangaci u le. A̱vu waru a ta'an muwun mu uɗanga m peme na̱ muwun mo oroci mu ubiri. <verse eid="NUM 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24" />E ɗe ta̱ aala o uba̱ta̱'a̱ Uka̱ri wa Eshikol, adama o ojuɓo a̱ muwun mu uɗanga n ina̱bi n na aza a Isra'ila o koɗoi diga ɗe.<verse eid="NUM 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25" />O ukosu wu rana amunga, reve a̱ ka̱mba̱ diga matawa mo utyo me iɗa'a.<verse eid="NUM 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ucuɗuwu adama a matawa mo utyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26" />Reve a̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Musa na̱ Haruna na ama a Isra'ila suru a Kedesh A̱tsumona a Faran. Lo ɗa a cuɗuwa nle no oɓolo a ama suru, a̱vu o roco le limatan vu ɗanga vi iɗaꞌa. <verse eid="NUM 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27" />Reve a damma Musa, &lt;&lt;Tsu ꞌya̱wa̱ ta̱ e iɗa i na vu lyungu ntsu'u, tse ene ta̱ iɗaꞌa, u ta̱ nu umili a̱bunda̱ lon. Nda limatan vu ɗanga vi iɗaꞌa. <verse eid="NUM 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28" />Agba ama a na a̱ ri pe nden a̱ ta̱ nu ucira lon, waru a̱ ta̱ ni ilyuci i gbagbain, waru a̱ tu uka̱nda̱ruwu nu ukari. Waru tse ene ta̱ ugundo wa Anaku aza a na a̱ ri pe na̱ nden! <verse eid="NUM 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29" />Aza a Amaleka a̱ ta̱ nden Nege, aza a Hitiya na aza a Jebusiya na aza a Amoriya a̱ ta̱ nden e iɗa ya agaɗi. Aza a Ka'ana waru a̱ ta̱ nden zuzu na̱ mala zuzu nu Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu waru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30" />Reve gba Keleb zuwa ama'a a̱ rungwa̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma Musa u damma, &lt;&lt;Tsu gawain tsu 'ya̱wa̱i tsu usai iɗaꞌa. N reve ta̱ tsu ta gura usa yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31" />Agba aza a na a̱ ꞌya̱wa̱i e iɗa'a oɓolo na̱ a̱yi a damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Tsaa gura yuwan uvon ne ele shi, a laꞌa tsu ta̱ ucira.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32" />Reve a ca alabari o uwuyanu a̱tsuma̱ a ama a Israꞌila adama e iɗa i na a tawai utyo, a dansa, &lt;&lt;Iɗa i na tsu tawai utyo'o u ta lyuwusa ama a̱ yi. Waru ama a na tse enei pe a̱ba̱jini a̱ba̱jini a ama a ɗa. <verse eid="NUM 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33" />Waru tse ene ta̱ ɗe a̱ba̱jini a̱ba̱jini a ama o ugundo wa Anaku, aza a na a̱ ta̱wa̱i diga Nefili. Tso o'wo ta̱ tsa aapapari e yeni i tsu, ne ɗa gba tsu ri e ekere e le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14" />
  <para style="s">U'ya̱susa̱n wa aci wa aza a Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1" />A̱tsuma̱ a ayin o ndolo, reve ama suru a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n uɗyo u le a̱vu a uwa mesun. <verse eid="NUM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2" />Reve aza a Isra'ila suru a yuwusaan Musa na̱ Haruna adanshawuya, a̱vu oɓolo a ama'a suru a damma le, &lt;&lt;Tsu shi ta̱ tsu laꞌa ciga tsu kuwa̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Masar! Ko gba a̱ a̱tsumona a nda! <verse eid="NUM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3" />Adama a̱ nye a ɗa A̱sulazuva ta̱wa̱to ntsu e iɗa i nda adama o una tsu na̱ matsun me pe'eni? E te reme a̱ma̱ci a̱ tsu na̱ muwun n tsu. Waa laꞌaa tsu tsu ka̱mba̱ e iɗa ya Masar shi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4" />A̱vu a dammulai va̱ni le, &lt;&lt;Tsu ɗangwayi aciya̱tsu zagbain, reve tsu ka̱mba̱i Masar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5" />Reve Musa na̱ Haruna o von ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma amaꞌa suru. <verse eid="NUM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6" />A̱vu Josuwa ulobo wa̱ Nun na̱ Keleb ulobo wa̱ Jefune aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i a̱tsuma̱ a aza a na a̱ ꞌya̱wa̱i matawa mo utyo me iɗa'a a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ lo mishin, a kara a̱tugu e le. <verse eid="NUM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7" />A̱vu a damma amaꞌa suru, &lt;&lt;Iɗa i na tsu utula̱i matawa mo utyo'o u tu ulobonu u na u ka̱ra̱la̱i. <verse eid="NUM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8" />Nna̱ A̱sulazuva a uwwa uyoꞌo u tsu, u ta tara tsu a̱ ꞌya̱wa̱ ɗe iɗa i na yee yenishe maani ni ishiki reve u ca tsu a̱yi. <verse eid="NUM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9" />She i yuwaan A̱sulazuva aciyogbamu wan, waru she yu uwwa wovon wa ama e iɗaꞌa wan. Adama a na tsu ta lyuwa le. Ugeshete u le u buwa shi, A̱sulazuva o to oɓolo na̱ a̱tsu, she yu uwwa wovon u le wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10" />Reve ama a Israꞌila suru a a damma a ta vara le na atali adama o una le. Reve tsugbain tsa̱ A̱sulazuva tsa̱ cipa̱ zuva vo Oogodo o Uga'asusan uba̱ta̱ wa ama a Israꞌila suru. <verse eid="NUM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma Musa, &lt;&lt;Hali mantsa ma̱ ne ma ɗa ama a nda o rono mu e iɗa? Hali mantsa ma̱ ne ma ɗa a̱ kuɗa̱ a̱ usu mu, suru nu ulinga wa asalama u na n yuwain a̱tsuma̱ e le? <verse eid="NUM 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12" />N ta faba le na̱ mɓa̱la̱, a̱vu mu kasa le na agadu e le. Agba n ta yuwan iɗa i gbain i ro nu ucira na̱ a̱vu i na i la'a nle.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13" />Amma Musa damma ta̱ A̱sulazuva, &lt;&lt;Aza a Masar a ta uwwa alabari a nda! Nu ucira wa̱ wu u ɗa vu uta̱yi ama a nda a̱tsuma̱ e le. <verse eid="NUM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14" />A̱ ta̱ gba a damma aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden e iɗa i nda aɗa a nda. A uwwa ta̱ ɗe a na a̱vu A̱sulazuva, vu ta̱ oɓolo na ama a nda. Waru a̱vu A̱sulazuva, e ene wu ta̱ esu ne esu, a na eleshe a̱ wu a̱ tsi isawan zuva le waru vu tsu wala ta̱ elime e le a̱tsuma̱ o oɓolo e eleshe nu urana na a atsura a akina na ayin. <verse eid="NUM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15" />Gogo na̱ vu una ama a nda suru nu uta̱, nɗa n na mu uwwai aɗa a̱ wu a ta damma, <verse eid="NUM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16" />&lt;O una̱ u na A̱sulazuva a gura 'ya̱wa̱toi ama a nda a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na u kucinai a na waa ca le shi, a̱yi ɗa i zuwai wu una nle ɗe a̱tsumona.&gt;<verse eid="NUM 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17" />&lt;&lt;Gogo lyawa ucira wa̱ A̱sulazuva wu uta̱ a alanga, cine vu dammai: <verse eid="NUM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:18" />&lt;A̱mu A̱sulazuva n tsu yuwan upan go'o shi, za va̱ a̱bunda̱ e icigi, za vu u yuwusan u gafura wi iwuya nu unusu. Suru na̱ ne, za na a̱a̱ kuɗa̱ ca za vu unusu oforo a ɗa shi, u tsu ca ta̱ muwun oforo adama o unusu wu mbara n le hali a̱ tyo mantsa ma ta'atsu na̱ ma̱ na̱shi.&gt; <verse eid="NUM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19" />Adama a̱ a̱bunda̱ e icigi ya̱ wu za na tsu vadala shi, n te ipati ya̱ wu vu yuwaan ama a nda gafura vu unusu u le, cine vu yuwaan nle diga mantsa ma na a lyawai iɗa ya Masar hali a cina ana'an.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;N yuwaan le ta̱ gafura, cine vu patiyi. <verse eid="NUM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21" />Amma n kucina ta̱ na̱ wuma u va̱, waru na̱ cine tsugbain tsa̱ A̱sulazuva tso shiton uvaɗi ma̱ɓula̱, <verse eid="NUM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22" />ama'a suru aza a na e enei tsugbain tsa̱ va̱ ni iroci vu linga va asalama a na n yuwain a̱tsuma̱ a Masar na̱ a̱tsumona, suru na̱ ne gba a̱ lyungwa̱ mu ta̱ toto kupa, waru a̱vu a 'yuwan a yuwan tsutoni nu uɗyo u va̱, <verse eid="NUM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23" />ko vuma ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e le ee ene iɗa i na n kucinai i na maa ca nkaya n le shi. Ko vuma ta̱ na rono numu ee iɗa'a e ene yi shi <verse eid="NUM 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24" />Amma adama a na aagbashi a̱ va̱ Keleb a̱ ri na̱ cu'un ruhu ro ko'o waru u kuru numu no okolo a̱ ta̱, n ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱to yi iɗa i na u 'ya̱wa̱i, waru u to o'wo agadu o ugundo wa̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25" />Gogo gba ana wo o'woi, aza a Amaleka na aza a Ka'ana a̱ ta̱ nden a̱ ka̱ri, nfa'an she i vadala i reme ure a̱ tyo a̱tsumona o ure u na u kuruyi a̱ tyo a Mala ma̱ Shili.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Musa na̱ Haruna: <verse eid="NUM 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27" />&lt;&lt;Uyan ama a wuya a nda a̱ da̱na̱ a adanshawuya a aci a̱ va̱? Mu uwwa ta̱ mesun ma adanshawuya ma ama a Israꞌila a nda. <verse eid="NUM 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28" />Gogo vu damma le, &lt;A̱mu A̱sulazuva n kucina ta̱ na̱ wuma u va̱ n ta yuwan na̱ a̱ɗu ili i na mu uwwa nɗu a dansa: <verse eid="NUM 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29" />I ta̱ kuwa̱ suru nɗu a̱tsumona a nda! Za na e kecei suru aza a na a̱ ri aꞌwan ushin ko aza a na a pasai a'wan ushin aza a na a yuwaan numu adanshawuya. <verse eid="NUM 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30" />Agba ko za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a amaꞌa aa uwa e iɗa i na n kucinai a na a̱a̱ da̱nu shi. She Keleb ulobo wa̱ Jefune na̱ Josuwa ulobo wa̱ Nun. <verse eid="NUM 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31" />Muwun n ɗu gba a na i dammai a̱ ta̱ pura̱ le o uvon, n ta̱ ta̱wa̱to le a uwwa uyo'o wi iɗa i na i ꞌyuwain. <verse eid="NUM 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32" />A̱ɗu gba i ta̱ kuwa̱, lipu ɗu to oco a̱tsumona a nda. <verse eid="NUM 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33" />Muwun n ɗu n to o'wo aza a agara a̱tsumona a'wan amunga, o sowuso a̱tsuma̱lima̱ adama o ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱ ɗu, hali mantsa ma na vuma vu ukosu ɗu kuwa̱i a̱tsumona. <verse eid="NUM 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34" />I to sowo a̱tsuma̱lima̱ adama o unusu u ɗu hali a'wan amunga, o una̱ wu rana amunga a na i yuwain a tawasa utyo wi iɗa'a, usana u ta̱ o una̱ wa aa'wan a̱ ta̱. Ne ɗa yaa tara ume wu unusu u ɗu, waru i ta̱ reve ili i ke'en i ɗa shi upan u va̱ u cipa̱ a aci a vuma.&gt; <verse eid="NUM 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35" />A̱mu A̱sulazuva n damma ta̱, waru amayun n ta yuwan ne a aci a̱ ɗu, a̱ɗu iɓolo ya ama a wuya a na o ɓoloi una̱ adama a̱ va̱. A̱tsumona a nda a ɗa yoo koto suru nɗu, koyan ɗu ta̱ kuwa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36" />Ama a na Musa lyunguyi a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a tawa utyo wi iɗa, aza a na a̱ ka̱mba̱i reve a zuwa iɓolo ya ama'a suru a yuwaan A̱sulazuva adanshawuya adama a alabari a vama a na a cayi adama e iɗa'a, <verse eid="NUM 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37" />ama a nda aza a na a cayi aalabari a vama adama e iɗa'a, A̱sulazuva a faba le ta̱ na̱ mɓa̱la̱ a̱vu a̱ kuwa̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38" />A̱tsuma̱ a ama a na a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a tawai utyo wi iɗa'a Josuwa ulobo wa̱ Nun na̱ Keleb ulobo wa Jefune ɗa goon la'ai.<verse eid="NUM 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39" />Ana Musa dammai ama a Isra'ila ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai reve a uwa a̱tsumola̱ngu lon. <verse eid="NUM 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40" />Na̱ wasasa reve a̱ ꞌyon a̱ kuru ure a̱ tyo upasu wi iɗa ya agaɗi, adansa, &lt;&lt;A̱tsu ɗa nda, ufoɓu u ɗa tsu ri adama tsu 'ya̱wa̱ e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva a yuwain nzuwulai n na waa ca tsu. Tsu usu ta̱ tsu yuwan ta̱ unusu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41" />Amma Musa damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai yaa pasasa udammu wa̱ A̱sulazuva, mayan ne wa̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ nu ulyuwu we elime shi! <verse eid="NUM 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42" />She i 'ya̱wa̱ a gawan wan, adama a na A̱sulazuva a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu shi, n'yuwatan n ɗu n ta lyuwa ɗu. <verse eid="NUM 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43" />Adama a na aza a Amaleka na aza a Ka'ana a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ɗu nu uvon uba̱ta̱'a̱, a̱ to una ɗu na̱ matsun me pe'eni. Adama a na i vadala ta̱ i lyawa itoni ya̱ A̱sulazuva, A̱sulazuva gba wa̱a̱ da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44" />Amma suru na̱ ne a majiyan me le a gawan ta̱ a̱ tyo upasu wa agaɗi wi iɗa'a, ko na wo o'woi ko Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva, ko Musa a̱ ꞌyon diga o uva̱la̱ta̱ shi. <verse eid="NUM 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45" />Reve aza a Amaleka na aza a Ka'ana aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden upasu wa agaɗi wi iɗa'a, a̱ za̱nluwa̱ a̱ cipa̱a̱ le nu uvon. A̱vu a lyuwa aza a Isra'ila hali a̱ tyo e iɗa ya Homa.<verse eid="NUM 14:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15" />
  <para style="s">Re mayan ma̱ kucci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ Musa u damma, <verse eid="NUM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:2" />&lt;&lt;Yuwan adanshi na aza a Isra'ila vu damma le, &lt;Ni i uwa e iɗa i na maa ca ɗu wo o'wo ɗu uda̱na̱ta̱, <verse eid="NUM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3" />na̱ yaa ca A̱sulazuva kucci na aa yuwan na akina, kucci'i u to o'wo diga o oɓolo e inan ko e ikyon, ko e mgbele. Na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu ɗa, ko kucci vu ushitosun wa akucunu, ko za vu ucasu nu ucigu wo okolo, ko kucci va̱ a̱buki a na a zuwai, adama u ca A̱sulazuva ma̱guru mo uyo'o, <verse eid="NUM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4" />suru za na aa ca cu'un kucci ndolo a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, u ta ca waru kucci vi ishina. Kucci vi ishina'a u to o'wo ukunzuwu u ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa u yira i lashi, za na o umbai na̱ meden ma̱ ta̱ ma mani'in ma̱ zetun. <verse eid="NUM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:5" />Waru na̱ waa ca mokyokyon ma̱ ta̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu u ɓolo yi na̱ meden ma̱ ta̱ ma̱ masayan ma̱ ina̱bi adama a̱ kucci vi ili yo oso.<verse eid="NUM 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Na̱ kucci'i za va̱ a̱a̱giri'i ɗa u ɓolo yi na̱ kucci vi ishina nu ukunzuwu ure a̱tsuma̱ a kupa u yira i lashi uja̱mba̱ru na̱ meden ma̱ ta̱ wu ukunzuwu uta'atsu u mani'in ma̱ zetun. <verse eid="NUM 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7" />Waru adama a̱ kucci vi ili yo oso, u ca meden ma̱ ta̱ wu ukunzuwu uta'atsu ma masayan, ili i ma̱guru mo uyo'o e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva.<verse eid="NUM 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu'u za moggono ma nan ma ɗa ko kucci ro, adama o ushitosun wa akucunu, ko kucci vu nden m muwwulai a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, <verse eid="NUM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9" />u to ɓolo moggono ma na'an na̱ makundatsu ma ta'atsu a̱tsuma̱ a kupa i yira i lashi uja̱mba̱ru nu uɓatsulai u meden ma mani'in. <verse eid="NUM 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10" />Waru u ta ca akapi e meden a masayan kucci vi ili yo oso. U to o'wo kucci na a yuwain na akina, ili i ma̱guru mo uyo'o e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="NUM 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11" />&lt;&lt;Ne tsunda tsa ɗa oo foɓo ogono a nan ko a̱giri'i, ko mugiri'i ko mugbgbele. <verse eid="NUM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12" />Ne ɗa vaa yuwan na̱ za ta̱ suru, cine vu foɓoi a̱bunda̱ e le suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Umatsun wi iɗa wa Isra'ila suru u ta̱ kuru wila̱ u nda mantsa ma na waa casu kucci na a cayi na akina, kucci ma̱guru ma̱ uyo'o e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="NUM 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14" />Na̱ mocin na ri oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu, ko za na ta̱wa̱i pe na̱ nden suru suru, u ciga u ca kucci na a tsu ca na akina, kucci ma̱guru e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱yi fo u ta yuwan cine i yuwain tsoyi. <verse eid="NUM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15" />Ama e iɗa'a suru oɓolo no omocin a na a̱ ri pe nden e iɗa'a a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ na̱ wila̱ u ta̱. A̱yi nda u to o'wo ɗu wila̱ babu ukotu nu umatsun we elime. A̱ɗu no omocin a na a̱ ri nden a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu, i to o'wo una̱ta̱ e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="NUM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16" />Wila̱ ni ili i na a̱a̱ kuru i ta̱ i ɗa, nu umatsun wi iɗa ko mocin na ri nden a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Musa u damma, <verse eid="NUM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18" />&lt;&lt;Vu yuwan adanshi na aza a Isra'ila vu damma le: &lt;Ni i uwa e iɗa i na maa tara ɗu a̱ tyo, <verse eid="NUM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19" />mantsa ma na i gasai itana yu uɗuma̱ yi iɗa'a, i tawa ozo o ro kucci a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="NUM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20" />I ta̱wa̱a̱ ne emeshen a na a yuwain na̱ yira i na i fara irai, i ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱yi tsu ucasu diga o osoroto. <verse eid="NUM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21" />Diga gogo hali a limatan ve elime i ta ca A̱sulazuva kucci nda i yira yu ufaru yi itana ya̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ɗu.<verse eid="NUM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kucci vu unusu u na a yuwain nu ucigu shi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Gogo gba na̱ wo o'wo babu ucigu i kuɗa̱ a̱ kuru wila̱ u na A̱sulazuva a cayi Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23" />ili i na A̱sulazuva a ca nɗu o una̱ wa Musa suru, diga urana u na A̱sulazuva a ca nle hali a̱ tyo limatan ve elime, <verse eid="NUM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24" />waru na a yuwan ili i nda babu ucigu, ama e iɗa'a a̱ ri nu urevu wa̱ yi shi, iɗa'a suru a ta ca kucci moggono ma nan kucci vu ukula̱tosu ili i ma̱guru mo uyo'o e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ishina na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso cine a zuwai, na̱ ma̱ga̱ji adama a̱ kucci vu unusu. <verse eid="NUM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25" />Ganu ta ca kucci matara mo ume mo unusu adama a ama a Isra'ila suru. Waru a ta yuwaan le gafura. Adama a na nu ucigu u ɗa shi, a̱vu gba a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ A̱sulazuva na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu unusu u na a yuwain na akina. <verse eid="NUM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26" />A ta yuwaan ama a Isra'ila no omocin a na a̱ ri pe na̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ e le gafura, adama a na ama'a suru a yuwan ta̱ unusu babu ucigu u le.<verse eid="NUM 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Na̱ vuma ta̱ ɗa goon yuwain unusu babu ucigu, u ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ megbgbele ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ nu umatsun adama a̱ kucci vu unusu. <verse eid="NUM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28" />Ganu ta ca kucci matara mo ume mo unusu e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva adama a vuma na yuwain unusu babu ucigu, reve gba na a yuwan kucci matara mo ume mo unusu adama a̱ yi a ta yuwaan yi gafura. <verse eid="NUM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29" />Wila̱ u ta̱ u ɗa a̱yi ɗaɗa waru goon adama a vuma na yuwain unusu babu ucigu, ko a̱yi umatsun wi iɗa za va Isra'ila u ɗa ko mocin na ri na̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu ɗa.<verse eid="NUM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Amma za na suru yuwain unusu nu ucigu wa̱ yi, ko a̱yi umatsun wi iɗa u ɗa ko mocin ɗa, u yuwaan ta̱ A̱sulazuva unusu u gbain, a̱ ta̱ tawa yi a̱tsuma̱ a ama. <verse eid="NUM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31" />Adama a na u goro ta̱ adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu u kuɗa wila̱ wa̱ yi, a̱ ta̱ gba a tawa yi, unusu wa̱ yi u ta̱ a aci a̱ yi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ugana u makuɗa ma̱ wila̱ wa Ashibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32" />Mantsa ma na aza a Isra'ila a̱ da̱na̱i a̱tsumona, e reme ta̱ vuma ro o ɓolotosu ɗanga urana wa Ashibi. <verse eid="NUM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33" />Aza a na e reme niyi o ɓolotosu ɗanga'a, a tara yi ta̱ a̱ tyo ya Musa na̱ Haruna ni iɓolo ya ama suru. <verse eid="NUM 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34" />A̱vu a̱ ɓa̱ru yi uba̱ta̱ u ro, adama a na koto ne'en e reve ili na aa yuwan na̱ a̱yi shi. <verse eid="NUM 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma Musa, &lt;&lt;O una vuma'a, iɓolo ya ama'a suru a vuvara yi o ugyuru wu uva̱la̱ta̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36" />A̱vu iɓolo ya ama'a suru o uta̱a̱ yi ɗe o ugyuru wu uva̱la̱ta̱, a̱vu a vuvara yi na atali hali u kuwa̱, cine A̱sulazuva a dammai Musa.<verse eid="NUM 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alagba o utugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Musa u damma, <verse eid="NUM 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38" />&lt;&lt;Yuwan adanshi na aza a Isra'ila vu damma le, hali a̱ tyo limatan ve elime i ta̱ zula̱ alagba e elentsu a amuna a̱ ɗu, a̱vu i zuwa a̱punda̱ a̱ mini ma̱ bulu e elentsu suru. <verse eid="NUM 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39" />I yuwan alagba'a na ya̱a̱ da̱na̱ a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱, ne ɗa ya̱a̱ da̱na̱ a cuwusan na̱ wila̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, adama i kuru le, adama i yuwan tsushakala ni ili i na maluwa mo okolo a̱ ɗu ne esu a̱ ɗu a cigai wan. <verse eid="NUM 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40" />Ne ɗa ya̱a̱ da̱na̱ a̱ kurusu wila̱ u va̱ suru, a̱vu yo o'wo na akiza e ekere a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu. <verse eid="NUM 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41" />A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, za na uta̱a̱ nɗu diga e iɗa ya Masar adama mo o'wo A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu. A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16" />
  <para style="s">Aciyogbamu a̱ Kora na̱ Datan na̱ Abiram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1" />Urana u ro reve Kora ulobo wa Izara, mawun ma tsukaya ma̱ Koha, vu ugundo wa̱ Levi u yuwaan tsugbain tsa Musa aciyogbamu, Datan na̱ Abiram olobo a Eliyabu a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱yi, oɓolo na̱ On ulobo wa Pele umatsun wa̱ Roben. <verse eid="NUM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:2" />Reve ama a nda o ɓolo una̱ na aza a Israꞌila ama ukpakure na̱ kupoton (250), azagbain a na a ɗangulai a na ama e revei ne ele. <verse eid="NUM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3" />Reve ama'a o ɓoloto, a̱vu a̱ ꞌya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Musa na̱ Haruna, reve a damma le, &lt;&lt;Icigi i tsugbain tsa̱ ɗu tsu ura ta̱ wira̱! Ama suru a̱ ta̱ na akiza e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, waru A̱sulazuva o to oɓolo ne ele. Adama a̱ nye a ɗa i tarai aciya̱ɗu she damma i la'a ta̱ iɓolo ya ama a̱ A̱sulazuva a nda suru?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4" />Ana Musa uwwai ne, reve u von ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱ e iɗa. <verse eid="NUM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5" />Reve u damma Kora na aza a na oo tono yi, &lt;&lt;Nfa'an nu usana, A̱sulazuva o to roco za na ri za va̱ yi, na̱ za na ri na akiza, waru u ta zuwa vuma ndolo u rawa zuzu na̱ a̱yi. Za na u ɗangulai, a̱yi ɗa waa lyawa u rawa zuzu na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="NUM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6" />A̱vu Kora, na aza a na oo tono wu, nda ili na yaa yuwan: Nfa'an i tara ayimba o ukula̱tosu wa̱ a̱tsuka̱ a̱ ma̱guru. <verse eid="NUM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:7" />Waru i zuwa pe akina na̱ a̱tsuka̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. Vuma na A̱sulazuva a ɗangulai, a̱yi ɗa za va akiza. A̱ɗu nan Levi yu ura ta̱ wira̱!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8" />Reve waru Musa dammisa Kora, &lt;&lt;Gogo nda poloi atsuvu, a̱ɗu nan Levi! <verse eid="NUM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9" />U rawa ɗu a na A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila a tawa nɗu a̱tsuma̱ a akapi a ama a Isra'ila, a̱vu u ta̱wa̱to ɗu zuzu na̱ a̱yi, adama i yuwan ulinga o Oogodo o Uga'asusan, a̱vu yi isawan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma ama'a i yuwaan le a̱ga̱nda̱ shi? <verse eid="NUM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10" />U rawato ɗu ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ ɗu nan Levi zuzu na̱ a̱yi, agba gogo i to mpolo i tsura̱ tsuganu fo. <verse eid="NUM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11" />Adama o ndolo a̱ɗu na aza a na oo tono ɗu suru i 'ya̱sa̱a̱n ta̱ A̱sulazuva aci a na i ɓolotoi uba̱ta̱ u ta̱. Zane ɗa Haruna hali na yaa yuwusan adanshawuya a aci a̱ yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12" />Reve Musa lyungu e ɗe Datan na̱ Abiram, olobo a Eliyabu. Agba a̱vu a damma, &lt;&lt;Tsa̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ shi! <verse eid="NUM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13" />U rawa wu shi a na vu uta̱ ntsu diga e iɗa ya Masar, iɗa i na yee yeneshe maani ni ishiki, adama vu una tsu a̱tsumona? Gogo waru vu cigai ta̱ vo o'wo mogono ma̱ tsu ma ɗa? <verse eid="NUM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14" />Babu na̱ a̱yi ndolo, koto vu ta̱wa̱to tsu a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na yee yeneshe na̱ maani ni ishiki shi. Waru vu ca tsu agadu a̱ a̱ɗuma̱ na̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ina̱bi shi. Vu to mpolo vu luluma̱ tsu? O'o, tsa̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ shi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15" />A̱vu Musa yuwan upan lon, reve u damma A̱sulazuva, &lt;&lt;She vu ushi kucci le wan. Ko mololi ma̱ ta̱ n usa le i ɗa shi, agba n yuwaan za ro a̱tsuma̱ e le unusu shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16" />Reve Musa damma Kora, &lt;&lt;A̱vu na aza a na oo tono wu suru i ta̱wa̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva nfa'an, a̱vu ne ele na̱ Haruna. <verse eid="NUM 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17" />Vuma suru u tara aayimba o ukula̱tosu wa̱ a̱tsuka̱ a̱ yi, u tsun pe a̱tsuka̱, a̱vu u ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱yi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, ayimba ukpakure na̱ kupoton (250) suru suru. A̱vu na̱ Haruna fo i ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na ayimba o ukula̱tosu wa̱ a̱tsuka̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu vuma suru tara aayimba o ukula̱tosu wa̱ a̱tsuka̱, reve u tsun pe akina na̱ a̱tsuka̱. Reve e isawan oɓolo na̱ Musa na̱ Haruna o una̱ntsu wo Oogodo o Uga'asusan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19" />Ana Kora ɓolotoi aza a na oo tono yi suru a̱ nla̱ngi na̱ Musa o una̱ntsu wo Oogodo o Uga'asusan, reve tsugbain tsa̱ A̱sulazuva tsa̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wo oɓolo a ama'a suru. <verse eid="NUM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Musa na̱ Haruna adansa, <verse eid="NUM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21" />&lt;&lt;Kakasai aciya̱ɗu no oɓolo a ama a nda, tsura̱ n kototo le nu uta̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22" />Amma Musa na̱ Haruna o von ta̱ ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱ reve a damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sula̱, A̱sula̱ a wuma wu vaɗilima̱ suru. Vu ta yuwan upan no oɓolo a ama'a suru agba vuma ta̱ ɗa yuwain unusu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Musa u damma, <verse eid="NUM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24" />&lt;&lt;Vu damma iɓolo ya amaꞌa, &lt;Takatsuwai alanga no oogodo a̱ Kora na̱ Datan na̱ Abiram.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25" />Reve Musa ꞌyon u 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Datan na̱ Abiram reve mbara ma Isra'ila n kuru yi. <verse eid="NUM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26" />Reve Musa yuwan adanshi ni iɓolo ya ama'a u damma, &lt;&lt;Ka̱mba̱i na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ diga o ogodo a ama a vama a nda! Waru she i ju'wa̱n ko ili i ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e itana i le wan, na̱ ne ɗa shi a ta raɗa ɗu adama a̱ nusu le suru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27" />Ɗaɗa ama'a a takatsuwai diga o oogodo a Kora, na̱ Datan, na̱ Abiram. A̱vu Datan na̱ Abiram o uta̱ e isawan a̱ na̱ntsu vo ogodo e le, oɓolo na̱ a̱ma̱ci e le na̱ muwun n le na̱ muwun n kekeꞌen n le.<verse eid="NUM 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28" />Reve Musa damma ama a Israꞌila, &lt;&lt;Apa cine yee reve na A̱sulazuva a ɗa a̱ lyungu numu n yuwan ili i nda suru, waru uyuwun wa aciya̱va̱ u ɗa shi. <verse eid="NUM 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29" />Nna ama a nda a̱ kuwa̱ ukwa̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱, reve ili i na i tsu cina ama i cina le goon, to, A̱sulazuva a̱ lyungu mu shi. <verse eid="NUM 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30" />Agba n na̱ A̱sulazuva a yuwan ili i saꞌavu i ro ko'o, a̱vu iɗa i kpa̱tu'wa̱ reve u soɗu le, ni ili i na a̱ ri ne ele suru, a̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ cipa̱ wuma a̱tsuma̱ a ason, to, i te reve ama a nda o goro ta̱ A̱sulazuva.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31" />A̱yi o mokotoo ma adanshi a nda suru, reve iɗa i na a̱ ri mishin u ɓatsalai. <verse eid="NUM 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32" />A̱vu iɗaꞌa i kpa̱tuꞌwa̱ reve u soɗu le na ama a 'wa le suru, na ama a̱ Kora suru ni ili i na a̱ ri ne ele suru. <verse eid="NUM 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33" />Reve a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ cipa̱ pe a ason wuma, ni ili i na a̱ ri ne ele suru, a̱vu iɗa i kpa̱to le, a̱vu a̱ kuwa̱ reve a̱ puwa̱n diga a̱tsuma̱ a ama. <verse eid="NUM 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34" />Ana a uwwai yorori i le, ama a Isra'ila a na a̱ ri uka̱nda̱ruwu ne ele suru a suma ta̱, a dansa, &lt;&lt;Iɗa'a u to soɗu tsu fo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35" />Akina o uta̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva reve u kula̱to ama ukpakure na̱ kupoto'on (250) aza a na a̱ shi a̱ kula̱tosu a̱tsuka̱'a̱.<verse eid="NUM 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 16:36" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Musa u damma, <verse eid="NUM 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 16:37" />&lt;&lt;Damma Eliyaza ulobo wa Haruna ganu wu tawa ayimba o ukula̱tosu wa̱ a̱tsuka̱'a̱ diga uba̱ta̱ u na akina a̱ kula̱toi ama'a. A̱vu a baza akinkina'a takaci adama a na ayimba'a a̱ ta̱ na akiza. <verse eid="NUM 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 16:38" />Ayimba o ukula̱tosu wa̱ a̱tsuka̱ wa ama a nda aza a na a̱ kuwa̱i adama a̱ nusu le, lyawa a ruma le o'woto le mkpa̱ta̱tsu m masa'a, adama a na a ca ta̱ A̱sulazuva ele, a̱vu a tawa le na akiza. Lyawa le o o'wo iroci e ekere a aza a Isra'ila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 16:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 16:39" />&lt;&lt;Reve Eliyaza ganu ɓoloto ayimba a̱ rumushili wa aza a na o unai na̱ ta̱wa̱yi, a̱vu a ruma le o o'wo mkpa̱ta̱tsu m masa'a, <verse eid="NUM 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 16:40" />cine A̱sulazuva a damma niyi o una̱ wa Musa. A̱yi nda u ta cuwaan aza a Isra'ila a na ko vuma ta̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱ u kula̱to a̱tsuka̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva shi she ugundo wa Haruna goon, na̱ ne ɗa shi u to o'wo tsa̱ Kora na aza a na oo tono yi.<verse eid="NUM 16:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 16:41" />&lt;&lt;Ana usana u tawai reve aza a a Isra'ila suru a yuwaan Musa na̱ Haruna adanshawuya. Reve a damma, &lt;Yu una ta̱ ama a̱ A̱sulazuva.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 16:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 16:42" />Amma a mantsa ma na iɓolo ya ama a Isra'ila i ɓolotoi adama a yuwan nla̱ngi ne ele, a̱vu Musa na̱ Haruna a vadala urewesu u le a̱ tyo o Oogodo o Uga'asusan, babu usa̱n reve eleshe a̱ ɓa̱ru yi, reve tsugbain tsa̱ A̱sulazuva tso uta̱. <verse eid="NUM 16:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 16:43" />Reve Musa na̱ Haruna a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo elime o Oogodo o Uga'asusa'an. <verse eid="NUM 16:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 16:44" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Musa u damma, <verse eid="NUM 16:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 16:45" />&lt;&lt;Kakasai aciya̱ɗu ni iɓolo i ndolo tsa̱ra̱ n kototo le nu uta̱.&gt;&gt; Reve Musa na̱ Haruna o von ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱.<verse eid="NUM 16:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 16:46" />Reve Musa damma Haruna, &lt;&lt;Tara aayimba a̱ wu vu tsun pe a̱tsuka̱, oɓolo na akinkina diga a masa'a. Reve vu jika̱ vu 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wi iɓolo'o, vu yuwan kucci matara mo ume mo unusu adama e le. Upan wu uta̱ ta̱ diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, mɓa̱la̱ n teme ta̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 16:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 16:47" />Reve Haruna yuwan cine Musa dammai. A̱vu u ꞌyon ni ilaɗi a̱ tyo e memere me iɓolo ya ama'a. Mɓa̱la̱ n shi ta̱ ɗe n fara, amma Haruna ca ta̱ kucci va̱ a̱tsuka̱'a̱, reve u yuwan kucci matara mo ume mo unusu adama o unusu wa ama'a. <verse eid="NUM 16:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 16:48" />Reve wi isawan e memere ma̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱ na aza a wuma, reve mɓa̱la̱ mi isawan. <verse eid="NUM 16:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 16:49" />Amma suru na̱ ne ama a na a̱ kuwa̱i adama a̱ mɓa̱la̱'a̱, a rawa ta̱ ama ukpakukupa kupa ukpakukupa una̱shi nu ukpaku ucindere (14,700) babu na aza na a̱ kuwa̱i adama a̱ Kora. <verse eid="NUM 16:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 16:50" />Reve Haruna ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Musa o una̱ntsu wo Oogodo o Uga'asusan adama a na mɓa̱la̱'a̱ mi isawan ta̱.<verse eid="NUM 16:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17" />
  <para style="s">Aaɗanga a Haruna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ Musa u damma, <verse eid="NUM 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2" />&lt;&lt;Vu damma ama a Isra'ila a̱ ta̱wa̱ na aɗanga kupa ne ejere, aaɗanga a̱ ta̱ diga uba̱ta̱ wu zagbain vu ugundo wu nkaya n le. Vu ɗana aala a vuma suru a aaɗanga a̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3" />A̱vu vu ɗana aala a Haruna a aaɗanga a̱ Levi. Adama a na a ta zuwa aaɗanga a̱ ta̱ adama a zagbain vu ugundo wu nkaya suru. <verse eid="NUM 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4" />Vu zuwa aɗanga'a o Oogodo o Uga'asusan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma Akpati a Nzuwulai, uba̱ta̱ u na n tsu ga'asusan na̱ a̱vu. <verse eid="NUM 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5" />Aaɗanga a vuma na n ɗangulai o to topo. Ne ɗa ma̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ nu ukosu wa adanshawuya a na ama a Isra'ila a yuwusaan ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6" />A̱vu Musa yuwan adanshi na ama a Isra'ila, a̱vu azagbain e le a ca yi aɗanga kupa ne ejere, aaɗanga a̱ ta̱ o una̱ wu zagbain suru vu ugundo wu nkaya n le, aaɗanga a Haruna fo a̱ shi ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ e le. <verse eid="NUM 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7" />A̱vu Musa zuwa aɗanga'a a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva a̱tsuma̱ Oogodo o Uga'asusan.<verse eid="NUM 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8" />Ana usana u tawai a̱vu Musa uwa a̱tsuma̱ o Oogodo o Uga'asusan, a̱vu we ene aaɗanga a Haruna za na ri o una̱ wu u'wa wa̱ Levi, u topo goon shi agba hali u yuwan ta̱ yipa̱lu, u ɓoso u matsan alumon. <verse eid="NUM 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9" />A̱vu Musa pura̱ aɗanga'a suru diga a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa aza a Isra'ila suru. A̱vu a̱ ka̱lyuwa̱, a̱vu vuma suru tara aaɗanga a̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma Musa, &lt;&lt;Ka̱mbuwa̱ aaɗanga a Haruna elime a Akpati a Nzuwulai, a zuwa yi iroci e ekere a aza aciyogbamu. A̱yi nda u ta zuwa a̱tyo a adanshawuya a aci a̱ va, ta̱wa̱ a̱ kuwa̱ wan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11" />A̱vu Musa yuwan cine A̱sulazuva a damma niyi tsoyi.<verse eid="NUM 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12" />A̱vu aza a Isra'ila a damma Musa, &lt;&lt;Adanshi o ro o lo shi, tsu kuwa̱ ta̱, aɗa a̱ tsu o koto ta̱, suru ntsu aɗa a̱ tsu o koto ta̱! <verse eid="NUM 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13" />Na aa damma za na suru ta̱wa̱i zuzu no Oogodo o Uga'asusan a̱ A̱sulazuva u ta̱ kuwa̱, suru ntsu tsu ta̱ kuwa̱?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18" />
  <para style="s">Ulinga u nan Ganu na̱ nan Levi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Haruna, &lt;&lt;A̱vu, no olobo a̱ wu nu ugundo wa dada va̱ wu i ta tara ume wu nusu na a yuwain na i burai A̱a̱'isa̱, reve a̱vu no olobo a̱ wu goon i tara ume wu nusu na a yuwain na i burai ulinga u tsuganu. <verse eid="NUM 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2" />Vu ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ wu nan Levi, diga o ugundo wu nkaya ma̱ wu, o ɓolo ekere na̱ a̱vu, a kamba wu a mantsa ma na a̱vu no olobo a̱ wu yaa yuwusan ulinga o Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3" />A ta kamba wu, waru a ta yuwan ulinga wo Oogodoꞌo suru, amma she a rawa zuzu ni itana ya̱ a̱a̱'isa̱ ko i masa'a. Ko gba shi a̱vu ne ele i kuwa̱. <verse eid="NUM 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4" />O to ɓolo ekere na̱ a̱vu reve waru a yuwusan ulinga wo Oogodo o Uga'asusa'an. Agba she za vu ugundo ro rawa zuzu na̱ a̱ɗu wan.<verse eid="NUM 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5" />&lt;&lt;A̱ɗu ɗa ya̱a̱ da̱na̱ a yuwusan a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ a̱a̱'isa̱, adama upan u da̱shi cipa̱ a aci a aza a Isra'ila wan. <verse eid="NUM 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6" />A̱mu na aciya̱va̱ a ɗa n ɗangulai a̱za̱ a̱ ɗu nan Levi diga a̱tsuma̱ a aza a Isra'ila, uneꞌe e ekere a̱ ɗu, a ca ta̱ A̱sulazuva ele adama a yuwan ulinga o Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7" />Amma a̱vu no olobo a̱ wu a ɗa goon yaa yuwan ulinga u tsuganu wi ili i na i burai masa'a na̱ a̱tsuma̱ o umuna wu una̱ntsu. N ca ɗu ta̱ ulinga u tsuganu uneꞌe. Vuma ro ko'o na suru rawai zuzu na̱ a̱a̱'isa̱ a̱ to una yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ucasu adama a nan ganu na̱ nan Levi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Haruna, &lt;&lt;A̱mu na aciya̱va̱, n ca wu ta̱ ulinga wu uka̱lyuwusa̱ wu ucasu u na a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ numu, ucasu wa akiza u na aza a Isra'ila a ca numu suru n ca wu ta̱ no olobo a̱ wu wo o'wo za ɗu na akunda a̱ ɗu suru suru. <verse eid="NUM 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9" />A̱tsuma̱ o ucasu wa akiza a na a buwai a̱tsuma̱ a̱ kucci na a ca numu na akina, ele nda o to o'wo za ɗu, ko na̱ kucci vi ishina ɗa, ko kucci makuɗa ma̱ wila̱ ko kucci vu unusu ɗa. Ele ndolo o to o'wo akunda a̱ wu no olobo a̱ wu. <verse eid="NUM 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10" />Uba̱ta̱ wa akiza u ɗa yaa tama yi. Mawun ma vali suru ma ta tama yi. Ili ya akiza i ɗa uba̱ta̱ wa̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11" />&lt;&lt;A̱yi nda waru za va̱ wu ɗa: upasu u na a cayi adama o ucasu u na aza a Isra'ila a casu mu kucci vu u'ya̱susa̱n, n ca ɗu ta̱ wo o'wo akunda a̱ ɗu suru suru, a̱vu no olobo a̱ wu ne esheli a̱ wu. Vuma na suru ri cece o u'wa wa̱ wu u ta gura tama yi.<verse eid="NUM 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12" />&lt;&lt;Waru n ta casu ɗu ili i na i la'ai ulobonu aza a na aza a Isra'ila a ca numu, za mani'in ma̱ zetun, na̱ masayan ma̱ ina̱bi ma sa'avu, na̱ za vi ishina i na a cayi A̱sulazuva kucci winu wu ufaru. <verse eid="NUM 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13" />Suru kucci winu wu ufaru wi itana yu una yi iɗa i le aza a na a̱a̱ ta̱wusa̱a̱ A̱sulazuva o to o'wo a̱za̱ a̱ wu. A̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa̱ wu, suru za na ri cece u ta gura tama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14" />&lt;&lt;Ili i na suru a tawaa numu a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila za va̱ wu ɗa. <verse eid="NUM 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15" />Umatsun wu ufaru wa̱ a̱a̱tsuma̱ suru za vuma na̱ za vi iliyamunga, za na a cayi A̱sulazuva za va̱ wu ɗa. Amma vu ta tsupaa mawun mo ufaru mo ulobo ma vuma na̱ mawun mo ufaru me iliyamunga ma na ma̱ ri cece shi. <verse eid="NUM 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16" />Vu ta tsupaa le mantsa ma na a rawai woto u ta̱. Ikebe ya atsupu'u u to o'wo azurufa ton, una̱ta̱ na̱ makundatsu ma azurufa ma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17" />&lt;&lt;Amma mawun mo ufaru ma nan ko kyon ko megbele, vaa tsupaa le shi, a̱ ta̱ na akiza. Vu kyo'onu mpasa n le a masa'a, a̱vu waru vu kula̱to mani'in me le ucasu u na a yuwain na akina ma̱guru mo uyo'o e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="NUM 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18" />Amma inama i le i to o'wo za va̱ wu, cine ma̱ka̱ka̱n na agutsu o ucasu wu u'ya̱susa̱n a̱ ri a̱za̱ a̱ wu. <verse eid="NUM 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19" />Ili i na suru a tawai diga a̱tsuma̱ o ucasu wa akiza aza a na aza a Isra'ila a̱ ta̱wa̱yi A̱sulazuva, n ca wu ta̱ a̱vu no olobo a̱ wu ne esheli a̱ wu wo o'wo akunda a̱ ɗu hali hali. Akucunu a na a̱ ri n kuɗa ɗa shi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva e ekere a̱ wu na̱ limatan va̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma Haruna, &lt;&lt;Va̱a̱ tsura̱ agadu e iɗa i le shi, waru va̱a̱ tsura̱ akunda o ro a̱tsuma̱ e le shi. A̱mu ɗa akunda a̱ wu na agadu a̱ wu a̱tsuma̱ a aza a Isra'ila.<verse eid="NUM 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21" />&lt;&lt;N ca ta̱ nan Levi za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa suru va Isra'ila wo o'wo agadu e le, o una̱ wu ulinga wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ u na aa yuwusan ele o Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22" />Diga gogo a̱ tyo ɗe elime, she aza a Isra'ila a rawa zuzu no Oogodo o Uga'asusan wan, na̱ ne ɗa shi a ta tara ume wu unusu u le waru a̱ ta̱ kuwa̱. <verse eid="NUM 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23" />Amma nan Levi a ɗa goon aa yuwan ulinga o Oogodoꞌo. A ta tara ume wu nusu na a yuwain i na i bura niyi. A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa ili i na oo toni babu ukotu e ekere a limatan ve elime. A̱a̱ tsura̱ agadu a̱tsuma̱ a aza a Isra'ila shi. <verse eid="NUM 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24" />O una̱ u ndolo, n ca ta̱ nan Levi za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa u na aza a Isra'ila a̱ ta̱wa̱yi A̱sulazuva wo o'wo agadu e le. A̱yi ɗa i zuwai n yuwain adanshi adama e le, &lt;A̱a̱ tsura̱ agadu a̱tsuma̱ a aza a Isra'ila shi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ Musa u damma, <verse eid="NUM 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26" />&lt;&lt;Yuwan adanshi na̱ nan Levi vu damma le: &lt;Mantsa ma na i ushiyi za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa e ekere a aza a Isra'ila, za na n ca nɗu agadu, ni i ciga i 'yuwan i ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa ndolo kucci va̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="NUM 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27" />A ta tara ucasu u ɗu tsi ishina diga o osoroto ko masayan diga uba̱ta̱ u mokpoko. <verse eid="NUM 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28" />Ne tsunda tsa ɗa waru ya̱a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ A̱sulazuva nu ucasu diga a̱tsuma̱ a za ta̱ na i ushiyi e ekere a aza a Isra'ila. Diga a̱tsuma̱ a za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa nda i ta ca Haruna ganu akunda a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="NUM 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29" />Ni i ciga i 'yuwan i ta̱wa̱a̱ na akunda a̱ A̱sulazuva ili i na i la'ai ulobonu na akiza a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na a ca nɗu suru.&gt;<verse eid="NUM 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30" />&lt;&lt;Vu damma nan Levi, &lt;A mantsa ma na yaa ca upasu u na u la'ai ulobonu, a ta tara ucasu u ɗu tsi ishina diga o osoroto ko masayan diga uba̱ta̱ u mokpoko. <verse eid="NUM 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31" />A̱ɗu na̱ 'wa ɗu suru i ta gura lyuwa akapi a na a buwai ko te ɗa, adama a na atsupu e melen ma̱ ɗu ma ɗa mo ulinga a̱tsuma̱ o Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32" />Ni i ta̱wa̱a̱ nu upasu u na u la'ai ulobonu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi ya̱a̱ da̱na̱ nu unusu a̱tsuma̱ e ili i nda shi, ni i yuwan ne ya̱a̱ lungusa̱ ucasu wa akiza wa aza a Isra'ila shi, waru ya̱a̱ kuwa̱ shi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19" />
  <para style="s">Mini ma̱ wuza̱'u adama o uka̱mba̱tosu cece</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ Musa na̱ Haruna u damma, <verse eid="NUM 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2" />&lt;&lt;A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa ure u wila̱ u na A̱sulazuva a zuwai: Damma aza a Isra'ila a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ɗu na̱ manan ma̱ shili za na ri usa̱du ko u ri na aalana shi, waru koto a̱ kuruwa̱ yi a̱a̱gba̱la̱ e iluma shi. <verse eid="NUM 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3" />A ca Eliyaza ganu a̱yi, a̱vu o uta̱a̱ yi a̱ca̱pa̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱, a̱vu a paɗa yi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4" />Eliyaza ganu ta daɓa mpasa ma̱ yi na aakatsu a̱ yi a̱vu wu kyo'onu yi toto ucindere a̱ tyo elime o Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5" />A̱vu a̱ kula̱to manan ma̱ shili'i a̱yi a̱ a̱ka̱nla̱, a̱ kula̱to ukwan wa̱ yi ni inama ya̱ yi na̱ mpasa ma̱ yi na̱ a̱ya̱n a̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6" />Ganu ta tara ɗanga sida no osondori na̱ a̱punda̱ a̱ shili, reve u vari le a̱tsuma̱ a manan ma̱kula̱ꞌa̱. <verse eid="NUM 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7" />Na a yuwan ne, a̱vu ganu zuza̱'wa̱ a̱tugu a̱ yi a̱vu waru u sumba̱ na̱ mini. Reve u ta̱wa̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱, agba u ta̱ da̱na̱ idaba hali she ulivu. <verse eid="NUM 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8" />Vuma na kula̱to niyi'i fo u ta̱ za̱'wa̱ a̱tugu a̱ yi a̱vu u sumba̱ na̱ mini, a̱vu a̱yi fo u ta̱ da̱na̱ idaba hali she ulivu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9" />&lt;&lt;Vuma na ri cece u ta̱ pura̱ okomo a na'an, a̱vu u tsun yi uba̱ta̱ u na u ri cece ɗe a̱ca̱pa̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱. Aza a Isra'ila a ta zuwa okomo'o adama a yuwan ulinga na̱ a̱yi a̱ mini ma̱ wuza̱'u, za vu uka̱mba̱tosu cece ɗa diga o unusu. <verse eid="NUM 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10" />Vuma na pura̱i okomo a mana'an, a̱yi fo nu u ciga u 'yuwan wu za̱'wa̱ a̱tugu a̱ yi, a̱yi fo u ta̱ da̱na̱ idaba hali she ulivu. A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa ili i na a aza a Isra'ila no omocin a na a̱ ri nden a̱tsuma̱ e le a̱ ri n yuwusan babu ukotu.<verse eid="NUM 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11" />&lt;&lt;Suru za na ju'wa̱in vuma na kuwa̱i, u ta̱ da̱na̱ idaba hali rana cindere. <verse eid="NUM 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12" />U ta̱ ka̱mba̱to aciya̱yi cece na̱ mini'i o urana wa ta'atsu no o urana we cindere, reve wo o'wo cece. Agba nu u ka̱mba̱to aciya̱yi cece o urana wa ta'atsu no o urana we cindere shi, woo o'wo cece shi. <verse eid="NUM 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13" />Za na suru ju'wa̱in a̱a̱kwa̱kwa̱ a vuma a̱vu u kuɗa̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱to aciya̱yi cece u lungusa̱ ta̱ Oogodo o Uga'asusan A̱sulazuva. Na a ciga a 'yuwan a tawa vuma ndolo a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila. Adama a na o kyo'onuwo yi mini ma̱ wuza̱'u shi, u ti idaba, waru idaba ya̱ yi i ta̱ da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14" />&lt;&lt;Apa nda wila̱ u na a̱a̱ kuru na̱ vuma kuwa̱ a̱tsuma̱ o Oogodo: Za na suru uwai a̱tsuma̱ o Oogodoꞌo na̱ za na ri pe suru o to o'wo idaba hali rana cindere. <verse eid="NUM 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15" />Waru upondo u na u ri ni ikpa̱ta̱tsu ukpa̱towu shi a̱yi fo u to o'wo idaba.<verse eid="NUM 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16" />&lt;&lt;Za na suru ri a alanga na u ju'wa̱in vuma na o unai na̱ matsun me pe'eni ko vuma na yuwain ukwa̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱, ko za na ju'wa̱in eetele a vuma ko ason, u to o'wo idaba hali rana cindere.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17" />&lt;&lt;Adama a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ za na ri idaba cece, e kene okomo pe a̱tsuma̱ o okomo o uka̱mba̱tosu cece a̱ tsun e meden, a̱vu a̱ tsun pe mini ma sa'ani. <verse eid="NUM 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18" />Reve vuma na ri cece u tara osondori, a̱vu u tsupu yi a̱ mini'i reve wu kyo'onu oogodoꞌo ni itana i na i ri pe suru na ama a na a̱ ri pe. Reve fo wu kyo'onu za na suru ju'wa̱in eetele a vuma ko ason ko vuma na o unai ko za na kuwa̱i ukwa̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱. <verse eid="NUM 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19" />Vuma na ri cece u to kyo'onu vuma na ri cece shi o urana wa ta'atsu no o urana we cindere. Reve o urana we cindere u ka̱mba̱to yi cece. Vuma na a̱ ka̱mba̱toi cece'e u ta̱ za̱'wa̱ a̱tugu a̱ yi a̱vu u sumba̱ na̱ mini, u ta̱ gba a̱ ka̱mba̱ cece o ulivu u ndolo. <verse eid="NUM 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20" />Agba na̱ vuma na ri idaba u kuɗa̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱to aciya̱yi cece, a ta tawa yi a̱tsuma̱ a ama, adama a na u lungusa̱ ta̱ a̱a̱'isa̱ a̱ A̱sulazuva. O kyo'onuwo yi mini mo uka̱mba̱tosu cece shi, waru u ta̱ idaba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21" />A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa wila̱ u na ya̱a̱ da̱na̱ a̱ kurusu babu ukotu. &lt;&lt;Vuma na o kyo'onusu mini mo uka̱mbuwusa̱ cece u ta̱ fo a̱ za̱'wa̱ a̱tugu a̱ yi. Waru za na ju'wa̱in mini mo uka̱mba̱tosu cece u to o'wo idaba hali she ulivu. <verse eid="NUM 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22" />Ili i na za na ri idaba suru ju'wa̱in u to o'wo idaba, za na suru waru ju'wa̱n niyi u to o'wo idaba hali she ulivu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 19:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20" />
  <para style="s">Mini diga a aatali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Mta̱ 17:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1" />O woto wu ufaru a̱vu ama a Israꞌila suru a rawa A̱tsumona a̱ Zin,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="ft">Ili i nda i fara ta̱ a̱ tyo aꞌwan amunga a na aza a Israꞌila o uta̱i a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Masar.</char></note> reve a̱ va̱la̱ Kedesh. Ɗe ɗa Maryamu kuwa̱i a̱vu a̱ ciɗo yi.<verse eid="NUM 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2" />Uba̱ta̱'a̱ u shi na̱ mini ma na ama oo sowo shi, ɗaɗa a̱ ꞌya̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ wa Musa na̱ Haruna na̱ nla̱ngi. <verse eid="NUM 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3" />Reve a yuwan mawasan na̱ Musa, reve a damma, &lt;&lt;Na̱ shi tsu kuwa̱ a mantsa ma na a̱za̱ a̱ tsu a̱ kuwa̱i a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, u shi ta laꞌaa tsu! <verse eid="NUM 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4" />Adama a̱ nye i ta̱wa̱toi ama a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱tsumona a nda, adama a̱tsu ni iliyamunga i tsu tsu kuwa̱ pa? <verse eid="NUM 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5" />Adama a̱ nye yu uta̱a̱ ntsu a̱tsuma̱ a Masar, reve i ta̱wa̱to tsu a̱tsumona a wuya a nda, uba̱ta̱ u na u ri ni ilyalya na̱ biri na̱ muwun mu ɗanga m peme shi. Waru babu mini ma na tsoo sowo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6" />Reve Musa na̱ Haruna lyawa iɓolo ya ama a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ ꞌya̱wa̱ o u'uwata wo Oogodo o Uga'asusan, a̱vu o von ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱. Reve tsugbain tsa̱ A̱sulazuva tsa̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u le. <verse eid="NUM 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma Musa,<verse eid="NUM 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8" />&lt;&lt;Tara aaɗanga, reve a̱vu na̱ mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ wu Haruna, i ɓoloto ama uba̱ta̱ u ta̱. Amaꞌa a̱ a̱ka̱nla̱, reve vu yuwan adanshi na aatali'i u ta̱ gba a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ mini ma na u ri pe na̱ a̱yi. Nna̱ vu uta̱a̱ na̱ mini diga a aataliꞌi, reve vu ca amaꞌa ni iliyamunga i le o sowo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9" />Ɗaɗa Musa tarai aaɗanga'a a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva cine u damma niyi. <verse eid="NUM 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10" />Reve a̱yi na̱ Haruna o ɓoloto amaꞌa elime a aataliꞌi, a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Gogo, uwwai a̱ɗu aza a aciyogbamu. She na̱ tsu uta̱wa̱ ɗu na̱ mini a aatali a nda?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11" />A̱vu Musa ꞌya̱sa̱n ukere wa̱ yi, reve u faba aataliꞌi ure na aaɗanga'a. Reve mini me reme o utusa̱ a̱bunda̱, reve amaꞌa ni iliyamunga i le o sowo.<verse eid="NUM 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12" />A̱vu gba A̱sulazuva a damma Musa na̱ Haruna, &lt;&lt;Adama a na i ꞌyuwain a zuwaa mu ucira na yaa ca mu tsugbain e esu a aza a Isra'ila, yaa tara ama nda a uwa e iɗa i na maa casu le shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13" />A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa mini ma Meriba uba̱ta̱ u na aza a Isra'ila a yuwain mawasan na̱ A̱sulazuva nu uba̱ta̱ u na u rocoi aciya̱yi na akiza e ekere e le.<verse eid="NUM 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱za̱ a̱ Edom a putsa ta̱ aza a Isra'ila o utula̱i ni iɗa i le</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14" />Musa lyungu ta̱ nlingata diga Kedesh a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u mogono ma̱ Edom, adansa, &lt;&lt;Apa ili i na za va̱ wu Isra'ila dammai, vu reve ta̱ na̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a na a cina ntsu suru. <verse eid="NUM 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15" />Nkaya n tsu n 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ Masar, waru tsu da̱nu ta̱ ɗe a'wan a̱ a̱bunda̱. Aza a Masar o ɓongi tsu ta̱ oɓolo na̱ nkaya n tsu. <verse eid="NUM 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16" />Agba a na tsu showeyin A̱sulazuva, wu uwwa ta̱ mesun ma̱ tsu reve u lyungu malingata ma̱ A̱sula̱ a̱vu wu uta̱a̱ tsu diga Masar. &lt;Gogo a̱tsu ɗa nda a Kedesh, lyuci na ri a̱ nge'en mu utyo wi iɗa ya̱ wu. <verse eid="NUM 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17" />Vu yuwan ankuri vu lyawa tsu tsu utula̱i ni iɗa ya̱ wu. Tsa̱a̱ utula̱i na̱ a̱ɗuma̱ ko a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ina̱bi shi, ko tsu sowo mini mo oko'o ma̱ wu shi. Tsu ta̱ kuru nu Ure u Gbain u Mogono goon, waru tsaa vadala ko usa'ani ko ugula̱ shi she tsu uta̱ utyo wi iɗa ya̱ wu.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18" />Amma Edom usu ta̱ u damma, &lt;&lt;Ya̱a̱ utula̱i na̱ pa shi, nni i rito gba, tsu ta̱ o uta̱ tsu riya̱a̱ ɗu na̱ matsun me pe'eni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19" />Reve aza a Isra'ila a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Tsu ta̱ kuru nu ure u gbain, na̱ a̱tsu ko iliyamunga i tsu i sowo mini ma̱ ɗu, tsu ta tsupa ɗu. Tsu ciga ta̱ tsu utula̱i goon a ana, babu waru ili i ro.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20" />Reve waru u usuwisa̱, &lt;&lt;Ya̱a̱ utula̱i nu uba̱ta̱ u nda shi.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa Edom uta̱i uvon ne ele na̱ a̱soja a̱ a̱bunda̱ na̱ a̱za̱ o ucira. <verse eid="NUM 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21" />Ana wo o'woi Edom putsa nle o utula̱i ni iɗa ya̱ yi, reve aza a Isra'ila a vadala nu ure u ro.<verse eid="NUM 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwa̱ wa Haruna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22" />A̱vu aza a Israꞌila suru e reme mmalu diga Kedesh reve a̱ tyo a Masasan mo Hor. <verse eid="NUM 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Musa na̱ Haruna a Masasan mo Hor o utyo wi iɗa ya Edom, a na, <verse eid="NUM 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24" />&lt;&lt;Haruna aa uwa e iɗa i na maa ca ama a Israꞌila shi, u ta̱ kuwa̱, adama a na a̱ɗu ra i yuwaan ta̱ ili i na n zuwai aciyogbamu a̱ mini ma̱ Meriba. <verse eid="NUM 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25" />Vu tara Haruna oɓolo nu ulobo wa̱ yi Eliyaza vu kumba ne ele a Masasan mo Hor. <verse eid="NUM 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26" />Reve vu foɗo a̱tugu a Haruna a̱vu vo otowo ulobo wa̱ yi Eliyaza, adama a na u ta̱ kuwa̱ ɗe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27" />Reve Musa yuwan cine A̱sulazuva a dammai: A kumba ta̱ a Masasan mo Hor e esu a ama a Israꞌila suru. <verse eid="NUM 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28" />A̱vu u foɗo a̱tugu a Haruna, reve wo otowo ulobo wa̱ yi Eliyaza. A̱vu Haruna kuwa̱ ɗe zuva masasaꞌan. Ɗaɗa Musa na̱ Eliyaza a̱ cipa̱i zuva masasaꞌan. <verse eid="NUM 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29" />Ana amaꞌa suru e revei a na Haruna kuwa̱i, a̱vu a yuwan nden n wiruta̱ hali rana mataꞌatsu.<verse eid="NUM 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21" />
  <para style="s">O Kototo ta̱ Arad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1" />Mantsa ma na mogono ma Arada, za na da̱na̱i mogono mo upasu wu uyagi wa Ka'ana, za na ri nden a Nege wu uwwai a na aza a Isra'ila a̱ ta̱ lo a̱ ta̱wa̱ nu ure wa Atarim, a̱vu u riya̱a̱ le nu uvon, a̱vu u reme ozo o ro a̱tsuma̱ e le. <verse eid="NUM 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2" />Reve aza a Isra'ila a yuwaan A̱sulazuva akucunu a nda: &lt;&lt;Na̱ vaa ca tsu ama a nda e ekere a̱ tsu, tsu ta̱ kototo ilyuci i le suru suru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3" />A̱sulazuva o poloo ta̱ uɗyo wa aza a Isra'ila atsuvu, a̱vu u ca le aza a Ka'ana e ekere e le. A̱vu gba o kototo le ni ilyuci i le suru suru, adama o ndolo a ɗa a cayi uba̱ta̱'a̱ ala Homa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Homa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Urevu wa̱ Homa a̱yi ɗa ukototosu.</char></note>.<verse eid="NUM 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yo vu rumushili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4" />Aza a Isra'ila a̱ 'yon ta̱ reve e reme ta̱ mmalu diga a Masasan mo Hor a̱ tyo nu ure u Mala ma̱ Shili, adama a kanzuꞌwa iɗa ya̱ Edom. Agba amaꞌa a gura kaɓa asuvu o ure shi. <verse eid="NUM 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5" />Reve a yuwan adanshawuya a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sula̱ na̱ Musa, a̱vu a damma, &lt;&lt;Adama a̱ nye a ɗa yu uta̱a̱ ntsu a̱tsuma̱ a Masar adama tsu kuwa̱ pa a̱tsumona a nda? Ilyalya yi pa shi! Waru mini ma pa shi! Waru tsu kuna̱ ta̱ ni ilyalya i vanvama i nda!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ lyunguwa̱ le ni iyo i tsukono a̱tsuma̱ e le, a̱vu a̱ ka̱ɗa̱ ama, reve ama a Isra'ila na̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ kuwa̱. <verse eid="NUM 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7" />Reve amaꞌa a̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Musa reve a damma, &lt;&lt;Tsu yuwan ta̱ unusu ana tsu yuwain adanshawuya a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva na̱ a̱vu. Vu vasa adama A̱sulazuva a tawaa tsu iyo i nda.&gt;&gt; Reve Musa patiya amaꞌa.<verse eid="NUM 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Vu ruma yo vu rumushili, a̱vu vu katala yi zuva vo owoꞌo, adama za na yo ka̱ɗa̱i suru, a̱vu wi indana u laꞌa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9" />Ɗaɗa Musa yuwain yo vu rumushili, a̱vu u zuwa yi zuva vo owo'o, reve za na yo ka̱ɗa̱i biti, a̱vu nu u ka̱lyuwa̱ yo vu rumushili'i she u laꞌa. <verse eid="NUM 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10" />Reve aza a Isra'ila a̱ ꞌyon a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ a Obo. <verse eid="NUM 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11" />A̱vu a̱ ꞌyon diga Obo a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ a Iye Abarim, a̱tsumona a na a̱ ri a̱ nka̱la̱la̱i na̱ Mowa nu upasu wa asana. <verse eid="NUM 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12" />Diga lo reve a̱ ꞌyon a̱ va̱la̱ o uka̱ri wa̱ Zere. <verse eid="NUM 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13" />Reve a̱ ꞌyon diga lo reve a̱ va̱la̱ mavada mo Uɗolu wa Anon, za na ri a̱tsumona za na ka̱ra̱la̱i a̱ tyo utyo wi iɗa wa aza a Amoriya. Anon a̱yi utyo wi iɗa wa̱ Mowa e memere ma̱ Mowa na aza a Amoriya ɗa. <verse eid="NUM 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14" />A̱yi ɗa i zuwai Aatagada o Uvon a̱ A̱sulazuva a dammai: &lt;&lt;Wahe a̱tsuma̱ o upasu wa Sufa, na̱ ɗolu va Anon, <verse eid="NUM 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15" />nu uzuru wu ɗolu na remei a̱ tyo nda̱na̱ta̱ ma Ar a̱vu u ga'asan nu utyo wa̱ Mowa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16" />Diga lo reve a lyuwa elime a̱ tyo Biya, o oko'o a na A̱sulazuva a dammai Musa, &lt;&lt;Ɓoloto ama uba̱ta̱ u ta̱ a̱mu gba n ta ca le mini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17" />Reve aza a Isra'ila a cana ishipa i nda:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 21:17" />
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:17">&lt;&lt;Oko'o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:17">uta̱a̱ mini!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:17">A canaa yi ishipa.<verse eid="NUM 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18" />Oko'o a na muwun mu ngono n ka̱pa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:18">a na azagbain a̱ ka̱pa̱i na</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:18">aɗanga o tsugono tse le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:18">na aɗanga e le.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 21:18">Reve diga a̱tsumona'a a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Matana. <verse eid="NUM 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19" />Diga Matana a̱ tyo Nahaliye, diga Nahaliye a̱ tyo Bamo, <verse eid="NUM 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20" />waru diga Bamo a̱ tyo o uka̱ri a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Mowa, uba̱ta̱ u na ncilecile m Masasan ma Pisiga ma̱a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ uba̱ta̱ u na u ri m mini shi.<verse eid="NUM 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">A lyuwai Sihon na̱ Og nu uvon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 2:26-3:11">U.Wl 2:26-3:11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21" />Reve aza a Israꞌila a̱ lyungu nlingata a damma Sihon mogono ma aza a Amoriya a na,<verse eid="NUM 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22" />&lt;&lt;Lyawa tsu tsu utula̱i ni iɗa ya̱ wu mejege. Tsaa ɓatsa a̱ a̱ɗuma̱ ko a̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ina̱bi ko tsu sowo mini o oko'o a̱ ta̱ shi. Tsu ta̱ kuru Ure u Gbain u Mogono, hali she tsu utula̱i utyo wi iɗa ya̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23" />A̱vu gba Sihon putsa le o utula̱i nu utyo wi iɗa ya̱ yi. Reve u foɓo a̱soja a̱ yi a̱vu a uwa a̱tsumona adama a yuwan uvon na aza a Isra'ila. Ana u rawai Jahaz, a̱vu u yuwan uvon na̱ Isra'ila. <verse eid="NUM 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24" />A̱vu gba ama a Israꞌila o una mogonoꞌo na̱ matsun me pe'eni, a̱vu a usa iɗa ya̱ yi diga o uɗolu wa Anon a̱ tyo Jabo, agba uba̱ta̱ wa aza a Amon u ɗa goon a lyuwai, adama a na utyo wi iɗa u le u da̱na̱ ta̱ nu ukari wu ucira. <verse eid="NUM 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25" />Reve aza a Isra'ila a lyuwa ilyuci i gbagbain ya aza a Amoriya suru, reve a̱ da̱nu e ilyuci'i, oɓolo na̱ Heshibon na̱ mulyuci n na n ri uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ a̱yi suru. <verse eid="NUM 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26" />Heshibon ɗa shi lyuci gbain va Sihon mogono ma aza a Amoriya, za na yuwain uvon na̱ mogono ma̱ Mowa reve u usa yi iɗa ya̱ yi suru diga o Uɗolu wa Anon. <verse eid="NUM 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27" />Adama o ndolo a ɗa a̱za̱ e ishipa a tsu damma,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 21:27" />
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:27">&lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱i Heshibon, lyawai a suwisa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:27">lyawa a̱ ka̱mbuwisa̱ lyuci gbain va Sihon.<verse eid="NUM 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28" />&lt;&lt;Adama a na akina a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ diga Heshibon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:28">elentsu a akina diga a̱ lyuci va Sihon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:28">U soɗu ta̱ Ar va̱ Mowa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:28">a̱vu u kototo agaɗi o uɗolu wa Anon.<verse eid="NUM 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29" />A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina wu, a̱vu Mowa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">A̱ rukutsa̱ ɗu ta̱, a̱ɗu ama a Kemosh!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:29">U ca ta̱ olobo a̱ yi o o'wo a̱za̱ e ilaɗi yu uvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">esheli waru o una̱ wi ili i na e remei uba̱ta̱ wu uvon ya Sihon mogono ma aza a Amoriya.<verse eid="NUM 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30" />&lt;&lt;Amma gogo o kototo le ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:30">o kototo ta̱ Heshibon hali a rawa Dibon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:30">Tsu rukutsa̱ le ta̱ hali a rawa Nofa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:30">a̱ tyo Medeba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31" />Ne ɗa Isra'ila da̱nuyi e iɗa ya aza a Amoriya.<verse eid="NUM 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32" />Reve Musa lyungu aza a matawa mo utyo wi iɗa a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ Jaza, reve aza a Isra'ila e reme mulyuci n na n ri uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ a̱yi a̱vu a̱ gba̱ra̱ aza a Amoriya a na a̱ shi pe.<verse eid="NUM 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33" />Reve aza a Israꞌila a vadala ure a̱ tyo e iɗa ya Bashan, reve Og mogono ma Bashan na a̱soja a̱ yi suru o uta̱ adama a yuwan uvon ne ele a Edirai. <verse eid="NUM 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma Musa, &lt;&lt;She vu uwwa wovon wa̱ yi wan, adama a na n ca yi ta̱ e ekere a̱ wu, oɓolo na̱ soja a̱ yi suru ni iɗa ya̱ yi. Vu yuwan na̱ a̱yi cine vu yuwain na̱ Sihon mogono ma Amoriya, za na yuwain tsugono a̱tsuma̱ a Heshibon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35" />Reve aza a Israꞌila o una yi, na̱ a̱yi no olobo a̱ yi na̱ a̱soja a̱ yi suru. A lyawaa le ko aaci a̱ ta̱ shi. Reve a kpada iɗaꞌa yo oꞌwo iɗa i le.<verse eid="NUM 21:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22" />
  <para style="s">Mogono ma̱ Mowa me ɗeyi Balam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1" />Reve aza a Isra'ila a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo a agalaci a̱ Mowa, reve a̱ va̱la̱ mavada ma̱ Urudu a̱ nka̱la̱la̱i na̱ Jeriko.<verse eid="NUM 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2" />Balak ulobo wa Zipo we ene ta̱ ili i na aza a Isra'ila a yuwain na aza a Amoriya suru. <verse eid="NUM 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3" />Reve Mowa uwwa wovon lon adama a na ama'a a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ a̱bunda̱ lon. Amayun Mowa shiwan ta̱ na̱ wovon adama a aza a Isra'ila.<verse eid="NUM 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4" />Reve a̱za̱ a̱ Mowa a damma azagbain a Midiya, &lt;&lt;Ama a̱ a̱bunda̱ a nda e te peɗe ili suru a̱ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ tsu, cine nan tsu peɗe anlya a atsusa.&gt;&gt; Adama o ndolo a ɗa Balak ulobo wa Zipo, za na shi mogono ma̱ Mowa a mantsa'a, <verse eid="NUM 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:5" />u lyunguyi nlingata e ɗe Balam ulobo wa̱ Beyo, za na da̱na̱i a Peto zuzu nu Uɗolu'u e iɗa yu umatsun ya̱ yi. Balak damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Ama o ro o uta̱ ta̱ diga Masar, a̱ ɓa̱ru ta̱ iɗa'a a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ zuzu na̱ a̱mu. <verse eid="NUM 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6" />Ta̱wa̱ vu yuwaan ama a nda una̱, adama a na a la'a mu ta̱ ucira. U ta gura o'wo a̱vu n lyuwa le nu uvon, a̱vu n gba̱ra̱ le a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a. Adama a na n reve ta̱ aza a na vu zuwayi aba'un suru o tso o'wo ta̱ na aba'un, aza a na vu yuwayin una̱ waru u tsu reme le ta̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7" />Azagbain a̱ Mowa na̱ Midiya a̱ ka̱ra̱ ta̱, a tara ikebe adama a̱ yindi. Ana a rawai uba̱ta̱ wa Balam, a̱vu a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ yi ili i na Balak dammai.<verse eid="NUM 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8" />Reve u damma le, &lt;&lt;Asai pa, n ta̱wa̱a̱ ɗu nu u'usuwu u na A̱sulazuva aa ca numu.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa azagbain a̱ Mowa e isawain oɓolo na̱ Balam.<verse eid="NUM 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9" />Reve A̱sula̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱ ya Balam a̱vu we ece, &lt;&lt;Nan zane ɗa ama a nda a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱vu'u?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10" />A̱vu Balam damma A̱sula̱, &lt;&lt;Balak ulobo wa Zipo, mogono ma̱ Mowa ma̱ lyunguwa̱ mu ta̱ ni ikaka i nda: <verse eid="NUM 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11" />&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱, a̱yi ɗa nda ama a na o uta̱i diga Masar a̱ ɓa̱ru ta̱ iɗa suru. Vu ta̱wa̱ gogo vu yuwaan mu ele una̱. Kila n ta gura yuwan uvon ne ele a̱vu m gba̱ra̱ le o uta̱.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12" />A̱vu gba A̱sulazuva a damma Balam, &lt;&lt;She vu kuru le wan. She vu yuwaan ama o ndolo una̱ wan, adama a na n zuwaa le ta̱ aba'un.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13" />Ana usana u tawai reve Balam 'yon reve u damma azagbain a Balak, &lt;&lt;Ka̱mba̱i e iɗa i ɗu, adama a na A̱sulazuva a putsa mu ta̱ n kuru ɗu wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14" />Adama o ndolo reve azagbain a̱ Mowa a̱ 'yon reve a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ ya Balak a̱vu a damma, &lt;&lt;Balam 'yuwan ta̱ a̱ kuru tsu a̱ ta̱wa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15" />Reve Balak lyunguwisa̱ azagbain o ro, aza a na a la'ai a̱za̱ o ufaru a̱bunda̱ na̱ tsugbain. <verse eid="NUM 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16" />Ana a̱ ta̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ wa Balam, reve a damma yi: &lt;&lt;Apa ili i na Balak mawun ma Zipo ma dammai, &lt;She vu lyawa ili i ro i geshe wu a̱ ta̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ va̱ wan. <verse eid="NUM 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17" />N ta tsupa wu ulobonu, waru n ta yuwan ili i na vu dammai suru. Vu ta̱wa̱ vu yuwaan mu ama a nda una̱.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18" />Amma a̱vu Balam usu le, &lt;&lt;Ko na̱ shi Balak aa ca mu ukobu wa̱ yi tapu na̱ azurufa na̱ zinariya, maa yuwan ko ili gbain ko ili i ke'en n fele ili i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ a zuwa numu n yuwan shi. <verse eid="NUM 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19" />Ya asa pa na ayin a nda, cine ama a̱ ndeɗe a yuwain, a̱mu n ta̱ bunga̱ mu uwwa ili i na waru A̱sulazuva aa damma mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20" />A̱tsuma̱ a ayin o ndolo, reve A̱sula̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱ ya Balam reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Ana wo o'woi ama a nda a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ tsa̱ra̱ a tara wu vu 'ya̱wa̱ oɓolo ne ele, vu 'yon vu kuru le, amma ili i na n damma nuwu ɗa goon vaa yuwan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mololi ma Balam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21" />Ana usana u tawai, reve Balam 'yon u zuwaa mololi ma̱ yi urutsu, reve u kuru azagbain a̱ Mowa. <verse eid="NUM 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22" />Ana u ka̱ra̱i, reve A̱sula̱ a uwwa upan lon. Reve malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva me isawan o ure tsa̱ra̱ u geshe yi. Balam shi ta̱ ukumbu o mololi ma̱ yi, waru agbashi e re a̱ yi a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="NUM 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23" />Ana mololi ma Balam me enei malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva mishin o ure na̱ matsun me pe'eni utalu o ukere wa̱ yi, reve u lyawa ure u uwa o ogozo. Reve Balam faba yi adama u ka̱mba̱to yi o ure.<verse eid="NUM 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24" />A̱vu malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva'a ma̱ ta̱wa̱ me isawan o ure uba̱ta̱ wu uɓoru e memere ma̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ina̱bi e eɓele ra ra ra. <verse eid="NUM 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25" />Ana mololi me enei malingata'a, reve u raɓato a̱ tyo nu uɓaɓu, reve u gbara anana a Balam o uɓaɓu. A̱vu Balam fabisa yi.<verse eid="NUM 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26" />Reve malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma̱ da̱shi wala elime. A̱vu wi isawan uba̱ta̱ wu ugbagbalu u na a̱a̱ tsura̱ ure u na aa ɓatsa a̱ mɓa̱nga̱ a̱ tyo wu usa'ani ko ugula̱ shi. <verse eid="NUM 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27" />A mantsa ma na mololi'i me enei malingata'a, reve u von. A̱vu Balam uwwa upan lon, reve u fabisa yi na aaɗanga a̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28" />Ɗaɗa A̱sulazuva a kpa̱tu'wa̱i una̱ u mololi'i, a̱vu we ece Balam, &lt;&lt;Nye n yuwaan nuwu a na vu faba numu hali toto uta'atsu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29" />Reve Balam usu mololi'i, &lt;&lt;Vu ka̱mbuwa̱ mu tu ulo! A damma n shi ta̱ na̱ matsun me pe'eni o ukere u va̱, n shi ta̱ o una wu gogo nda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30" />Reve mololi'i ma damma Balam, &lt;&lt;A̱mu mololi ma̱ wu ma ɗa shi, za na vaa kumbusa kucci hali a̱ tyo ana'an shi? N tsu yuwaan wu ta̱ cu'un vi ili i nda?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 22:30">A̱vu u usu, &lt;&lt;O'o.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱ esu a Balam we ene malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva mishin o ure na̱ matsun me pe'eni utalu. Reve Balam kingyo u von ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱.<verse eid="NUM 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32" />A̱vu malingata'a me ece yi, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai vu fabai mololi ma̱ wu hali toto uta'atsu? N ta̱wa̱ ta̱ adama n tiga̱ wu ure, adama a na ili i na vu ri e ifoɓi vu yuwan u lobono e ekere a̱ va̱ shi. <verse eid="NUM 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33" />Mololi'i we ene mu ta̱ ɗaɗa u ɓatsaa numu toto uta'atsu. Na̱ shi u ɓatsa shi, n shi to una wu, a̱vu a̱yi gba n lyawa yi wuma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34" />Reve Balam damma malingata'a, &lt;&lt;N yuwan ta̱ unusu. N reve a na a̱vu ɗa vu ri mishin o ure adama vu tiga̱ mu shi. Na̱ vu ciga n 'ya̱wa̱ shi, n ta̱ ka̱mba̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35" />Reve malingata'a ma damma Balam, &lt;&lt;Kuru ama a nda agba ili i na n damma nuwu ɗa goon vaa damma.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa Balam ka̱ra̱i oɓolo na azagbain a Balak.<verse eid="NUM 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36" />A mantsa ma na Balak uwwai a na Balam ta̱ lo a̱ ta̱wa̱, reve u ka̱ra̱ o uta̱ adama a na waa ga'aton yi ɗe Mowa o utyo wa Anon, o ukosu wi iɗa ya̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37" />Reve Balak damma Balam, &lt;&lt;N lyunguwa̱ wu vu ta̱wa̱ shi? Nye i zuwai vu ta̱wa̱i shi she gogo? Vu te inda gashi maa gura tsupa wu shi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38" />Reve Balam usu, &lt;&lt;A̱mu ɗa nda n ta̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ wa̱ wu gogo. Agba n ta̱ nu ucira u na maa gura damma ili i ro? She ili i na A̱sula̱ a zuwai o una̱ u va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39" />Reve Balam kuru Balak a̱ tyo Kiriya Huzo. <verse eid="NUM 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40" />Reve Balak ca kucci vi inan ni ikyon, a̱vu u ca Balam akunda e inama na azagbain a na a̱ shi oɓolo na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="NUM 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41" />Ana usana u tawai a̱vu Balak tara Balam u gawan na̱ a̱yi a̱ tyo Bamo Ba'al, reve diga lo we ene akapi a ama a Isra'ila.<verse eid="NUM 22:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23" />
  <para style="s">Ikaka yu ufaru ya Balam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1" />Reve Balam damma Balak, &lt;&lt;Suwaa numu musa'a n cindere pa, a̱vu i foɓoo mu ogono e inan e cindere na̱ a̱giri'i e cindere.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2" />Balak yuwan ta̱ cine Balam dammai, a̱vu ele ra a ca kucci vo oogono a nan na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ masa'a suru.<verse eid="NUM 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3" />A̱vu Balam damma Balak, &lt;&lt;Vi isawan lo zuzu na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu va̱ wu, a̱mu gba n ta̱ ka̱ra̱ me ene ko A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ u ga'an na̱ a̱mu. Ili i na u roco numu suru n ta damma wu.&gt;&gt; A̱vu Balam ka̱ra̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ zuva va agaɗi.<verse eid="NUM 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4" />A̱sula̱ a ga'an ta̱ na̱ Balam, a̱vu Balam damma, &lt;&lt;N foɓo ta̱ musa'a n cindere, a masa'a suru n ca ta̱ ɗe kucci vo oogono a nan na̱ a̱a̱giri'i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a zuwa ikaka o una̱ wa Balam u damma, &lt;&lt;Ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Balak vu ca yi ikaka i nda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6" />Ɗaɗa Balam ka̱mba̱i uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi a̱vu u cina yi mishin zuzu na̱ kucci va̱ yi, oɓolo na azagbain a̱ Mowa suru. <verse eid="NUM 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7" />Apa ikaka i na Balam ca yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">&lt;&lt;Balak ta̱wa̱to mu ta̱ diga Aram,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">mogono ma̱ Mowa diga a nsasan ma asana. U damma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">&lt;Ta̱wa̱, vu yuwaan mu Yakubu una̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">ta̱wa̱ vu yuwaan aza a Isra'ila udammu wi iwuya.&gt; <verse eid="NUM 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8" />Aza a na koto A̱sula̱ a yuwayin una̱ shi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:8">cine tsa ɗa maa yuwaan le una̱?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:8">Cine tsa ɗa maa yuwaan aza a na koto A̱sula̱ a yuwayin udammu wi iwuya shi udammu wi iwuya?<verse eid="NUM 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9" />Diga zuva va atali a ɗa me ene nle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">a agaɗi a ɗa n cinkaya nle.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:9">Me ene ta̱ ama a na a̱ ri nden ko'o</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">waru a tara aciyele una̱ta̱ na akapi a nɗa n ro shi.<verse eid="NUM 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10" />Zane ɗa aa gura kece ugundo wa Yakubu aza a na a̱ ri a̱bunda̱ cine vu revei ma̱buta̱?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">Zane ɗa aa gura kece uɓatsulai wa̱ na̱shi wa ama a Isra'ila?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:10">Lyawa numu n kuwa̱ ukwa̱ wa̱ a̱za̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">lyawa ukosu u va̱ wo o'wo tsa̱ a̱za̱ e le!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11" />Reve Balak damma Balam, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa vu yuwaan numu tsunda? N ta̱wa̱to wu ta̱ vu yuwaan n'yuwatan n va̱ una̱, agba vu yuwan ili shi, amma a̱vu vu zuwaa le aba'un!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12" />A̱vu Balam usu, &lt;&lt;Na̱ n ciga n 'yuwan n damma ili i na A̱sulazuva a zuwai o una̱ u va̱ shi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikaka ya Balam ye ire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13" />Ɗaɗa Balak damma niyi, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱ vu kuru mu a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u ro tsa̱ra̱ ve ene ele, vu te ene aza a na a la'ai zuzu na̱ a̱vu, amma vaa gura ene le suru shi. A̱vu vu yuwaan mu ele una̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14" />A̱vu u tara yi a̱ tyo a atsusa a Zofi ɗe zuva va Pisiga, ɗe ɗa u suwai musa'a n cindere a̱vu u ca kucci vo oogono a nan na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a masa'a suru.<verse eid="NUM 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15" />A̱vu Balam damma Balak, &lt;&lt;Isawan pa zuzu na̱ kucci va̱ wu a̱mu gba n 'ya̱wa̱ ɗe n ga'asan na̱ A̱sulazuva.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a ga'an na̱ Balam reve u zuwa ikaka o una̱ wa̱ yi u damma, &lt;&lt;Ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Balak a̱vu vu ca yi ikaka i nda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17" />A̱vu u ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Balak reve u cina yi mishin zuzu na̱ kucci va̱ yi, oɓolo na̱ azagbain a̱ Mowa. A̱vu Balak ece yi, &lt;&lt;Ili i ne i ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18" />A̱vu Balam damma ikaka ya̱ yi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:18">&lt;&lt;'Yon, Balak, vu zuwa atsuvu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:18">vu uwwa mu, a̱vu ulobo wa Zipo.<verse eid="NUM 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19" />A̱sula̱ vuma ɗa shi a na waa yuwan epen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:19">ko vaɗilima̱, a na waa vadala okolo a̱ yi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:19">Nu u damma u tsu yuwan shi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:19">Nu u yuwan nzuwulai u tsu shiton shi?<verse eid="NUM 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20" />N ushi ta̱ udammu n zuwa aba'un,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:20">u zuwa ta̱ aba'un, waru maa gura vadala yi shi.<verse eid="NUM 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21" />Iwuya koto i cina Yakubu shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:21">koto e ene a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila shi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:21">A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ e le o to oɓolo ne ele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:21">a ta yuwusan yisaali i ma̱za̱nga̱ i na a̱yi mogono me ele ma ɗa.<verse eid="NUM 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22" />A̱sula̱ a ɗa o uta̱ nle a̱tsuma̱ a Masar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:22">u ta̱ nu ucira u yacin.<verse eid="NUM 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23" />Tsuboci tse reme Yakubu shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:23">babu ucira wa̱ a̱guma̱ u na waa gura reme Isra'ila.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:23">A ta yuwan adanshi a aci a Yakubu na̱ Isra'ila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:23">&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱ ili i na A̱sula̱ a yuwain!&gt;<verse eid="NUM 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24" />Ama a Isra'ila a̱ ta̱ 'yosun cine vu revei kamu vu ka, a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ta̱ aciyele cine vu revei kamu na tsi ivuwan shi she nu u reme ilyalya ya̱ yi, a̱vu waru wu peɗe mpasa mi ili i na u remei.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25" />A̱vu Balak damma Balam, &lt;&lt;Nna̱ vaa yuwaan le una̱ shi, to, she vu zuwaa le aba'un wan ko ke'en!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26" />Amma Balam usu ta̱, &lt;&lt;N damma wu na̱ n ciga n 'yuwan n yuwan ili i na suru A̱sulazuva a dammai shi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikaka ya ta'atsu ya Balam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27" />Reve Balak damma Balam, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱, n 'ya̱wa̱to wu uba̱ta̱ u ro. Ko u ta gura zuwa A̱sula̱ a uwwa uyo'o u lyawa wu vu yuwaan mu ele una̱ diga ɗe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28" />A̱vu Balak tara Balam a̱ tyo zuva va̱ Peyo, za na ri a̱ nka̱la̱la̱i na̱ a̱tsumona.<verse eid="NUM 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29" />A̱vu Balam damma, &lt;&lt;Suwaa mu musa'a n cindere pa, a̱vu vu foɓoo mu ogono e inan e cindere oɓolo na̱ a̱giri'i e cindere.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30" />Balak yuwan ta̱ cine Balam dammai, reve u ca kucci vo oogono a nan na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a masa'a suru.<verse eid="NUM 23:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1" />Ana Balam enei u yo'ono ta̱ A̱sulazuva u zuwaa aza a Isra'ila aba'un, u 'ya̱wa̱ izami ya̱ a̱sa̱la̱ o ro tsu ufaru shi, ɗaɗa u vadalai urewesu wa̱ yi a̱ tyo a̱tsumona. <verse eid="NUM 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2" />Ana Balam ka̱lyuwa̱i a̱vu we ene aza a Isra'ila uva̱lu gundo gundo, ɗaɗa Ruhu va̱ A̱sula̱ cipa̱a̱ niyi. <verse eid="NUM 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3" />Reve u yuwan adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:3">&lt;&lt;Adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ a Balam ulobo wa̱ Beyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:3">adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱, yi za na esu a̱ yi e tse ene ulobonu lon.<verse eid="NUM 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4" />Adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱, yi za na tsu uwwa adanshi a̱ A̱sula̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:4">za na tse ene alavu alavu uba̱ta̱ u Mogono me Ili Suru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:4">za na tsu riya̱ ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱ waru esu a̱ yi a̱ ri ukpa̱tu'u.<verse eid="NUM 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5" />Yakubu ogodo a̱ ɗu a̱ tu ulobonu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:5">uba̱ta̱ wu nden n ɗu aza a Isra'ila!<verse eid="NUM 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6" />A̱ tu ugeru cine vu revei a̱rumbu a ɗanga vu shuwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:6">ko tsa̱ a̱rumbu a na a̱ ri zuzu nu uɗolu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:6">cine vu revei ɗanga na a̱ tsu ɗe aliyo na A̱sula̱ a̱ shuwa̱i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:6">ko ɗanga vu ugbamu na a̱ tsu ɗe sida zuzu na̱ mini.<verse eid="NUM 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7" />A̱ ta̱ tsura̱ iro'i ya̱ a̱bunda̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">icu'un i le i ta̱ tsura̱ mini pere.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:7">Mogono me le ma ta la'a Aga tsugbain,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">a ta ca tsugono tsa̱ yi tsugbain lon.<verse eid="NUM 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8" />A̱sula̱ o uta̱a̱ le ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Masar.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">U ta̱ nu ucira u yanci.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:8">O to kototo iɗa i na i ri usuɗuwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">a̱vu a kuɗa etele e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">a̱vu waru a sapa le na aya e le.<verse eid="NUM 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9" />A̱ tsu ka̱ta̱pa̱ ta̱ a̱vu o von tsu kamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">na̱ tsu kamu vu ka, zane ɗa a kawan 'ya̱sa̱n le?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:9">Lyawa aza a na a zuwaa nuwu aba'un a̱ da̱na̱ na aba'un,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">aza a na waru a yuwaan nuwu una̱, una̱ u toni le!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10" />A̱vu Balak yuwan upan na̱ Balam a̱bunda̱ lon. A̱vu u luma akatsu reve u damma, &lt;&lt;N ɗe wu ta̱ adama vu yuwaan n'yuwatan n va̱ una̱, agba reve vu zuwaa le aba'un toto uta'atsu. <verse eid="NUM 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11" />Gogo she vu ka̱ra̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ o u'wa! N damma wu ta̱ n ta tsupa wu ulobonu, amma A̱sulazuva a putsa wu ta̱ a̱ tsura̱ iliyinkapa ya̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12" />A̱vu Balam usu Balak, &lt;&lt;N damma agbashi a na vu lyunguyi ya̱'a̱ va̱ shi? <verse eid="NUM 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13" />&lt;Ko na̱ shi Balak aa ca mu ukobu wa̱ yi tapu na̱ azurufa na̱ zinariya, maa yuwan ili nu ucira u va̱ shi, ili yu ulobonu ko ili yu uwuyanu, n fele ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, n ciga n 'yuwan n damma ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai goon shi?&gt; <verse eid="NUM 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14" />Gogo n ta̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa ama a̱ va̱, amma ta̱wa̱, lyawa n rono wu atsuvu e ili i na ama a nda a̱ ta̱wa̱ a yuwan na ama a̱ wu a mantsa ma na ma̱a̱ ta̱wa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ ya̱ na̱shi ya Balam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15" />A̱vu u damma adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ ya̱ yi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:15">&lt;&lt;Adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ ya Balam ulobo wa̱ Beyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:15">adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱, yi za na esu a̱ yi e eneshe ulobonu lon,<verse eid="NUM 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16" />adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱, yi za na a uwwusa adanshi a̱ A̱sula̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:16">za na ri nu urevu e ekere o Mogono ma̱ A̱sula̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:16">za na tse ene alavu alavu e ekere o Mogono me Ili Suru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:16">za na tsu von ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱, waru za na esu a̱ yi a̱ ri ukpa̱tu'u.<verse eid="NUM 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17" />Me ene yi ta̱, agba gogo ɗa shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">n cinkaya yi ta̱ agba zuzu ɗa shi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">Talyo'o to uta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Yakubu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">aɗanga a tsugbain a̱ to uta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">U to kototo icin ya̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Mowa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">okoluwo a̱ muwun mo olobo ma̱ Shitu.<verse eid="NUM 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18" />A ta lyuwa Edom nu uvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:18">waru a ta lyuwa Seyi n'yuwatan ma̱ yi nu uvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:18">amma aza a Isra'ila a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ nu ucira.<verse eid="NUM 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19" />Za tsugbain to uta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Yakubu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:19">reve u kototo akapi a ama a na a buwai a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci gbai'in.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ yu ukosu wa Balam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20" />A̱vu Balam ka̱lyuwa̱ aza a Amaleka a̱vu u damma adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ ya̱ yi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:20">&lt;&lt;Amaleka ɗa za na da̱na̱i za vu ufaru a̱tsuma̱ a nɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:20">amma o ukosu u to koto suru suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21" />A̱vu we ene aza a Keniya reve u damma adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ ya̱ yi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:21">&lt;&lt;Uba̱ta̱ wu nden ma̱ wu u ri na addama shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:21">u'wa wa̱ wu u tu ufoɓu a aatali.<verse eid="NUM 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22" />Na̱ ne suru vu reve ta̱ aza a Keni o to koto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:22">mantsa ma na Ashu pura̱ nɗu tsugbashi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23" />A̱vu waru u yuwan adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ ya̱ yi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:23">&lt;&lt;To, zane ɗa aa la'a a mantsa ma na A̱sula̱ aa yuwan ili i nda?<verse eid="NUM 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24" />Antsun a̱ mini a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ diga a̱ nge'en m mini ma̱ Kitim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:24">a ta ca aza a Ashu na̱ Eba a̱tsuma̱lima̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:24">amma ko ele fo a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ o koto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25" />Reve Balam 'yon u ka̱mba̱ a̱ wa̱ta̱, Balak waru u saɓa ure wa̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25" />
  <para style="s">A̱za̱ a̱ Mowa a̱ pura̱i ugbozu wa aza a Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1" />Ana aza a Isra'ila a̱ da̱nuyi Shitim, reve ali e teme a yuwusan tsipere na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ Mowa, <verse eid="NUM 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2" />aza a na a banu nle a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u kucci va̱ a̱ma̱li e le. Aza a Isra'ila a lyuwa ta̱ kucci'i reve waru a̱ ka̱ɗa̱towa̱ a̱ma̱li a̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Mowa. <verse eid="NUM 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3" />Ne tsundolo tsa ɗa aza a Isra'ila o ɓoloi aciyele a yuwusaan Ba'al va Peyo a̱ga̱nda̱. Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan upan ne ele.<verse eid="NUM 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Musa, &lt;&lt;Tara azagbain a ama a na a yuwain ili i nda suru, a̱vu vu una le, a̱vu waru vu uta̱a̱ le a alanga e eteshe nu urana a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱, adama upan u va̱ a̱ tyo e ekere a aza a Isra'ila u koto.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5" />Ɗaɗa Musa dammai a̱za̱ o uge'etosu a Isra'ila, &lt;&lt;Za suru a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu wu una ama a̱ yi a na a cayi aciyele a̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ a̱ma̱li a Ba'al va Peyo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6" />Ele lo ɗaɗa vuma ro za va Isra'ila ta̱wa̱i na̱ ka va Midiya a̱tsuma̱ o oogodo a̱ yi e esu a Musa ni iɓolo ya ama a Isra'ila suru a mantsa ma na a̱ da̱na̱i e mesun o una̱ntsu wo Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="NUM 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7" />Mantsa ma na Finiha ulobo wa Eliyaza, ulobo wa Haruna ganu, we enei ili i nda, reve u lyawa iɓolo ya ama'a. Reve u guza̱ ibata o ukere wa̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8" />A̱vu u toni vuma ndolo, hali a̱ tyo a̱tsuma̱ o oogodo a̱ yi. A̱vu u sapa le ra. Ibata'a yu utula̱i ta̱ lipu vuma'a na̱ ka'a. Ɗaɗa mɓa̱la̱ a aci a aza a Isra'ila n kotoi. <verse eid="NUM 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9" />Na̱ ne suru aza a na a̱ kuwa̱i na̱ mɓa̱la̱'a̱ a rawa ta̱ ama ukpakukupa ushin nu ukpakukupa una̱shi (24,000).<verse eid="NUM 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Musa, <verse eid="NUM 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11" />&lt;&lt;Finiha ulobo wa Eliyaza, ulobo wa Haruna ganu, u tawa ta̱ upan u va̱ e ekere a aza a Isra'ila, adama a na u ta̱ ni icigi ya amayun i va̱ a̱tsuma̱ e le. A̱yi ɗa i zuwai n kototoi aza a Isra'ila shi. <verse eid="NUM 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12" />Adama o ndolo damma yi n ta yuwusan akucunu a asuvu a̱ nden na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="NUM 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13" />A̱yi oɓolo nu ugundo wa̱ yi, akucunu a nan ganu a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ le lo babu ukotu, adama a na u ta̱ ni icigi ya amayun a na waa ca A̱sula̱ a̱ yi tsugbain, u tara ta̱ ume wu unusu wa aza a Isra'ila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14" />Aala a vuma va Isra'ila na o unai na̱ ka va Midiya a̱yi ɗa Zimri ulobo wa Salu, zagbain o ugundo wa Saminu. <verse eid="NUM 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15" />Aala a ka'a gba a̱yi ɗa Kozibi usheli wa̱ Zur, vuma na da̱na̱i zagbain o ugundo wa aza a Midiya.<verse eid="NUM 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Musa, <verse eid="NUM 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17" />&lt;&lt;I riya̱a̱ aza a Midiya nu uvon i kototo le. <verse eid="NUM 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18" />Adama a na a yuwan ta̱ na̱ a̱ɗu cine vu revei n'yuwatan ana a̱ luma̱ nɗu e itoni ya Peyo na̱ Kozibi mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun me ele mo usheli, usheli wu zagbain va aza a Midiya, ka na o unai adama a mantsa ma na mɓa̱la̱ n ta̱wa̱i adama a na a yuwayin Ba'al Peyo a̱ga̱nda̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 25:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26" />
  <para style="s">Mekece me ire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1" />Ana mɓa̱la̱ n ndolo n kotoi, a̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma Musa na̱ Eliyaza ulobo wa Haruna ganu, <verse eid="NUM 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2" />&lt;&lt;I kece aza a Isra'ila suru gundo gundo aza a na a'wan e le a rawai ushin a gawan, aza na a rawai a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3" />A̱vu Musa na̱ Eliyaza ganu a yuwaan aza a Isra'ila adanshi a agalaci a̱ Mowa zuzu na̱ Urudu a̱ nka̱la̱la̱i na̱ Jeriko, a̱vu a damma, <verse eid="NUM 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:4" />&lt;&lt;I kece ama a na a̱ ri na a'wan ushin a gawan, cine A̱sulazuva a dammai Musa.&gt;&gt; Ele nda ele ɗa aza a Isra'ila a na o uta̱i a̱tsuma̱ a Masar: <verse eid="NUM 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5" />Ugundo wa̱ Roben, mawun mo ufaru ma Isra'ila, olobo a̱ yi ele ɗa Hanok na̱ Palu, <verse eid="NUM 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:6" />na̱ Hezeron na̱ Karmi. <verse eid="NUM 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7" />Ele nda ele ɗa gundo va̱ Roben, a̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei e le ɗa ukpakukupa amunga nu ukpakukupa uta'atsu nu ukpaku ucindere na mata'atsu (43,730).<verse eid="NUM 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8" />Eliyabu ɗa ulobo wa Palu, <verse eid="NUM 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9" />olobo a Eliyabu ele ɗa Nemu, na̱ Datan oɓolo na̱ Abiram. Datan oɓolo na̱ Abiram ele ɗa aza a na ama a ɗangwai aza a na a̱ 'ya̱sa̱yin Musa na Haruna aci waru a̱ ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ aza a na o toniyi Kora ana a̱ 'ya̱sa̱yin A̱sulazuva aci. <verse eid="NUM 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10" />A̱vu iɗa i kpa̱tu'wa̱ reve u soɗu le oɓolo na̱ Kora, za na otoni a̱ yi a̱ kuwa̱i mantsa ma na akina a̱ kula̱toi ama ukpakure na̱ kupoton (250). Reve o o'wo ili i na yoo rono ama atsuvu.<verse eid="NUM 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11" />Agba muwun ma̱ Kora n kuwa̱ suru shi. <verse eid="NUM 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12" />Ugundo wa Saminu olobo o umatsun u le ele ɗa:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:12">Nemuwe na̱ Yamin na̱ Yakin,<verse eid="NUM 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:13" />na̱ Zera na̱ Shawulu.<verse eid="NUM 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14" />Ele nda ele ɗa umatsun wu gundo va Saminu: a̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa ushin nu ukpakukupa ure nu ukpakure (22,200).<verse eid="NUM 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15" />Umatsun wa Gadu na̱ gundo le ele ɗa:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:15">Zepo na̱ Hagi na̱ Shuni<verse eid="NUM 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16" />na̱ Ozini na̱ Eri,<verse eid="NUM 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17" />na̱ Arodi na̱ Areli.<verse eid="NUM 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18" />Ele nda ele ɗa gundo va Gadu, aza a na e kecei ele ɗa ama, ukpakukupa amunga nu ukpakuton (40,500).<verse eid="NUM 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19" />Er na̱ Onan ele ɗa olobo a Yahuza, amma gba a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Ka'ana.<verse eid="NUM 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:20" />Apa akapi o umatsun wa Yahuza na̱ gundo le:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:20">Shela na̱ Pere na̱ Zera,<verse eid="NUM 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21" />na̱ Hezeron na̱ Hamu.<verse eid="NUM 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22" />Ele nda ele ɗa gundo va Yahuza. A̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei ele a ɗa ama ukpakukupa kupocindere nu ukpakukupa uta̱li nu ukpakuton (76,500).<verse eid="NUM 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23" />Apa umatsun wa Isaka na̱ gundo le:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:23">Tola na̱ Puwa,<verse eid="NUM 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24" />na̱ Jashu na̱ Shimiron.<verse eid="NUM 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25" />Ele nda ele ɗa gundo va Isaka, a̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa kupota̱li nu ukpakukupa una̱shi nu ukpakuta'atsu (64,300).<verse eid="NUM 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26" />Apa umatsun wa Zebulun na̱ gundo le:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:26">Sere na̱ Elon na̱ Yaleye.<verse eid="NUM 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27" />Ele nda ele ɗa gundo va Zebulun, a̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa kupota̱li nu ukpakuton (60,500).<verse eid="NUM 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28" />Apa umatsun wa̱ Isuhu na̱ gundo le, Manase na̱ Ifiramu:<verse eid="NUM 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29" />Apa umatsun wa Manase: Manase ɗa dada va Maki. Maki ɗa dada va Giliyadu,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:29">za na o'woi ugundo wa Giliyadu.<verse eid="NUM 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30" />Apa umatsun wa Giliyadu:</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:30">olobo ele ɗa Abiyeza</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:30">na̱ Helek,<verse eid="NUM 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 26:31" />na̱ Asiriyel</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:31">na̱ Shekem,<verse eid="NUM 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:32" />na̱ Shemida na̱ Hefa.<verse eid="NUM 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33" />Zelofeha ulobo wa Hefa u da̱na̱ no olobo shi, esheli a ɗa a̱ da̱na̱ niyi goon, apa ala e le, Mala na̱ Nowa na̱ Hogula na̱ Milika oɓolo na̱ Tiriza.<verse eid="NUM 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34" />Ele nda ele ɗa gundo va Manase, a̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei ele a ɗa ama ukpakukupa kupoton nu ukpakukupa ure nu ukpakucindere (52,700.)<verse eid="NUM 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35" />Apa umatsun wa Ifiramu na̱ gundo le:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:35">Shutela na̱ Beke na̱ Taha.<verse eid="NUM 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36" />Ugundo wa Eran wu uta̱ ta̱ o umatsun wa Shutela.<verse eid="NUM 26:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37" />Ele nda ele ɗa gundo va Ifiramu, a̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei e le a ɗa ama ukpakukupa mata'atsu nu ukpakukupa ure nu ukpakuton (32,500.)</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:37">Ele ɗa umatsun wa̱ Isuhu na̱ gundo le.<verse eid="NUM 26:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38" />Apa umatsun wa Banyami na̱ gundo le:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:38">Bela na̱ Ashibe na̱ Ahiram<verse eid="NUM 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39" />na̱ Shufam, na̱ Hupaham.<verse eid="NUM 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40" />Ugundo wa Bela wu uta̱ ta̱ o umatsun wa Ardu na̱ Na'ama.<verse eid="NUM 26:40" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41" />Ele nda ele ɗa gundo va Banyami, a̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei ele a ɗa ama, ukpakukupa amunga nu ukpakukupa uton nu ukpakuta̱li (45,600.)<verse eid="NUM 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42" />Apa umatsun wa Dan na̱ gundo le, Shuham.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:42">A̱yi nda a̱yi imaci yu ugundo wa Dan.<verse eid="NUM 26:42" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43" />A̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei o ugundo wa Shuham suru ele ɗa ama, ukpakukupa kupota̱li nu ukpakukupa una̱shi nu ukpakuna̱shi (64,400.)<verse eid="NUM 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44" />Umatsun wa Asha na̱ gundo le ele ɗa:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:44">Imna na̱ Ishivi na̱ Beriya.<verse eid="NUM 26:44" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45" />Waru umatsun wa Beriya ele ɗa: Heba na̱ Malikiye.<verse eid="NUM 26:45" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46" />Asha da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ mawun mo usheli ma na ma̱ ri na aala Sera.<verse eid="NUM 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47" />Ele nda ele ɗa gundo va Asha, a̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei ele a ɗa ama, ukpakukupa kupoton nu ukpakukupa uta'atsu nu ukpakuna̱shi (53,400.)<verse eid="NUM 26:47" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48" />Apa umatsun wa Nafutali na̱ gundo le, Yazeye na̱ Guni,<verse eid="NUM 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49" />na̱ Yeza na̱ Shilem.<verse eid="NUM 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50" />Ele nda ele ɗa gundo va Nafutali, a̱bunda̱ a aza a na e kecei ele a ɗa ama, ukpakukupa amunga nu ukpakukupa uton nu ukpakuna̱shi (45,400.)<verse eid="NUM 26:50" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51" />A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa a̱bunda̱ a ali a Isra'ila aza a na e kecei ele ɗa ama, ukpakukupa ukpakuta̱li nu ukpakukupa ukpaku nu ukpakucindere na̱ mata'atsu (601,730.)<verse eid="NUM 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Musa, <verse eid="NUM 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53" />&lt;&lt;E ne'eshen iɗa'a yo o'wo le ili ya agadu cine a̱bunda̱ a ala e le a̱ ri. <verse eid="NUM 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54" />Ugundo u na u ri a̱bunda̱ lon vu ca le agadu a̱ a̱bunda̱, ugundo u na waru u ri a̱bunda̱ shi a ca yi wa'a. Ugundo suru u ta̱ ushi agadu a̱ yi o una̱ wa aza a na e kecei. <verse eid="NUM 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55" />I reve i ne'eshen ta̱ iɗa'a na̱ mazuwa ma agita. Ili i na ugundo suru u tarai a̱yi ɗa o una̱ wa aala e elentsu a̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56" />Agadu suru e te ne'eshen yi na̱ mazuwa ma agita e ekere o ugundo wa̱ a̱bunda̱ na aza a na a̱ ri a̱bunda̱ shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57" />Apa nan Levi aza a na e kecei na̱ gundo le:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:57">Gashon na̱ Koha na̱ na̱ Merari.<verse eid="NUM 26:57" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58" />Apa waru gundo nan Levi o umatsun wa Libini:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:58">Heburon na̱ Mali,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:58">Mushi na̱ Kora.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:58">Koha ɗa dada va Amuram. <verse eid="NUM 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59" />Amuram zuwa ta̱ Jocebe o umatsun wa̱ Levi, za na a matsayin Levi a̱tsuma̱ a Masar. U matsaan ta̱ Amuram Haruna na̱ Musa na̱ mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun mo usheli me le Maryamu.<verse eid="NUM 26:59" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60" />Haruna ɗa matsain Nada oɓolo na̱ Abihu, na̱ Eliyaza na̱ Itama. <verse eid="NUM 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61" />Agba Nada na̱ Abihu a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱ ana a cayi kucci na akina a na a ntsayi shi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="NUM 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62" />Nan Levi ali a na e kecei, aza a na a rawai woto ko ula'awu suru a rawa ta̱ ama ukpakukupa ushin nu ukpakukupa uta'atsu (23,000.) E kece le oɓolo na akapi a aza a Isra'ila shi adama a na a ca le agadu oɓolo ne ele shi.<verse eid="NUM 26:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63" />Ele ɗa aza a na Musa na̱ Eliyaza nan ganu e kecei a mantsa ma na e kecei aza a Isra'ila a agalaci a̱ Mowa zuzu nu Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu a̱ nka̱la̱la̱i na̱ Jeriko. <verse eid="NUM 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64" />Amma a̱tsuma̱ a aza a na e kecei, babu za na shi buwai a̱tsuma̱ e mekece mo ufaru ma na Musa na̱ Haruna ganu a yuwain a mantsa ma na a̱ da̱na̱i A̱tsumona a Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱ ɗe aza a Isra'ila suru, &lt;&lt;E reve, a̱ ta̱ kuwa̱ a̱tsumona.&gt;&gt; A̱tsuma̱ e le babu za na la'ai she Keleb ulobo wa̱ Jefune na̱ Josuwa ulobo wa̱ Nun.<verse eid="NUM 26:65" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27" />
  <para style="s">Ipati ye Esheli a Zelofeha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1" />Reve esheli a Zelofeha, ulobo wa Hefa ulobo wa Giliyadu, ulobo wa Maki ulobo wa Manase, ulobo wa̱ Isuhu, a̱ ta̱wa̱ zuzu. Ala e le a ɗa, Mala na̱ Nowa na̱ Hogula na̱ Milika na̱ Tiriza. <verse eid="NUM 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2" />A̱vu e isawan elime a Musa na̱ Eliyaza ganu, na azagbain ni iɓolo ya ama suru o una̱ntsu wo Oogodo o Uga'asusan a̱vu a damma, <verse eid="NUM 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3" />&lt;&lt;Dada tsu kuwa̱ ta̱ a̱tsumona. U da̱na̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱za̱ e itoni ya̱ Kora, aza a na a̱ 'ya̱sa̱yin A̱sulazuva aci shi. U kuwa̱ ta̱ adama o unusu wa aciya̱yi. Agba u ri na̱ muwun mo olobo shi. <verse eid="NUM 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4" />Adama a̱ nye aala a dada tsu a̱a̱ kuwa̱ a̱tsuma̱ o ugundo wa̱ yi adama a na u ri na̱ mawun mo ulobo shi? Vu ca tsu akunda agadu a dada tsu, tsi imaci ya̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5" />Reve gba Musa 'ya̱wa̱ na adanshi e le uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="NUM 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma Musa, <verse eid="NUM 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7" />&lt;&lt;Ili i na esheli a Zelofeha aa dansa mejege ma ɗa. Na̱ vu ciga vu 'yuwan vu ca le a agadu a dada le cine vu ca yi imaci ya̱ yi. Vu zuwa agadu a̱ yi wo o'wo za le.<verse eid="NUM 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8" />&lt;&lt;Reve vu damma aza a Isra'ila, &lt;Na̱ vuma kuwa̱ agba u lyawa ulobo shi, i vadala agadu a̱ yi a̱ tyo yo usheli wa̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9" />Waru nu u ri nu usheli shi, i ca muwun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ yi agadu a̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10" />Waru nu u ri na̱ muwun ma̱ a̱na̱wun shi, i ca muwun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma dada va̱ yi agadu a̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11" />Agba na̱ dada va̱ yi ri na̱ muwun ma̱ a̱na̱wun shi, i ca imaci yu ugundo wa̱ yi i na i la'ai zuzu, adama wo o'wo na̱ a̱yi. A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa woo o'wo wila̱ ni ili i na aza a Isra'ila a̱a̱ da̱na̱ a̱a̱ kurusu, cine A̱sulazuva a zuwayi Musa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josuwa o'woi zagbain o una̱ wa̱ Musa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 31:1-6">U.Wl 31:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12" />Urana u ro, reve A̱sulazuva a damma Musa, &lt;&lt;Kumba zuva masasan ma Abarim, reve vu ka̱lyuwa̱ iɗa i na maa ca aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="NUM 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13" />Nna̱ ve ene vu koto, vu ta̱ kuwa̱ cine zakpara va̱ wu Haruna kuwa̱i, <verse eid="NUM 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14" />adama a na ana iɓolo ya ama i yuwain aciyogbamu a̱ mini ma Meriba zuzu na̱ lyuci va Kedesh A̱tsumona a̱ Zin, a̱ɗu ra i 'yuwan ta̱ a yuwan tsutoni ni ili i na n dammai. I ca mu tsugbain tsa akiza a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma ama uba̱ta̱ u ndeɗe shi.&gt;&gt; A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa mini ma Meriba Kedesh A̱tsumona a̱ Zin.<verse eid="NUM 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15" />Reve Musa usu A̱sulazuva, <verse eid="NUM 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16" />&lt;&lt;Lyawa A̱sulazuva, A̱sula̱ a wuma wu vaɗi suru u ɗangwaa ama a Isra'ila zagbain va aci a ama a nda. <verse eid="NUM 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17" />Vu ca le vuma na aa gura walaa le elime o uvon, adama ama a̱ A̱sulazuva o o'wo she damma ikyon babu za va a aguɓa wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Musa, &lt;&lt;Vu tara Josuwa ulobo wa̱ Nun, vuma na ri na̱ ruhu va̱ A̱sula̱, vu kuruwa̱ yi ekere. <verse eid="NUM 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19" />Vu zuwa yi wi isawan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma Eliyaza ganu ni iɓolo ya ama suru reve vu tawa yi e esu e le. <verse eid="NUM 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20" />Vu ca yi ucira wa̱ wu adama iɓolo ya aza a Isra'ila suru a yuwaan yi tsutoni. <verse eid="NUM 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21" />U te isawan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma Eliyaza ganu, za na aa zamiya yi a̱sa̱la̱ nu ulinga na̱ Urim e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva. Nu udammu wa̱ yi u ɗa aza a Isra'ila oo uta̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon, waru nu udammu wa̱ yi u ɗa a̱ ka̱mba̱, a̱yi oɓolo ni iɓolo ya aza a Isra'ila suru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22" />Musa gba yuwan ta̱ cine A̱sulazuva a damma niyi. U tara ta̱ Josuwa a̱vu u zuwa yi wi isawan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma Eliyaza ganu ni iɓolo ya ama suru. <verse eid="NUM 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23" />Reve u kuruwa̱ yi ekere a̱vu u tawa yi adama o ulinga, cine A̱sulazuva a dammai o una̱ wa Musa.<verse eid="NUM 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28" />
  <para style="s">Kucci vu urana biti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 29:38-43">Mta̱ 29:38-43</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 6:8-13">N.Gn 6:8-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma Musa, <verse eid="NUM 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2" />&lt;&lt;Ca aza a Isra'ila wila̱ u nda a̱vu vu damma le: &lt;I reve i ta̱wa̱a̱ mu ta̱ ni ilyalya i kucci a mantsa ma na n zuwai, za na a yuwain na akina, ili ma̱guru mo uyo'o a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ va̱.&gt; <verse eid="NUM 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3" />Reve vu damma le: Apa kucci va akina na yaa ca a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva: mugiri'i n re n na n ri na a'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ aza a na a̱ ri usa̱du shi, kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu usana suru. <verse eid="NUM 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4" />A ca kucci ma̱giri'i za ta̱ nu usana, za ta̱ nu ulivu, <verse eid="NUM 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5" />oɓolo na̱ kucci makundatsu mo uɓatsulai uta̱ u efa a̱tsuma̱ a kupa ma yira i lashi, za na a̱ ja̱mba̱ra̱i nu uɓatsulai uta̱ a̱tsuma̱ o una̱shi a mani'in ma̱ zetun. <verse eid="NUM 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6" />Kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu usana suru ɗa za na a zuwai a yuwusan a Masasan ma Sinai ili i ma̱guru mo uyo'o, za na a yuwain na akina a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="NUM 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7" />Ili i na oo ɓolo na̱ kucci ma̱giri'i vu usana'a a ta ca kucci vi ili yo oso vu uɓatsulai uta a̱tsuma̱ o una̱shi e meden. A̱ ta̱ tsun kucci vi ili yo oso'o a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱a̱'isa̱. <verse eid="NUM 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8" />I ca ma̱giri'i ma̱ ta̱ ma na ma buwai nu ulivu, oɓolo na̱ cu'un kucci vi ishina oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso na o foɓoi nu usana. A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa kucci na a yuwain na akina, ili i ma̱guru mo uyo'o e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva.<verse eid="NUM 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kucci vu urana wa Ashibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9" />&lt;&lt;O urana wa Ashibi, i ca kucci mugiri'i n re aza a na a̱ ri na aa'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ aza a na a̱ ri usa̱du shi, oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso na̱ kucci vi ishina nkundatsu n re n efa a̱tsuma̱ a kupa u yira i lashi i na a̱ ja̱mba̱ra̱i na̱ mani'in. <verse eid="NUM 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10" />A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa kucci vu ukula̱tosu va Ashibi suru, babu na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu usana suru oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso va̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kucci woto woto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11" />&lt;&lt;O ufaru u woto suru, i ta̱wa̱a̱ A̱sulazuva na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu muggono mi inan n re, oɓolo na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱, waru na̱ mugiri'i n cindere ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱, aza a na a̱ ri usa̱du shi. <verse eid="NUM 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12" />O to ɓolo moggono suru na̱ kucci vi ishina nu uɓatsulai uta'atsu u makundatsu ma efa a̱tsuma̱ a kupa i yira i lashi i na a̱ ja̱mba̱ra̱i na̱ mani'in, oɓolo na̱ a̱a̱giri'i, na̱ kucci vi ishina nu uɓatsulai ure a̱tsuma̱ a kupa i yira i lashi i na a̱ ja̱mba̱ra̱i na̱ mani'in. <verse eid="NUM 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13" />Waru oɓolo na̱ mokyokyon suru a ca kucci vu uɓatsulai uta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa u makundatsu ma efa i yira i lashi i na a̱ ja̱mba̱ra̱i na̱ mani'in. A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa adama a̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu, ili i ma̱guru mo uyo'o, kucci na a cayi A̱sulazuva va akina. <verse eid="NUM 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14" />Kucci vi ili yo oso e le u to o'wo muden n re m masayan adama o oogono a nan suru, na̱ meden ma̱ ta̱ na akapi adama a̱ a̱a̱giri'i suru na̱ meden ma̱ ta̱ adama o mokyokyon suru. A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa kucci vu ukula̱tosu u woto suru na aa yuwan o woto u sa'avu a̱tsuma̱ a aa'wan. <verse eid="NUM 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15" />Babu na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu urana suru oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso, a ta ca kucci ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva.<verse eid="NUM 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱buki a Mapasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:5-8">N.Gn 23:5-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16" />&lt;&lt;O urana wa kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi o woto wu ufaru, a ta yuwan A̱buki a Mapasa ma̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="NUM 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17" />O urana wa kupa no ozo o ton o woto'o, a ta yuwan a̱buki, a ta tama opopofu a na a yuwain na̱ wolilo shi hali rana cindere. <verse eid="NUM 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18" />Urana wu ufaru wa̱ a̱buki'i u to o'wo urana u gbain wi iɓolo ya akiza. She i yuwan ulinga u ro u na i tsu yuwusan wan. <verse eid="NUM 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19" />I ca A̱sulazuva kucci na a yuwain va akina, kucci vu ukula̱tosu muggono mi inan n re, a̱a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ mugiri'i n cindere ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱, aza a na a̱ ri usa̱du shi. <verse eid="NUM 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20" />Oɓolo na̱ moggono ma nan suru i foɓo kucci vi ishina i yira i lashi vu nkundatsu n ta'atsu n efa a̱tsuma̱ a kupa i na a̱ ja̱mba̱ra̱i na̱ mani'in, a̱a̱giri'i suru o ɓolo yi na̱ nkundatsu n re a̱tsuma̱ a kupa, <verse eid="NUM 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21" />ma̱giri'i ma̱ ta̱ suru o ɓolo yi na̱ makundatsu ma̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa ma yira i lashi. <verse eid="NUM 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22" />Waru i ca ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, adama a yuwan kucci matara mo ume mo unusu ma̱ ɗu. <verse eid="NUM 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23" />I ta ca kucci nda babu na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu za na a tsu ca usana suru. <verse eid="NUM 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24" />Tsunda tsa ɗa yaa ca ilyalya, kucci na a yuwain na akina vu urana suru, hali rana cindere, ili i ma̱guru mo uyo'o a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. I ta ca kucci nda babu na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso vu urana suru. <verse eid="NUM 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25" />O urana we cindere'e i ta yuwan iɓolo ya akiza, yaa yuwan ulinga u na i tsu yuwusan shi.<verse eid="NUM 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kucci va̱ A̱buki o Ugasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:15-22">N.Gn 23:15-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26" />&lt;&lt;O urana wu ufaru wu ucasu wu umatsun wu ufaru, ana yaa ca A̱sulazuva kucci vi ishina i sa'avu a mantsa ma̱ A̱buki a Ajuma Ajuma, i yuwan iɓolo ya akiza, agba i yuwan ulinga u na i tsu yuwusan wan. <verse eid="NUM 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27" />I ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu muggono mi inan n re, oɓolo na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱, na̱ mugiri'i n cindere ma aa'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ ili i ma̱guru mo uyo'o e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="NUM 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28" />Oɓolo na̱ moggono ma nan suru a ca kucci vi ishina nkundatsu n ta'atsu n efa a̱tsuma̱ a kupa i yira i lashi i na a̱ ja̱mba̱ra̱i na̱ mani'in, oɓolo na̱ a̱a̱giri'i nkundatsu n re a̱tsuma̱ a kupa, <verse eid="NUM 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29" />oɓolo na̱ ma̱giri'i ma̱ ta̱ suru, a ta ca makundatsu ma̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa. <verse eid="NUM 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30" />I ta ca ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a yuwan kucci matara mo ume mo unusu ma̱ ɗu. <verse eid="NUM 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31" />I ca ele nda oɓolo na kucci vi ili yo oso, babu na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu urana suru na̱ kucci vi ishina va̱ yi. I reve iliyamunga i ndolo a̱ ri usa̱du shi.<verse eid="NUM 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29" />
  <para style="s">A̱buki a̱ wivulu wa Avana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:23-25">N.Gn 23:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1" />&lt;&lt;O urana wu ufaru o woto we cindere i yuwan iɓolo ya akiza, agba she i yuwan ulinga u na i tsu yuwusan wan. Urana u wivulu wa avana u ɗa. <verse eid="NUM 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2" />I ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu u moggono ma nan ma̱ ta̱, oɓolo na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱, na̱ mugiri'i n cindere aza a na a̱ ri na a'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱, ili i ma̱guru mo uyo'o e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, suru nle a̱ da̱na̱ usa̱du wan. <verse eid="NUM 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3" />Oɓolo na̱ moggono ma na'an i ca kucci vi ishina nkundatsu n ta'atsu n efa a̱tsuma̱ a kupa i yira i lashi i na a̱ ja̱mba̱ra̱i na̱ mani'in, oɓolo na̱ a̱a̱giri'i i ca nkundatsu n re a̱tsuma̱ a kupa. <verse eid="NUM 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4" />Oɓolo na̱ ma̱giri'i suru i ca makundatsu ma̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa. <verse eid="NUM 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5" />I ta ca ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, adama a yuwan kucci matara mo ume mo unusu ma̱ ɗu. <verse eid="NUM 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6" />Ele nda uda̱shiyi u ɗa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ kucci vu woto na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu usana suru na̱ kucci vi ishina i le, na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso cine a zuwai. Kucci na a yuwain na akina a ɗa ili ma̱guru mo uyo'o e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva.<verse eid="NUM 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Urana u kucci matara mo ume mo unusu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:26-32">N.Gn 23:26-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7" />&lt;&lt;O urana wa kupa o woto we cindere i yuwan iɓolo ya akiza. I ciga i 'yuwan i tara akuli agba yaa yuwan ulinga shi. <verse eid="NUM 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8" />I ta ca A̱sulazuva kucci vu ukula̱tosu ili i ma̱guru mo uyo'o, moggono ma̱ nan ma̱ ta̱, na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱, na̱ mugiri'i n cindere aza a na a̱ ri na aa'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱. Ele nda suru a̱ da̱na̱ usa̱du wan. <verse eid="NUM 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9" />Oɓolo na̱ moggono ma na'an i ca kucci vi ishina nkundatsu n ta'atsu n efa a̱tsuma̱ a kupa i yira i lashi i na a̱ ja̱mba̱ra̱i na̱ mani'in. Oɓolo na̱ a̱a̱giri'i waru i ca nkundatsu n re a̱tsuma̱ a kupa. <verse eid="NUM 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10" />Oɓolo na̱ ma̱giri'i ma̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱za̱ e cindere suru i ca makundatsu ma̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa. <verse eid="NUM 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11" />Waru i ca ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, babu na̱ kucci matara mo ume mo unusu na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu u na a tsu yuwusan urana suru, oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ishina va̱ yi, na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso le.<verse eid="NUM 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱buki o Oogodo o Uga'asusan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-44">N.Gn 23:33-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12" />&lt;&lt;O urana wa kupa no ozo o ton o woto we cindere, i yuwan iɓolo ya akiza, amma she i yuwan ulinga wu urana suru wan. I yuwan a̱buki a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva hali rana cindere. <verse eid="NUM 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13" />I ta ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu, kucci na a yuwain na akina, ili i ma̱guru mo uyo'o a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva. I ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu muggono mi inan kupa na aza a ta'atsu, na̱ a̱giri'i e re na̱ mugiri'i kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi aza a na a̱ ri na a'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱. Ele nda suru a̱ da̱na̱ usa̱du wan. <verse eid="NUM 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14" />Oɓolo na̱ moggono ma̱ ta̱ suru va kupa na aza a ta'atsu'u i ca kucci vi ishina nkundatsu n ta'atsu n efa i yira i lashi i na a̱ ja̱mba̱ra̱i na̱ mani'in. Oɓolo na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱ suru ve ejere'e i ca nkundatsu n re a̱tsuma̱ a kupa. <verse eid="NUM 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15" />Oɓolo na̱ ma̱giri'i suru va kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi'i i ca makundatsu ma̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa. <verse eid="NUM 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16" />I ɓolo na̱ ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, babu na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu urana suru na̱ kucci vi ishina oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso.<verse eid="NUM 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17" />&lt;&lt;O urana we ire wa̱ a̱buki'i i foɓo muggono mi inan kupa ne ejere, na̱ a̱giri'i e re oɓolo na̱ mugiri'i kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi aza a na a̱ ri na a'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱, suru nle aza a na a̱ ri usa̱du shi. <verse eid="NUM 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18" />Kucci suru vu muggono mi inan, na̱ a̱giri'i oɓolo na̱ mugiri'i, i yuwan le na̱ kucci vi ishina oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso o una̱ wa̱ a̱bunda̱ e ili i na a zuwai. <verse eid="NUM 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19" />I ca ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, babu na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu urana suru oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ishina na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso i le.<verse eid="NUM 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20" />&lt;&lt;O urana wa ta'atsu wa̱ a̱buki'i i ca muggono mi inan kupa na̱ za ta̱, na̱ a̱giri'i e re, na̱ mugiri'i kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi aza a na a̱ ri na a'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱, waru a̱ da̱na̱ usa̱du wan. <verse eid="NUM 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21" />Oɓolo na̱ muggono mi inan, na̱ a̱giri'i na̱ mugiri'i, i ca kucci vi ishina le na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso o una̱ wa̱ a̱bunda̱ e ili i na a zuwai. <verse eid="NUM 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22" />I ca ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, babu na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu urana suru, oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ishina va̱ yi na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso.<verse eid="NUM 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23" />&lt;&lt;O urana wa̱ na̱shi wa̱ a̱buki'i, i ta ca muggono mi inan kupa, oɓolo na̱ a̱giri'i e re, na̱ mugiri'i kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi aza a na a̱ ri a'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ aza a na a̱ ri usa̱du shi. <verse eid="NUM 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24" />Oɓolo na̱ muggono mi ina'an, na̱ a̱giri'i na̱ mugiri'i, i ca kucci vi ishina le na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso o una̱ wa̱ a̱bunda̱ e ili i na a zuwai. <verse eid="NUM 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25" />I ca ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, babu na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu urana suru, oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ishina va̱ yi na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso.<verse eid="NUM 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26" />&lt;&lt;O urana wa tawun wa̱ a̱buki'i, i ta ca muggono mi inan kucci, na̱ a̱giri'i e re na̱ mugiri'i kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi aza a na a̱ ri na a'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ waru a̱ da̱na̱ usa̱du wan. <verse eid="NUM 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27" />Oɓolo no ogono e inan, na̱ a̱giri'i na̱ mugiri'i, i ca kucci vi ishina le na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso o una̱ wa̱ a̱bunda̱ e ili i na a zuwai. <verse eid="NUM 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28" />I ca ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, babu na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu urana suru, oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ishina va̱ yi na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso.<verse eid="NUM 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29" />&lt;&lt;O urana wa̱ ta̱li wa̱ a̱buki'i, i ta ca muggono mi inan kunla̱ na̱ a̱giri'i e re, na̱ mugiri'i kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi aza a na a̱ ri na a'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱, waru a̱ da̱na̱ usa̱du wan. <verse eid="NUM 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30" />Oɓolo na̱ muggono mi ina'an, na̱ a̱giri'i na̱ mugiri'i, i ca kucci vi ishina le na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso o una̱ wa̱ a̱bunda̱ e ili i na a zuwai. <verse eid="NUM 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31" />I ca ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, babu na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu urana suru, oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ishina va̱ yi na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso.<verse eid="NUM 29:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32" />&lt;&lt;O urana we cindere wa̱ a̱buki'i, i ta ca muggono mi inan n cindere na̱ a̱giri'i e re, na̱ mugiri'i kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi aza a na a̱ ri na a'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱, waru a̱ da̱na̱ usa̱du wan. <verse eid="NUM 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33" />Oɓolo na̱ muggono mi ina'an, na̱ a̱giri'i na̱ mugiri'i, i ca kucci vi ishina le na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso o una̱ wa̱ a̱bunda̱ e ili i na a zuwai. <verse eid="NUM 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34" />I ca ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, babu na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu urana suru, oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ishina va̱ yi na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso.<verse eid="NUM 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35" />&lt;&lt;O urana wa̱ kunla̱ i ɓoloto, amma she i yuwan ulinga u na i tsu yuwusan kuci wan. <verse eid="NUM 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36" />I ta ca kucci na a yuwain na akina ili i ma̱guru mo uyo'o a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu moggono ma nan, na̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ ta̱, na̱ mugiri'i n cindere aza a na a̱ ri na a'wan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ waru aza a na a̱ ri usa̱du shi. <verse eid="NUM 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37" />Oɓolo na̱ moggono ma na'an, na̱ a̱a̱giri'i na̱ mugiri'i, i ca kucci vi ishina le na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso o una̱ wa̱ a̱bunda̱ e ili i na a zuwai. <verse eid="NUM 29:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38" />I ca ma̱ga̱ji ma̱ ta̱ adama a̱ kucci vu unusu, babu na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu urana suru, oɓolo na̱ kucci vi ishina va̱ yi na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso.<verse eid="NUM 29:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39" />&lt;&lt;Ele nda ele ɗa kucci na yaa ca A̱sulazuva a mantsa ma na yaa yuwusan a̱buki a na a zuwai, babu na̱ kucci ɗu na yaa yuwan adama i shiton akucunu a̱ ɗu, nu une'e u na yaa yuwan na asuvu o uyo'o adama a̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu, na̱ kucci vi ishina, na̱ kucci vi ili yo oso, na̱ kucci muwwulai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 29:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 29:40" />Musa damma ta̱ aza a Isra'ila ili i na A̱sulazuva a damma niyi suru.<verse eid="NUM 29:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30" />
  <para style="s">Wila̱ adama a Akucunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1" />A̱vu Musa damma azagbain o gundo va Isra'ila, apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, <verse eid="NUM 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ vali yuwan akucunu na̱ A̱sulazuva ko u yuwan nzuwulai, ko u damma u ta yuwan ili i ro, she u bula̱ a yuwan ili i na u dammai u ta yuwan wan, u ciga u 'yuwan u shiton ili i na u dammai nu una̱ wa̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ usheli ma na ma buwai o u'wa wa dada va̱ yi ma yuwan akucunu a̱ tyo a̱ A̱sulazuva ko u zuwa aciya̱yi u ta yuwan ili i ro, <verse eid="NUM 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4" />na̱ dada va̱ yi gba uwwa ili i na u dammai ko akucunu a na u yuwain agba u damma yi ili i ro shi, akucunu a na u yuwain suru na̱ nzuwulai n na u yuwain suru e isawan ta̱. <verse eid="NUM 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5" />Amma na̱ dada va̱ yi uwwa a̱vu u putsa yi a na wu uwwa niyi, ko akucunu a na u yuwain ko nzuwulai n na u yuwain ee isawan shi, A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ ba̱ɗa̱ yi adama a na dada va̱ yi putsa niyi.<verse eid="NUM 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6" />&lt;&lt;Nu u yuwan lolo a̱yi na akucunu ko cina u yuwan adanshi nu una̱ wa̱ yi babu majiyan za na wu nla̱i aciya̱yi, <verse eid="NUM 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:7" />na̱ vali va̱ yi uwwa adama e le agba u damma ili i ro shi, to, akucunu na̱ nzuwulai n ndolo a na u tarayi aciya̱yi e isawan ta̱. <verse eid="NUM 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8" />Amma na̱ vali va̱ yi putsa yi a mantsa ma na wu uwwai, o una ta̱ akucunu na̱ nzuwulai n ndolo n na u yuwayin aciya̱yi babu majiyan, A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ ba̱ɗa̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9" />&lt;&lt;Akucunu a na ma̱runa̱ ko za na kakasai lolo yuwain suru, a̱ ta̱ lo yi.<verse eid="NUM 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ ka na ri na̱ lolo yuwan akucunu ko wu nla̱ aciya̱yi na̱ nzuwulai ma akucunu, <verse eid="NUM 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11" />na̱ vali va̱ yi uwwa a ɗa a akucunu'u agba u damma ili i ro shi waru u putsa yi shi, to, akucunu na̱ nzuwulai n na u yuwain suru a̱ ta̱ lo yi. <verse eid="NUM 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12" />Amma na̱ vali va̱ yi una le a mantsa ma na wu uwwai, to, ko akucunu ko nzuwulai n ta̱ mee isawan shi. Vali va̱ yi putsa ta̱ ɗe, A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ ba̱ɗa̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13" />Vali va̱ yi ta̱ nu ucira u zuwa wo o'wo amayun, ko waru wu una akucunu ko nzuwulai n na wu nla̱yi aciya̱yi. <verse eid="NUM 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14" />Amma na̱ vali va̱ yi damma ili i ro shi suru suru, to, u usu ta̱ akucunu a̱ yi suru ko nzuwulai n na wu nla̱yi aciya̱yi. U usu le ta̱ a na u dammai ili shi ana wu uwwa nle. <verse eid="NUM 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15" />Amma na̱ wu uwwa yi, a̱vu na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ wu una le, to, vali'i a̱yi ɗa waa tara ume wu unusu wu ka'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16" />Ele nda ele ɗa ili i na a̱a̱ kuru i na A̱sulazuva a dammai Musa adama a akucunu a na a̱ ri a vali na̱ ka va̱ yi, na akucunu a na a̱ ri ya dada na̱ mawun mo usheli ma na ma buwai nden o u'wa wa̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 30:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31" />
  <para style="s">Uvon na aza a Midiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ Musa, u damma, <verse eid="NUM 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2" />&lt;&lt;Vu tsupaa aza a Isra'ila e ekere a aza a Midiya. Na̱ a̱yi ndolo koto, vu ta̱ kuwa̱ reve vu cina nkaya ma̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3" />Reve Musa damma ama, &lt;&lt;I foɓo ama o ro a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu a yuwan uvon na aza a Midiya adama a tsupaa A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="NUM 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4" />A̱vu i lyungu ama ukpakukupa (1,000) uba̱ta̱ o uvon diga o ugundo suru wa Isra'ila.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5" />A̱vu a ɗangula ama ukpakukupa kupa nu ukpakukupa ure (12,000). O to foɓo ama ukpakukupa (1,000) diga o ugundo wa aza a Isra'ila suru. <verse eid="NUM 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6" />Musa lyungu le ta̱ uba̱ta̱ o uvon, ukpakukupa o ugundo suru, oɓolo na̱ Finiha ganu ulobo wa Eliyaza, za na tarai itana ya akiza diga a̱ A̱a̱'isa̱ oɓolo na avana adama e iroci yu uvon.<verse eid="NUM 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7" />A̱vu a yuwan uvon na aza a Midiya cine A̱sulazuva a dammai Musa, a̱vu o una vali suru. <verse eid="NUM 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8" />A̱tsuma̱ a aza a na o unai ele ɗa Ivi na̱ Rekem na̱ Zur na̱ Hur na̱ Reba ngono n ton ma Midiya. Waru o una ta̱ Balam ulobo wa̱ Beyo na̱ matsun me pe'eni. <verse eid="NUM 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9" />A̱vu aza a Isra'ila e reme a̱ma̱ci na̱ muwun ma aza a Midiya, a̱vu a̱ pura̱ oɓolo e inan na̱ mgbele ni itana, ili i na a̱ pura̱i uba̱ta̱ o uvon. <verse eid="NUM 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10" />A̱vu a̱ kula̱to ilyuci i na aza a Midiya a̱ ri nden suru oɓolo na̱ va̱la̱ta̱ le, <verse eid="NUM 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11" />A̱ pura̱ ta̱ ili yu uvon suru ni ili i na a̱ tsura̱i o uvon suru, oɓolo na ama ni iliyamunga. <verse eid="NUM 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12" />A̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na aza a na e remei ni ili i na a̱ pura̱i yu uvon ni ili i na a̱ tsura̱i o uvon uba̱ta̱ wa Musa, na̱ Eliyaza ganu, nu uba̱ta̱ wi iɓolo ya aza a Isra'ila, o uva̱la̱ta̱ wa agalaci wa̱ Mowa zuzu na̱ Urudu a̱ nka̱la̱la̱i na̱ Jeriko.<verse eid="NUM 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13" />A̱vu Musa na̱ Eliyaza ganu, na azagbain a ama suru o uta̱ a ga'an ne ele a alanga o uva̱la̱ta̱. <verse eid="NUM 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14" />Musa gba yuwan ta̱ upan lon na azagbain a̱ a̱soja, na̱ nan yali vu ukpakukupa kupa, na̱ nan yali vu ukpaku ukpaku, aza a na a̱ ka̱mba̱i diga uba̱ta̱ o uvon.<verse eid="NUM 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15" />A̱vu we ece le u damma, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai i lyawai a̱ma̱ci'i wuma?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16" />&lt;&lt;Cuwain, ele ɗa aza a na a̱ kuruyi a̱sa̱la̱ a Balam, waru ele ɗa a zuwai aza a Isra'ila a vadalayi A̱sulazuva ucina̱ e ili na i farai a Peyo, ɗaɗa gba mɓa̱la̱ n fabai ama a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="NUM 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17" />Gogo she yu una mawun ma vali suru. Reve yu una ka na suru revei vali. <verse eid="NUM 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18" />Amma esheli a na suru koto e revei ali shi i lyawa le wuma adama a aciya̱ɗu.<verse eid="NUM 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19" />&lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu suru za na unai vuma ko u ju'wa̱in a̱kwa̱kwa̱ u ta̱ da̱nu ɗe a̱ca̱pa̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱ hali rana cindere. O urana wa ta'atsu na̱ we cindere ni i ciga i 'yuwan i ka̱mba̱to aciya̱ɗu na aza a na i remei cece. <verse eid="NUM 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20" />I ka̱mba̱to a̱tugu a̱ ɗu cece oɓolo ni itana i na a yuwain na̱ kwan suru, ni itana ye eleme yi mgbele na̱ ya akpata.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21" />Eliyaza ganu gba u damma ta̱ a̱soja a na a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ o uvon, &lt;&lt;Apa nda ili i na a̱a̱ kuru adama a̱ wila̱ u na A̱sulazuva a cayi Musa: <verse eid="NUM 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22" />Zinariya na̱ azurufa na̱ rumushili na̱ rumu na̱ kuza na̱ daluma, <verse eid="NUM 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:23" />ni ili i na suru akina a̱ tsu kula̱to shi ele ɗa yaa lapula pe a̱tsuma̱ a akina, reve o o'wo cece. Suru na̱ ne a̱ ta̱ ka̱mba̱to le cece a̱tsuma̱ a̱ mini mo uka̱mba̱tosu cece. Amma ili i na akina a̱ tsu kula̱to suru, a̱ ka̱mba̱to le cece a̱tsuma̱ a̱ mini'i. <verse eid="NUM 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24" />I ta̱ za̱'wa̱ a̱tugu a̱ ɗu o urana we cindere adama yo o'wo cece. Na̱ a̱yi ndolo koto a̱vu i ka̱mba̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Une'esun wi ili i na a̱ pura̱i uba̱ta̱ wu uvon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25" />A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱ Musa, <verse eid="NUM 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ a̱vu na̱ Eliyaza ganu, na̱ azagbain a 'wa, i te kece ama ni iliyamunga i na e remei suru. <verse eid="NUM 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27" />I ne'eshen itana i na a usai uba̱ta̱ o uvon ba̱ta̱ re, i ca a̱soja a na a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ o uvon akunda a̱ ta̱, akunda a̱ ta̱ gba i ca akapi a ama. <verse eid="NUM 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28" />Diga pe a̱tsuma̱ a akunda a̱ a̱soja a na a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ o uvon, i fara tawaa A̱sulazuva akunda e ili i na a̱ pura̱i uba̱ta̱ wu uvon. Za ta̱ diga a̱tsuma̱ o ukpakuton (500) biti, ko za va ama, ko za vi inan, ko za vu nloli, ko za vi ikyon, ko za vu mgbele. <verse eid="NUM 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29" />Vu tara uɓatsulai wa akunda wa̱ a̱soja a nda, a̱vu vu ca Eliyaza ganu, wo o'wo ucasu wa̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="NUM 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30" />Diga a̱tsuma̱ a akunda e itana i na yo o'woi za va aza a Isra'ila, i tara pe za ta̱ diga a̱tsuma̱ a kupoton, ko za va ama, ko za vi inan, ko za vu nloli, ko za vi ikyon, ko za vu mgbele ko va akapi e iliyamunga i na i buwai. Vu ca nan Levi ele aza a na a̱a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ Oogodo a Uga'asusan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 31:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31" />A̱vu Musa na̱ Eliyaza ganu a yuwan cine A̱sulazuva a zuwai Musa yuwan.<verse eid="NUM 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32" />Nda a̱bunda̱ e itana i na a̱soja a usai o uvon: ikyon ukpakukupa ukpakuta̱li nu ukpakukupa kupocindere nu ukpakukupa uton (675,000), <verse eid="NUM 31:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33" />inan ukpakukupa kupocindere nu ukpakukupa ure (72,000), <verse eid="NUM 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 31:34" />nloli ukpakukupa kupota̱li nu ukpakukupa (61,000), <verse eid="NUM 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:35" />esheli a na koto e revei ali shi ukpakukupa mata'atsu nu ukpakukupa ure (32,000),<verse eid="NUM 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36" />Akunda a na a cayi aza a na a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i uvon ele ɗa: ikyon ukpakukupa ukpaku uta'atsu nu ukpakukupa mata'atsu nu ukpakukupa ucindere, nu ukpakuton (337,500). <verse eid="NUM 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37" />Diga a̱tsuma̱ e le a ɗa a tarai akunda a̱ A̱sulazuva ikyon ukpakuta̱li na̱ kupocindere no ozo o ton (675). <verse eid="NUM 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38" />Inan waru ukpakukupa mata'atsu nu ukpakukupa uta̱li (36,000). Diga a̱tsuma̱ e le a ɗa a tarai akunda a̱ A̱sulazuva inan kupocindere ne ejere. <verse eid="NUM 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39" />Nloli waru ukpakukupa mata'atsu nu ukpakuton (30,500). Diga a̱tsuma̱ e le a ɗa a tarai akunda a̱ A̱sulazuva kupota̱li na̱ za ta̱. <verse eid="NUM 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40" />Esheli a na koto e revei ali shi ele ɗa ukpakukupa kupa nu ukpakukupa uta̱li (16,000), a̱tsuma̱ e le a ɗa a tarai akunda a̱ A̱sulazuva mata'atsu ne ejere.<verse eid="NUM 31:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41" />A̱vu Musa ca Eliyaza ganu akunda a na a̱ ri va̱ A̱sulazuva, cine A̱sulazuva a dammai Musa.<verse eid="NUM 31:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42" />Diga a̱tsuma̱ a akunda a aza a Isra'ila, aza a na Musa tawai diga a̱tsuma̱ a ama a na a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i uvon, <verse eid="NUM 31:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43" />akunda a ama'a a̱yi ɗa ikyon ukpakukupa ukpaku uta'atsu nu ukpakukupa mata'atsu nu ukpakukupa ucindere nu ukpakuton (337,500). <verse eid="NUM 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44" />Inan waru ukpakukupa ukpaku mata'atsu nu ukpakukupa uta̱li (36,000), <verse eid="NUM 31:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45" />nloli waru ukpakukupa ukpaku mata'atsu nu ukpakuton (30,500). <verse eid="NUM 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46" />Esheli waru ukpakukupa kupa nu ukpakukupa uta̱li (16,000). <verse eid="NUM 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47" />Diga a̱tsuma̱ a akunda a ama a Isra'ila, Musa tara ta̱ za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupoton va ama ni iliyamunga cine A̱sulazuva a damma niyi, a̱vu u ca nan Levi aza a na a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ Oogodo Uga'asusan.<verse eid="NUM 31:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48" />A̱vu azagbain a na a̱ shi aci o oɓolo oɓolo a̱ a̱soja, na̱ nan yali vu ukpakukupa kupa na̱ a̱za̱ o ukpaku ukpaku a̱ ta̱wa̱ ya Musa, <verse eid="NUM 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49" />a̱vu a damma yi, &lt;&lt;A̱tsu agbashi a̱ wu tsu kece ta̱ a̱soja a na a̱ ri za̱la̱ tsu agba ko vuma ta̱ puwa̱n shi. <verse eid="NUM 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50" />A̱yi ɗa nda tsu ta̱wa̱yi A̱sulazuva kucci itana i zinariya i na vuma suru a̱tsuma̱ a̱ tsu u tsura̱i, mpa̱ta̱ta̱ na̱ nshingi na̱ nkawani mu urotsu ni iliyatsuvu ni iliyinlu, adama tsu yuwan kucci matara mo ume mo unusu adama a aciya̱tsu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 31:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51" />Musa na̱ Eliyaza ganu a̱ ushi ta̱ zinariya diga e ekere e le ni itana zinariya na a̱ zuɗa̱i suru. <verse eid="NUM 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52" />Zinariya nan yali vu ukpakukupa kupa na̱ nan yali vu ukpaku ukpaku na Musa na̱ Eliyaza a cayi A̱sulazuva une'e ume wa̱ yi u ɗa shekel ukpakukupa kupa nu ukpakukupa uta̱li nu ukpakucindere na̱ kupoton (16,750). <verse eid="NUM 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53" />Soja biti u pura̱ ta̱ akunda e itana i na a̱ pura̱i uba̱ta̱ wu uvon adama a aciya̱yi. <verse eid="NUM 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54" />Musa na̱ Eliyaza ganu a̱ ushi ta̱ zinariya e ekere a nan yali vu ukpakukupa kupa na̱ nan yali vu ukpaku ukpaku, a̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ ne ele a̱tsuma̱ o Oogodo o Uga'asusan adama o ucuwusan wa aza a Isra'ila a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva.<verse eid="NUM 31:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32" />
  <para style="s">Gundo na a cayi asana a̱ Urudu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 3:12-22">U.Wl 3:12-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1" />Ama a̱ Roben na̱ Gadu gba aza a na a̱ shi no oɓolo e inan ni ikyon na̱ mgbele na̱ a̱bunda̱ lon, e ene ta̱ iɗa ya Jaza na̱ Giliyadu uba̱ta̱ u sa'ani u ɗa adama e iliyamunga. <verse eid="NUM 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2" />Adama o ndolo a̱vu a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ya Musa na̱ Eliyaza ganu na azagbain a ama a Isra'ila, a̱vu a damma, <verse eid="NUM 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3" />&lt;&lt;Ataro na̱ Dibon na̱ Jaza na̱ Nimra na̱ Heshibon na̱ Eliyale na̱ Sibma na̱ Nebo na̱ Beyon, <verse eid="NUM 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:4" />iɗa i na A̱sulazuva a lyuwai nu uvon a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma ama a Isra'ila, u tu ulobonu adama e iliyamunga. Waru agbashi a̱ wu a̱ ta̱ ni iliyamunga ya̱ a̱bunda̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5" />A̱vu a damma, &lt;&lt;Na̱ tsu tsura̱ isa'ani e ekere a̱ wu, lyawa a ca agbashi a̱ wu iɗa i nda, wo o'wo tsu za va agadu. She vu zuwa tsu tsu pasa mavada ma̱ Urudu wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6" />Amma Musa usu ta̱ ama a Roben na ama a Gadu u damma, &lt;&lt;I ciga ta̱ a̱za̱ a̱ ɗu a̱ 'ya̱wusa̱ uvon, a̱ɗu gba i da̱nu ili i ɗu ko? <verse eid="NUM 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7" />Adama a̱ nye ya kuɗa okolo a ama a Isra'ila a pasa a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva a ca nle? <verse eid="NUM 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8" />Ne ɗa nkaya n ɗu n yuwain mantsa ma na n lyungu nle diga Kadesh Baniya a̱ ka̱lyuwa̱ iɗa'a. <verse eid="NUM 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9" />Mantsa ma na a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i o uka̱ri wa Eshiko e enei iɗa'a, a̱vu a kuɗa okolo a ama a Isra'ila na a uwa pe e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva a ca nle. <verse eid="NUM 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan upan urana u ndolo, a̱vu u yuwan akucunu a nda: <verse eid="NUM 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11" />&lt;Adama a na a̱ kuru numu no okolo a̱ ta̱ shi, ko vuma ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a ama za na ri na a'wan ushin a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ elime, aza a na o uta̱ diga Masar ee ene iɗa i na n kucinayi na maa ca Ibrahim na̱ Ishiyaku Yakubu shi. <verse eid="NUM 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12" />Babu za ro na a uwa she Keleb ulobo wa̱ Jefune vuma va Keniziya, na̱ Josuwa ulobo wa̱ Nun, adama a na ele ɗa goon a̱ kuruyi A̱sulazuva no okolo a̱ ta̱.&gt; <verse eid="NUM 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ upan na aza a Isra'ila lon, a̱vu u zuwa le e reme igaru a̱tsumona a'wan amunga. Hali she na mantsa ma aza a na a yuwain iwuya e esu a̱ A̱sulazuva mo kotoi.<verse eid="NUM 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14" />&lt;&lt;A̱ɗu ɗa nda gba, umatsun wa̱ a̱za̱ o unusu, u na i ri o una̱ wu nkaya n ɗu, a zuwusa A̱sulazuva a̱ da̱shi yuwusan upan lon na aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="NUM 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15" />Ni i kuɗa̱ a̱ kuru yi, u ta da̱shi lyawa ama a nda a̱tsumona. A̱ɗu ɗa gba yoo o'wo ili i na i ta̱wa̱yi nu ukwa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16" />A̱vu a rawa zuzu na̱ Musa a damma, &lt;&lt;Tsu ta ciga tsu suwaa iliyamunga i tsu uva̱la̱ta̱ pa, ni ilyuci adama a̱ a̱ma̱ci na̱ muwun n tsu. <verse eid="NUM 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17" />A̱ma̱ci a̱ tsu na̱ muwun n tsu a̱ ta̱ da̱nu e ilyuci gbagbain i na i ri uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ kari, adama e megeshe e ekere a̱ a̱za̱ e iɗa'a. Amma a̱tsu tsu tu ufoɓu u na tsaa tara itana yu uvon i tsu a̱vu tsu lyuwa elime a̱ a̱za̱ a̱ tsu aza a Isra'ila, hali she na̱ tsu 'ya̱wa̱ ne ele uba̱ta̱ u le. <verse eid="NUM 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18" />A̱tsu gba tsa̱a̱ ka̱mba̱ a 'wa tsu shi, she mantsa ma na za va Isra'ila suru tsura̱i agadu a̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19" />Tsa̱a̱ ushi agadu oɓolo ne ele ɗe mavada ma̱ Urudu shi, adama a na tsu tsura̱ ta̱ ɗe agadu a̱ tsu upasu wa asana a̱ Urudu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20" />A̱vu Musa damma le, &lt;&lt;Na̱ yaa yuwan ne, i foɓo aciya̱ɗu i 'ya̱wa̱ uvon a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, <verse eid="NUM 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21" />waru na̱ suru nɗu i ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ufoɓu mavada ma̱ Urudu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva hali she nu u gba̱ra̱ n'yuwatan ma̱ yi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi, <verse eid="NUM 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22" />ɗaɗa a mantsa ma na iɗa'a yo o'woi za va̱ A̱sulazuva, reve i ka̱mba̱ a̱vu yoo o'wo fa̱a̱n o ulinga u ɗu u na i yuwayin A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu nzuwulai na ama a Isra'ila. Iɗa i nda gba i to o'wo za ɗu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva.<verse eid="NUM 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23" />&lt;&lt;Amma ni i kuɗa̱ a yuwan ne, i ta yuwaan A̱sulazuva unusu, waru i reve unusu u ɗu u te reme ɗu. <verse eid="NUM 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24" />I suwaa a̱ma̱ci a̱ ɗu na̱ muwun n ɗu ilyuci, nu uva̱la̱ta̱ adama e ikyon i ɗu. Amma i yuwan ili i na i yuwain nzuwulai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25" />A̱vu ama a Gadu na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Roben a damma Musa, &lt;&lt;A̱tsu agbashi a̱ wu tsu ta yuwan cine zagbain tsu dammai. <verse eid="NUM 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26" />Muwun n tsu na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ tsu, ikyon i tsu ni inan i tsu a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ pa e ilyuci ya Giliyadu. <verse eid="NUM 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27" />Amma agbashi a̱ wu, vali suru na ri ufoɓu adama o uvon u ta pasa mavada u yuwan uvon a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, cine zagbain tsu dammai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28" />A̱vu Musa rono Eliyaza ganu, na̱ Josuwa ulobo wa̱ Nun na azagbain a 'wa vu gundo va aza a Isra'ila atsuvu. <verse eid="NUM 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29" />A̱vu u damma le, &lt;&lt;Na ama a Gadu na̱ Roben, vuma na suru ri ufoɓu adama o uvon, u pasa mavada ma̱ Urudu oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, na a lyuwa iɗa'a i ca le iɗa ya aza a Giliyadu wo o'wo za le. <verse eid="NUM 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30" />Agba na a pasa oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu ufoɓu shi, na a ciga a 'yuwan a̱ ushi agadu e le oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu a̱tsuma̱ a Ka'ana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31" />Reve aza a Gadu na aza a Roben a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Agbashi a̱ wu a ta yuwan ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai. <verse eid="NUM 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32" />Tsu ta pasa mavada a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva a uwa a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Ka'ana ufoɓu. Amma itana ya agadu i na tsu tsura̱i o to o'wo pa a̱ mɓa̱nga̱ ma̱ Urudu n nda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33" />A̱vu Musa ca ama a Gadu na ama a̱ Roben, nu uɓatsulai wu ugundo wa Manase ulobo wa̱ Isuhu upasu u tsugono tsa Sihon mogono ma aza a Amoriya, na̱ tsugono tso Og mogono ma Bashan, nɗa'a suru ni ilyuci i gbagbain i le suru.<verse eid="NUM 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34" />A̱vu ama a Gadu a suwisa lyuci va Dibon na̱ Ataro na̱ Arowa, <verse eid="NUM 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35" />na̱ Ataro Shofan, na̱ Jaza na̱ Yogbeha, <verse eid="NUM 32:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36" />na̱ Bet Nimra na̱ Bet Haran, oo o'wo ilyuci i gbagbain i na i ri uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ kari. A̱vu waru a suwaa ikyon i le va̱la̱ta̱. <verse eid="NUM 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37" />A̱vu ama a Roben a suwisa lyuci va Heshibon na̱ Eliyale na̱ Kiriyatayim, <verse eid="NUM 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38" />oɓolo na̱ Nebo na̱ Ba'al Meyo, a vadala ta̱ ala a nda na̱ Sibima. A̱vu a ca ilyuci i na a suwisai'i ala o ro.<verse eid="NUM 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39" />A̱vu umatsun wa Maki mawun ma Manase a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ Giliyadu, a̱vu a lyuwa yi nu uvon, a̱vu a̱ gba̱ra̱ aza a Amoriya a na a̱ da̱na̱i pe. <verse eid="NUM 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40" />A̱vu Musa ca ama a Maki umatsun wa Manase Giliyadu, a̱vu a̱ da̱nu pe. <verse eid="NUM 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41" />Jayi umatsun wa Manase u lyuwa ta̱ mulyuci n le a̱vu u ɗe le Havot Jayi. <verse eid="NUM 32:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42" />A̱vu Noba lyuwa Kena na̱ mulyuci ma̱ yi a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱, a̱vu u ca yi ala Noba o una̱ wa ala a̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 32:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33" />
  <para style="s">Mmalu ma aza a Isra'ila diga Masar a̱ tyo Mowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1" />Apa wukoɗu wukoɗu wu mmalu wa aza a Isra'ila ana o uta̱i diga Masar ugeru ugeru za̱la̱ tsugbain tsa Musa na̱ Haruna. <verse eid="NUM 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2" />Nu udammu wa̱ A̱sulazuva Musa ɗana ta̱ wukoɗu wukoɗu wu mmalu n le. Apa nda mmalu n le ugeru:<verse eid="NUM 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3" />Aza a Isra'ila a̱ 'yon ta̱ diga Ramase o urana wa kupa no ozo oton u woto wu ufaru. Ana usana u tawai ana a yuwain A̱buki a Mapasa, reve o uta̱ babu wovon a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma aza a Masar, <verse eid="NUM 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4" />aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i a̱ ciɗosu muwun mu ufaru n le suru, aza a na A̱sulazuva a̱ ga̱la̱i a̱tsuma̱ e le, adama a na A̱sulazuva e ge'eto ta̱ musula̱ n le.<verse eid="NUM 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5" />Aza a Isra'ila a̱ 'yon ta̱ diga Ramase a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Suko. <verse eid="NUM 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Suko a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Etam, a̱ nge'en ma̱ a̱tsumona. <verse eid="NUM 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Etam, a̱vu a vadala a̱ tyo Pi Hahiro, asana na̱ Ba'al Zefon, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ zuzu na̱ Megido. <verse eid="NUM 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Pi Hahiro, a̱vu a pasalai mala a̱ tyo a̱tsumona. Reve ana a yuwain mmalu rana ta'atsu a̱tsumona a Etam, reve a̱ va̱la̱ Mara. <verse eid="NUM 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Mara a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Elim, uba̱ta̱ u na esu a̱ mini kupa ne ejere na̱ shuwa kupocindere ri, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ ɗe. <verse eid="NUM 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Elim a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ zuzu na̱ Mala ma̱ shili. <verse eid="NUM 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Mala ma̱ shili, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ a̱tsumona a̱ Sin. <verse eid="NUM 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga a̱tsumona a̱ Sin a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Dofuka. <verse eid="NUM 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Dofuka, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ a Alush. <verse eid="NUM 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Alush, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Refidim, uba̱ta̱ u na mini ma̱ shi shi na ama oo sowo. <verse eid="NUM 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Refidim, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ a̱tsumona a Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga a̱tsumona a Sinai, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Kibirot Hatava. <verse eid="NUM 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Kibirot Hatava, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Hazero. <verse eid="NUM 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Hazero, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Ritima. <verse eid="NUM 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Ritima, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Rimon Pere. <verse eid="NUM 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Rimon Pere, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Libina. <verse eid="NUM 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Libina, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Risa. <verse eid="NUM 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Risa, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Kehelata. <verse eid="NUM 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Kehelata, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ a Masasan ma Shife. <verse eid="NUM 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga a Masasan ma Shife, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Harada. <verse eid="NUM 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Harada, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Makelo. <verse eid="NUM 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Makelo, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ a Taha. <verse eid="NUM 33:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Taha, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Tera. <verse eid="NUM 33:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Tera, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Mitika. <verse eid="NUM 33:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Mitika, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Hashimona. <verse eid="NUM 33:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Hashimona, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Mosero. <verse eid="NUM 33:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Mosero, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Bene Ya'aka. <verse eid="NUM 33:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Bene Ya'aka, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Hor Hagiga. <verse eid="NUM 33:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Hor Hagiga, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Yobata. <verse eid="NUM 33:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Yobata, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Aburona. <verse eid="NUM 33:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Aburona, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Eziyon Geba. <verse eid="NUM 33:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Eziyon Geba, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Kedesh, a̱tsumona a̱ Zin. <verse eid="NUM 33:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Kedesh, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ a Masasan mo Hor, o utyo wi iɗa ya Edom. <verse eid="NUM 33:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38" />Nu udammu wa̱ A̱sulazuva Haruna ganu kumba ta̱ Masasan mo Hor, uba̱ta̱ u na u kuwa̱i o urana wu ufaru u woto wa tawun a a'wan a amunga ana aza a Isra'ila o uta̱i e iɗa ya Masar. <verse eid="NUM 33:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39" />Haruna shi ta̱ na a'wan ukpaku nu ushin na aza a ta'atsu (123) mantsa ma na u kuwa̱i a Masasan mo Hor.<verse eid="NUM 33:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40" />Mogono ma Arada vuma va Ka'ana za na ri nden Nege e iɗa ya Ka'ana, wu uwwa ta̱ alabari o uta̱wu wa aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="NUM 33:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41" />A̱vu aza a Isra'ila a̱ 'yon diga a Masasan mo Hor, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Zalumona. <verse eid="NUM 33:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Zalumona, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Funo. <verse eid="NUM 33:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Funo, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Obo. <verse eid="NUM 33:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Obo, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Iye Abarim o utyo wi iɗa ya̱ Mowa. <verse eid="NUM 33:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Iye Abarim, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Dibon Gadu. <verse eid="NUM 33:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Dibon Gadu, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ Alumon Dibilatayim. <verse eid="NUM 33:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga Alumon Dibilatayim, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ a nsasan ma Abarim zuzu na̱ Nebo. <verse eid="NUM 33:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon diga a nsasan ma Abarim, a̱vu a̱ va̱la̱ a agalaci a̱ Mowa zuzu na̱ Urudu, a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ Jeriko. <verse eid="NUM 33:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49" />Ɗe a agalaci a̱ Mowa a̱ va̱la̱ ta̱ zuzu na̱ Urudu diga Bet Jeshimo hali a̱ tyo Abe Shitim.<verse eid="NUM 33:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50" />A agalaci a̱ Mowa zuzu na̱ Urudu mavada ma̱ Jeriko A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱ Musa, <verse eid="NUM 33:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51" />&lt;&lt;Yuwan adanshi na̱ ama a Isra'ila vu damma le, mantsa ma na i pasai Urudu a̱ tyo Ka'ana, <verse eid="NUM 33:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52" />a̱vu i gba̱ra̱ a̱za̱ e iɗa'a suru a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ ɗu. A̱vu yi ɓoso she'en vu ruma na̱ a̱ma̱li e le a na a̱ zuɗa̱i. Reve yi ɓoso ba̱ta̱ va̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ a̱ma̱li e le suru. <verse eid="NUM 33:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53" />A̱vu i tara iɗa'a yo o'wo za ɗu, i da̱nu pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi, adama a na n ca ɗu ta̱ iɗa'a yo o'wo za ɗu. <verse eid="NUM 33:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54" />I ne'eshen iɗa'a na̱ mazuwa ma agita, o una̱ vu gundo ɗu. I ta ca ugundo u na u la'ai a̱bunda̱ agadu a̱ a̱bunda̱, ugundo u wa'a waru i ca yi akunda a wa'a. Uba̱ta̱ u na suru matawa ma agita ma̱ riya̱yi ugundo u to o'wo za le. I ne'eshen iɗa'a o una̱ vu gundo vu nkaya n ɗu.<verse eid="NUM 33:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Amma ni i gba̱ra̱ a̱za̱ e iɗa'a shi, aza a na i lyawai, o to o'wo ɗu muccaka e esu, na awanda a̱ lipu ɗu. O to o'wo ɗu addama e iɗa i na ya̱a̱ da̱nu. <verse eid="NUM 33:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56" />Reve gba n yuwaan na̱ a̱ɗu ili i na n foɓoi a yuwan ne ele.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 33:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34" />
  <para style="s">Utyo wa Ka'ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ Musa, <verse eid="NUM 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2" />&lt;&lt;Vu zuwaa ama a Isra'ila ili i nda vu damma le, a mantsa ma na i uwai e iɗa ya Ka'ana iɗa i na yoo o'wo za ɗu ya agadu, apa cine utyo wi iɗa'a wa̱a̱ da̱na̱.<verse eid="NUM 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3" />&lt;&lt;Upasu wu uyagi u ɗu u te reme diga a̱ a̱tsumona a̱ Zin a rawa utyo wa Edom. Upasu wu uyagi u ɗu u te reme diga o ukosu u Mala ma Akpaɗi na asana. <verse eid="NUM 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4" />Utyo'o u ta vadala u kuru a̱ tyo uyagi, a gawan nu ure wa Akarabim a̱ tyo Zin. A̱vu u reme a̱ tyo uyagi wa Kadesh Baniya. A̱vu u saɓa a̱ tyo Haza Ada, u kuru a̱ tyo Azumon, <verse eid="NUM 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5" />uba̱ta̱ u na waa vadala u ga'asan nu Uɗolu wa Masar, reve u koso a Mala'a.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A̱yi ɗa fo Meditereniya </char></note><verse eid="NUM 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6" />&lt;&lt;Upasu wu utyo wa̱ a̱livu a̱ ɗu u to o'wo nge'en m Mala ma Gbain.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A̱yi ɗa fo Meditereniya </char></note> A̱yi ɗa wo o'wo utyo u ɗu a̱livu.<verse eid="NUM 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7" />&lt;&lt;Utyo u ɗu wu ugana, u ta fara diga a Mala ma Gbain a̱ tyo a Masasan ma Hor. <verse eid="NUM 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8" />Waru diga a Masasan ma Hor a̱ tyo Lebo Hamat, utyo'o u kuru a̱ tyo Zeda, <verse eid="NUM 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9" />a̱vu u kuru a̱ tyo Zifuro. Reve u koso Haza Ena. A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa woo o'wo utyo u ɗu o upasu wu ugana.<verse eid="NUM 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10" />&lt;&lt;Utyo u ɗu wa asana u ta fara diga Haza Ena a̱vu u kuru a̱ tyo Shefam. <verse eid="NUM 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11" />Utyo'o u ta̱ zura̱ diga Shefam a̱ tyo Ribula na asana a Ayin. Reve u kuru a̱ tyo o uzuru wa asana a Mala ma̱ Ga̱lili. <verse eid="NUM 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12" />Reve utyo'o u zura̱ a̱ tyo Urudu a̱vu u koso a Mala ma Akpaɗi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 34:12">&lt;&lt;A̱yi nda u to o'wo iɗa i ɗu, na̱ tyo va̱ yi a̱ mɓa̱nga̱ suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13" />A̱vu Musa damma aza a Isra'ila, &lt;&lt;I ne'eshen iɗa i nda na̱ mazuwa ma agita wo o'wo ɗu agadu. A̱yi ɗa A̱sulazuva a zuwai a ca gundo kucci na akapi. <verse eid="NUM 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14" />Adama a na umatsun wu ugundo wa̱ Roben, nu ugundo wa Gadu nu uɓatsulai wu ugundo wa Manase a̱ ushi ta̱ ɗe agadu e le. <verse eid="NUM 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15" />Gundo re na akapi a nda a̱ ushi ta̱ akunda a agadu e le a̱ mɓa̱nga̱ ma asana ma̱ Urudu va̱ Jeriko, nu upasu wa asana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Azagbain a na ee ne'eshen iɗa'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16" />A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱ Musa, <verse eid="NUM 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17" />&lt;&lt;Nda ala a ama a na aa kamba wu une'esun wa agadu e iɗa'a: Eliyaza ganu na̱ Josuwa ulobo wa̱ Nun. <verse eid="NUM 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18" />Vu ta tara zagbain ta̱ diga o ugundo suru adama a kamba une'esun wi iɗa'a. <verse eid="NUM 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19" />Apa nda ala e le: Keleb ulobo wa̱ Jefune, diga o ugundo wa Yahuza, <verse eid="NUM 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20" />Shemuwe ulobo wa Amihu, diga o ugundo wa Saminu, <verse eid="NUM 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21" />Elida ulobo wa Kisulo diga o ugundo wa Banyami, <verse eid="NUM 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22" />Buki ulobo wa Yogili zagbain vu ugundo wa Dan, <verse eid="NUM 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23" />Haniye ulobo wa Efo zagbain vu ugundo wa Manase ulobo wa̱ Isuhu, <verse eid="NUM 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24" />Kemuwe ulobo wa Shifitan zagbain vu ugundo wa Ifiramu ulobo wa̱ Isuhu, <verse eid="NUM 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25" />Elizafan ulobo wa Fana, zagbain vu ugundo wa̱ Zebulun, <verse eid="NUM 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26" />Palitiye ulobo wa Azan, zagbain vu ugundo wa Isaka, <verse eid="NUM 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27" />Ahihu ulobo wa Shelomi, zagbain vu ugundo wa Asha, <verse eid="NUM 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28" />Fedahe ulobo wa Amihu, zagbain vu ugundo wa Nafutali.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29" />Ele nda ele ɗa ama a na A̱sulazuva a zuwai e ne'esheen ama a Isra'ila agadu e iɗa ya Ka'ana.<verse eid="NUM 34:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35" />
  <para style="s">Ilyuci adama a nan Levi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma Musa ɗe a agalaci a̱ Mowa asana na̱ Urudu a̱ nka̱la̱la̱i na̱ Jeriko u damma, <verse eid="NUM 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2" />&lt;&lt;Damma aza a Isra'ila a ca nan Levi ilyuci i na a̱a̱ da̱nu a̱tsuma̱ a agadu a na aza a Isra'ila a̱a̱ tsura̱. Waru a ca le uba̱ta̱ wa alyuna uka̱nda̱ruwu ni ilyuci'i. <verse eid="NUM 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3" />Adama a̱ tsura̱ ilyuci i na a̱a̱ da̱nu, ni iɗa ya alyuna adama e inan i le na akapi e iliyamunga i na a̱ ri ne ele suru. <verse eid="NUM 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4" />Washin wu uba̱ta̱ wa alyuna u na u ri uka̱nda̱ruwu ni ilyuci i na yaa ca nan Levi, u ta rawa udasuwu ukpakukupa nu ukpakuton (1,500) uka̱nda̱ruwu nu uɓaɓu u lyuci'i. <verse eid="NUM 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5" />A̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ lyuci'i i rito udasuwu ukpakukupa uta'atsu (3,000) upasu wa asana, udasuwu ukpakukupa uta'atsu (3,000) upasu wu uyagi, nu udasuwu ukpakukupa uta'atsu (3,000) upasu wa̱ a̱livu, waru udasuwu ukpakukupa uta'atsu (3,000) upasu wu ugana, lyuci'i u da̱na̱ e memere. Uba̱ta̱ u nda u to o'wo le uba̱ta̱ wa alyuna adama e ilyuci'i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilyuci i mapa'an</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 19:1-13">U.Wl 19:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Jos 20:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6" />&lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci i na yaa ca nan Levi a̱za̱ a̱ ta̱li o to o'wo ilyuci i mapa'an, uba̱ta̱ u na za na unai vuma a suma a̱ tyo. Babu na̱ ne a̱ ta̱ da̱shi ca le ilyuci i gbagbain amunga ne ejere. <verse eid="NUM 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:7" />Suru suru i ta ca nan Levi ilyuci amunga na̱ kunla̱, oɓolo nu uba̱ta̱ wa alyuna u le. <verse eid="NUM 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8" />Ilyuci i na yaa ca nan Levi diga a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na aza a Isra'ila a̱ tsura̱i a ta ca o una̱ wa agadu wu ugundo biti. I tara ilyuci ya̱ a̱bunda̱ diga o ugundo u na u ri ne ele a̱bunda̱, amma i tara meketeci a̱tsuma̱ a aza a na a̱ ri na̱ a̱yi wa'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma Musa: <verse eid="NUM 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10" />Yuwan adanshi na ama a Isra'ila vu damma le, &lt;&lt;Mantsa ma na i pasai Urudu a̱ tyo e iɗa ya Ka'ana, <verse eid="NUM 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11" />i ɗangulaa aciya̱ɗu ilyuci i na yoo o'wo ɗu upa'atan uba̱ta̱ u na za na unai vuma nu ucigu wa̱ yi shi waa suma a̱ tyo. <verse eid="NUM 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12" />Ilyuci'i i to o'wo ɗu upa'atan diga e ekere a za na aa zama u tsupa, adama ta̱wa̱ o una za na a zuwusa wu unai vuma'a kafu wi isawan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma ama na aa yuwaan yi uge'etosu wan. <verse eid="NUM 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13" />I ɗangula ilyuci i ta̱li i na yoo o'wo ɗu upa'atan. <verse eid="NUM 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14" />I ca ilyuci i ta'atsu yu upa'atan e eɓele a̱ Urudu aza a ta'atsu waru e eɓele a Ka'ana. <verse eid="NUM 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15" />Ilyuci i ta̱li i nda o to o'wo upa'atan wa aza a Isra'ila, no omocin na akapi a ama a na a̱ ri nden oɓolo ne ele, adama za na suru unai za ro nu ucigu shi u ta gura suma a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ɗe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Amma na̱ vuma ga̱la̱ za ro na̱ rumu hali u kuwa̱, wo o'wo ta̱ za mona. A̱ to una fo za mona'a. <verse eid="NUM 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 35:17" />Ko na̱ za ro vara nanza na aatali hali u kuwa̱, wo o'wo ta̱ za mona. A̱ to una fo za mona'a. <verse eid="NUM 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:18" />Ko na̱ za faba nanza na aaɗanga hali u kuwa̱, wo o'wo ta̱ za mona. A̱ to una fo za mona'a. <verse eid="NUM 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19" />Imaci i zuzu yi za na o unai na waa ciga u tsupaa mpasa mu za va̱ yi, u to una za mona'a nu u cina yi. <verse eid="NUM 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20" />Ne ɗa na̱ nanza adama a n'yuwunlai u vawan a̱vu u sapa nanza, ko u vara nanza hali u kuwa̱, <verse eid="NUM 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21" />ko a̱tsuma̱ a̱ i'ima̱ u lapa nanza na̱ lyukuku hali u kuwa̱, a̱ to una vuma ndolo, a̱yi za mona ma ɗa. Za na cigai u tsupaa mpasa mu za va̱ yi u to una za mona'a nu u cina yi.<verse eid="NUM 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Amma na̱ za ro una vuma a̱tsuma̱ e i'ima̱ shi, ko u keɓe yi nu ucira shi, ko na̱ mavara nu ucigu shi, <verse eid="NUM 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 35:23" />ko we ene yi shi, a̱vu u vara yi na aatali a na oo una yi a̱vu gba u kuwa̱, to, a na u ri ma'yuwatan ma̱ yi shi, waru u ri na̱ majiyan ma na waa amaton yi shi, <verse eid="NUM 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:24" />iɓolo ya ama i ta yuwaan le uge'etosu na̱ a̱yi za na unai vuma na̱ za na cigai u tsupaa mpasa mu za va̱ yi. A ta yuwaan le uge'etosu'u na̱ wila̱ u na a zuwai u nda. <verse eid="NUM 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25" />Iɓolo ya ama i te geshe za na unai vuma'a, diga e ekere a za na cigai u tsupaa mpasa mu za va̱ yi'i. A̱ ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ za na unai vuma'a a̱ lyuci mapa'an ma na u sumai a̱ tyo. U ta̱ da̱nu pe hali she mantsa ma na ganu gbain na a̱ tsuwa̱yin mani'in ma akiza kuwa̱i.<verse eid="NUM 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Agba na̱ mantsa mo ro za na unai vuma'a wu uta̱ o utyo u lyuci mapa'an na u sumai a̱ tyo, <verse eid="NUM 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27" />reve za na cigai u tsupaa mpasa mu za va̱ yi cina yi a alanga a̱ lyuci'i, za na cigai u tsupaa mpasa mu za va̱ yi'i u ta gura una yi, agba wa̱a̱ da̱na̱ nu unusu shi. <verse eid="NUM 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28" />Adama a na za na unai vuma'a nu u ciga u 'yuwan wi isawan pe a̱ lyuci'i hali she na̱ ganu gbain kuwa̱. Na̱ ganu gbai'in kuwa̱ u ta gura ka̱mba̱ e iɗa ya̱ yi.<verse eid="NUM 35:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Ili i na a zuwai nda u ta̱ da̱na̱ a aci a̱ ɗu diga a mantsa hali a tyo mantsa, uba̱ta̱ u na i da̱nuyi suru.<verse eid="NUM 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Za na unai vuma suru a̱ to una yi na ama o ro o roco e ene yi ta̱, a̱ to una yi o una̱ wu urevu u na aza a na a̱ shi lo a dammai. Amma she o una nanza o una̱ wa adanshi a vuma ta̱ wan.<verse eid="NUM 35:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31" />&lt;&lt; &lt;She i ushi ikebe adama a atsupu a wuma wu za mona wan, za na ntsayi u kuwa̱, na a ciga a 'yuwan o una yi. <verse eid="NUM 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32" />Ne ɗa waru she i ushi ikebe adama a wawa za na sumai a̱ tyo a̱ lyuci mapa'an wan, ta̱wa̱ u ta̱wa̱ u ka̱mba̱ u da̱nu e iɗa ya̱ yi kafu ganu gbain kuwa̱ wan. <verse eid="NUM 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33" />She i ka̱mbuwa̱ iɗa i na i ri nden idaba wan. Adama a na wocosu wu mpasa u tsu ka̱mba̱to ta̱ iɗa idaba, agba kucci matara mo ume mo unusu lo na aa yuwan adama e iɗa i na o ocoi mpasa'a shi, she na̱ mpasa mu za na ocoi mpasa'a. <verse eid="NUM 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34" />She yo o'woto iɗa i na i ri na̱ nden idaba wan. Adama a na a̱mu A̱sulazuva n ta̱ nden e memere ma ama a Isra'ila.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="NUM 35:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36" />
  <para style="s">Agadu a̱ a̱ma̱ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1" />Reve azagbain o ugundo wa Giliyadu ulobo wa Maki, ulobo wa Manase, a̱za̱ o ugundo wu umatsun wa̱ Isuhu, a̱ ta̱wa̱ a yuwan adanshi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma Musa na azagbain a 'wa va aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="NUM 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2" />A damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a damma wu ta̱ zagbain tsu vu ne'eshen aza a Isra'ila iɗa agadu na̱ mazuwa ma agita. U zuwa wu ta̱ vu ca esheli a Zelofeha agadu a mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ tsu. <verse eid="NUM 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3" />Amma no o olo ta̱ ali a̱tsuma̱ o gundo ro va aza a Isra'ila, to, reve a tara agadu a na a ca nle diga a agadu a nkaya n tsu o ɓolo na agadu o ugundo u na o oloi. Ne ɗa ee kene a̱tsuma̱ a agadu a̱ tsu. <verse eid="NUM 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4" />Reve mantsa ma na A'wan a̱ A̱buki o uka̱mbusa̱ fa̱a̱n va aza a Isra'ila a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱i, o to ɓolo agadu e le na agadu o ugundo u na oloi, reve a tara itana i le diga a agadu o ugundo wu nkaya n tsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5" />Ɗaɗa Musa zuwai ama a Isra'ila o udammu wa̱ A̱sulazuva u damma: &lt;&lt;Ili i na ugundo wu umatsun wa̱ Isuhu u dammai mejege ma ɗa. <verse eid="NUM 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6" />Apa nda ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai o una̱ we esheli a Zelofeha, &lt;Lyawa nle o olo za na a cigai o olo suru, amma wo o'wo a̱tsuma̱ o ugundo wu nkaya n le. <verse eid="NUM 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7" />Aa vadala agadu a aza a Isra'ila diga o ugundo u ro a̱ tyo o ugundo u ro shi, adama a na za va Isra'ila suru ta̱ guza̱ agadu a nkaya ma̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8" />Usheli u na suru u lyuwai agadu a̱tsuma̱ o ugundo wa aza a Isra'ila biti nu u ciga u 'yuwan wo olo a̱tsuma̱ o ugundo wu nkaya ma̱ yi, adama za va Isra'ila suru u lyuwa agadu a nkaya ma̱ yi. <verse eid="NUM 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9" />Ne ɗa aa tara agadu a̱ tyo a agadu o ro shi, adama a na ugundo wa Isra'ila biti u ta̱ guza̱ agadu a̱ yi.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="NUM 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10" />Reve esheli a Zelofeha a yuwan cine A̱sulazuva a dammai Musa. <verse eid="NUM 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:11" />Adama a na Mala na̱ Tiriza na̱ Hogula na̱ Milika, na̱ Nowa, suru nle o olo ta̱ olobo a̱ muwun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma dada le. <verse eid="NUM 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12" />O olo ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ o gundo vu umatsun wa Manase ulobo wa̱ Isuhu. A̱vu agadu e le o o'wo a̱tsuma̱ o umatsun wu ugundo wu nkaya n le. <verse eid="NUM 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13" />Ele nda ele ɗa ili i na a zuwai ni ili i na aa yuwan i na A̱sulazuva a zuwai o una̱ wa Musa ele uva̱lu a agalaci a̱ Mowa zuzu na̱ Urudu a̱ nka̱la̱la̱i na̱ Jeriko.<verse eid="NUM 36:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36" />
</usx>